(478409, 46286, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yes, the body is sacred to most, just don''t tell mine, okay?  a good idea and having the model in the crucified position is a nice touch but the shot really doesn''t do much for me, not enough contrast and light.  A 4</td>', 'Yes, the body is sacred to most, just don''t tell mine, okay?  a good idea and having the model in the crucified position is a nice touch but the shot really doesn''t do much for me, not enough contrast and light.  A 4', '2003-11-10 00:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(478413, 46291, 9441, '<td valign="top">nice lighting.  wonderful choice for your subject in this shot...the curves make this a very interesting photo!  10</td>', 'nice lighting.  wonderful choice for your subject in this shot...the curves make this a very interesting photo!  10', '2003-11-10 00:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
