(478465, 46285, 12253, '<td valign="top">I  think my wife and kids would agree (on any such place--I don''t know that one).</td>', 'I  think my wife and kids would agree (on any such place--I don''t know that one).', '2003-11-10 01:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(478467, 45268, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, a bit overexposed in the windows.  Difficult exposure but you might have caught it at a different time of day.</td>', 'Nice shot, a bit overexposed in the windows.  Difficult exposure but you might have caught it at a different time of day.', '2003-11-10 01:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(478469, 46269, 12253, '<td valign="top">Shadow detail could have been brought out via a different exposure; I can''t see the statute, and I don''t know this place (a church?).  The symbol on the right should have been included in it''s entirety.  I''m not really sure what you are trying for here, sorry.  I hope you find this crit constructive,</td>', 'Shadow detail could have been brought out via a different exposure; I can''t see the statute, and I don''t know this place (a church?).  The symbol on the right should have been included in it''s entirety.  I''m not really sure what you are trying for here, sorry.  I hope you find this crit constructive,', '2003-11-10 01:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(478471, 45237, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, and glad to see other places besides religious as sacrad.  I think I would have cropped a bit more at top.  While it would have centered the tree, I think it would have been a better choice here for using the cave entrance as a frame.</td>', 'Nice shot, and glad to see other places besides religious as sacrad.  I think I would have cropped a bit more at top.  While it would have centered the tree, I think it would have been a better choice here for using the cave entrance as a frame.', '2003-11-10 01:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(478472, 45665, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent light and tones.</td>', 'Excellent light and tones.', '2003-11-10 01:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
