(478542, 46219, 13440, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a little overexposed. Reduce 0.5 - 1.0 stop would help.</td>', 'I think it''s a little overexposed. Reduce 0.5 - 1.0 stop would help.', '2003-11-10 03:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
