(478546, 46181, 13440, '<td valign="top">Do you think it''d be better if you can capture the whole tample? (Left)<br/>Anyway, nice color... Well done!</td>', 'Do you think it''d be better if you can capture the whole tample? (Left)Anyway, nice color... Well done!', '2003-11-10 03:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
