(478550, 46332, 13440, '<td valign="top">Very nice church, I like the pattern on it. Nice color and contrast.<br/>I supposed you\''ve taken the shot in the evening or morning... Well Done.</td>', 'Very nice church, I like the pattern on it. Nice color and contrast.I supposed you\''ve taken the shot in the evening or morning... Well Done.', '2003-11-10 03:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
