(478564, 46215, 13440, '<td valign="top">Nice composition!! The light came through the clouds. The color is nice, too<br/>Very well done!</td>', 'Nice composition!! The light came through the clouds. The color is nice, tooVery well done!', '2003-11-10 04:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(478570, 46130, 2553, '<td valign="top">Sacred seems to mean quite different things to different people, so in that context, this does meet the challenge.  I really like the soft focus, and the "warm glow" feeling of the shot.  However, overall, the shot does not have a lot of impact for me.  There is really nothing in particular that serves as a "subject" or place of interest to focus on.</td>', 'Sacred seems to mean quite different things to different people, so in that context, this does meet the challenge.  I really like the soft focus, and the "warm glow" feeling of the shot.  However, overall, the shot does not have a lot of impact for me.  There is really nothing in particular that serves as a "subject" or place of interest to focus on.', '2003-11-10 05:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(478571, 46298, 2553, '<td valign="top">Certainly meets the challenge, in my opinion.  Your available light is great, but I think a shallow depth of field would have served better in this case.  I''m not crazy about the angle the photo was shot at, I find the composition to be somewhat distracting.</td>', 'Certainly meets the challenge, in my opinion.  Your available light is great, but I think a shallow depth of field would have served better in this case.  I''m not crazy about the angle the photo was shot at, I find the composition to be somewhat distracting.', '2003-11-10 05:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(478573, 46281, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''m not particularly fond of photos of statues or statuettes,  but I do like that you used a very light background for your shot;  and the positive/negative feel does add some interest.  I have to say, though, that overall, this shot does not have a lot of impact for me. I certainly agree with the concept that "family" is sacred, however I do not construe that concept, through this photo, to represent a "sacred place".</td>', 'I''m not particularly fond of photos of statues or statuettes,  but I do like that you used a very light background for your shot;  and the positive/negative feel does add some interest.  I have to say, though, that overall, this shot does not have a lot of impact for me. I certainly agree with the concept that "family" is sacred, however I do not construe that concept, through this photo, to represent a "sacred place".', '2003-11-10 05:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(478574, 46132, 2553, '<td valign="top">Though I love the look of the windows against the dark background, I can barely make out the outline of the steeple, and for me,  the photo is just too dark overall  to be able to appreciate any of it!   I would love to have  been able to make out more of the architecture of the building.</td>', 'Though I love the look of the windows against the dark background, I can barely make out the outline of the steeple, and for me,  the photo is just too dark overall  to be able to appreciate any of it!   I would love to have  been able to make out more of the architecture of the building.', '2003-11-10 05:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(478575, 46286, 2553, '<td valign="top">Though I suppose I would classify the human body as "sacred", I would not classify it as a "sacred place"!   Your lighting is pretty good, but I''m not crazy about the composition - it looks a little odd to me, to have just "part" of a body in the shot.</td>', 'Though I suppose I would classify the human body as "sacred", I would not classify it as a "sacred place"!   Your lighting is pretty good, but I''m not crazy about the composition - it looks a little odd to me, to have just "part" of a body in the shot.', '2003-11-10 05:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(478576, 45875, 2553, '<td valign="top">Absolutely breathtaking.  If this is your morning spot, then I am quite jealous of the blessing you have of being located there!  I love the colors, and the composition of the shot.</td>', 'Absolutely breathtaking.  If this is your morning spot, then I am quite jealous of the blessing you have of being located there!  I love the colors, and the composition of the shot.', '2003-11-10 05:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(478577, 46219, 2553, '<td valign="top">What a lovely church!  The architecture is wonderful, and lighting gives it a beautiful warm glow.  I really do like the composition, with all of the great repetitive patterns and lines.  One of my favorite shots.</td>', 'What a lovely church!  The architecture is wonderful, and lighting gives it a beautiful warm glow.  I really do like the composition, with all of the great repetitive patterns and lines.  One of my favorite shots.', '2003-11-10 05:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(478578, 45700, 2553, '<td valign="top">This is quite an amazing shot!  I''m guessing that the incredible color is from the northern lights.  If so, you certainly had an impressive view of them.  Awesome shot, one of my favorites.</td>', 'This is quite an amazing shot!  I''m guessing that the incredible color is from the northern lights.  If so, you certainly had an impressive view of them.  Awesome shot, one of my favorites.', '2003-11-10 05:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(478579, 45912, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love the lines, patterns and shadows in this shot, and black and white was the perfect treatment for it.  Interesting to look at, and certainly meets the challenge well.</td>', 'I love the lines, patterns and shadows in this shot, and black and white was the perfect treatment for it.  Interesting to look at, and certainly meets the challenge well.', '2003-11-10 05:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(478584, 45700, 7263, '<td valign="top">Good Points:Awsome cloud form - great eye! Almost space like - a sure top 3 if not 1.<br/>Bad Points:looks kind of stretched, but guess that can''t be helped.<br/>Final Score::9</td>', 'Good Points:Awsome cloud form - great eye! Almost space like - a sure top 3 if not 1.Bad Points:looks kind of stretched, but guess that can''t be helped.Final Score::9', '2003-11-10 06:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
