(478586, 46237, 7263, '<td valign="top">Good Points:agree with the sacred place! Course is in great condition and looks quite a challenge.<br/>Bad Points:would have cropped a bit off the bottom and taken at a time when lighting was more dramatic<br/>Final Score::6</td>', 'Good Points:agree with the sacred place! Course is in great condition and looks quite a challenge.Bad Points:would have cropped a bit off the bottom and taken at a time when lighting was more dramaticFinal Score::6', '2003-11-10 06:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(478589, 46261, 12733, '<td valign="top">Pretty fall colors, attractive buildings. Very nice. I would have tried to get more reflection, possibly to include some of the colors of the leaves.</td>', 'Pretty fall colors, attractive buildings. Very nice. I would have tried to get more reflection, possibly to include some of the colors of the leaves.', '2003-11-10 06:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(478591, 46252, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful golden color. Was this a result of the white balance setting or post processing?</td>', 'Beautiful golden color. Was this a result of the white balance setting or post processing?', '2003-11-10 06:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(478592, 45939, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty lighting and colors</td>', 'Very pretty lighting and colors', '2003-11-10 06:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(478593, 46215, 12733, '<td valign="top">I love the breaks of sun through the clouds. Was the overall blue cast added during post-processing?</td>', 'I love the breaks of sun through the clouds. Was the overall blue cast added during post-processing?', '2003-11-10 07:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(478594, 46132, 12578, '<td valign="top">The light at the bottom should either be in the shot or out of the shot- where it is located at teh minute it is drawing my eye away from the shot itself. the brick work could do with being a little lighter ( bringing up the levels ) and the church spire is just cut off the top of the shot which again spoils it a little. Overall a great image and I like the way the statue has a good silhouette ( would look better with the levels Idea I mention - I think ! ;0) 6</td>', 'The light at the bottom should either be in the shot or out of the shot- where it is located at teh minute it is drawing my eye away from the shot itself. the brick work could do with being a little lighter ( bringing up the levels ) and the church spire is just cut off the top of the shot which again spoils it a little. Overall a great image and I like the way the statue has a good silhouette ( would look better with the levels Idea I mention - I think ! ;0) 6', '2003-11-10 07:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(478596, 46017, 12733, '<td valign="top">Excellent choice of framing or crop, and beautiful colors and textures. A nice contrast of bold and delicate color.</td>', 'Excellent choice of framing or crop, and beautiful colors and textures. A nice contrast of bold and delicate color.', '2003-11-10 07:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(478598, 46240, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice combination of color and black and white, but too much blank blue sky for my taste.</td>', 'Nice combination of color and black and white, but too much blank blue sky for my taste.', '2003-11-10 07:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(478599, 46191, 12578, '<td valign="top">The light on the right is very distracting ! Nice composition although I would prefer to see a little space just above the spires as it looks like they are cropped a little too short ( perhaps missing the very top of them )</td>', 'The light on the right is very distracting ! Nice composition although I would prefer to see a little space just above the spires as it looks like they are cropped a little too short ( perhaps missing the very top of them )', '2003-11-10 07:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(478600, 45939, 12578, '<td valign="top">great composition and I especially love the way you got down low to get a good aspect of the fallen leaves in. Just a shame you hadn''t snapped a little sooner when the clouds were a little moodier over to the right ! Perhaps im wrong on the direction of them but had they been over teh church / cathedral it would have been a really picturesque moody sort of image. good job - 8</td>', 'great composition and I especially love the way you got down low to get a good aspect of the fallen leaves in. Just a shame you hadn''t snapped a little sooner when the clouds were a little moodier over to the right ! Perhaps im wrong on the direction of them but had they been over teh church / cathedral it would have been a really picturesque moody sort of image. good job - 8', '2003-11-10 07:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(478602, 46341, 12733, '<td valign="top">Too much dark relative to the light for my taste.</td>', 'Too much dark relative to the light for my taste.', '2003-11-10 07:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(478604, 46201, 12578, '<td valign="top">your title reverts me to the barn yet it is the barn which is not on focus. Nice Autumn colours here and a great crop - perhaps you intended it this way and im being old fashioned but...  ( Because its a different approach to "Sacred" that no one else has done ) Good effort - 6</td>', 'your title reverts me to the barn yet it is the barn which is not on focus. Nice Autumn colours here and a great crop - perhaps you intended it this way and im being old fashioned but...  ( Because its a different approach to "Sacred" that no one else has done ) Good effort - 6', '2003-11-10 07:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(478605, 45993, 12733, '<td valign="top">The framing tree is a nice touch, but the total lack of detail in it, and the way it extends across the other trees loses something. Perhaps taking the photo from a lower position, pointing up, and a tighter crop at the left would improve it.</td>', 'The framing tree is a nice touch, but the total lack of detail in it, and the way it extends across the other trees loses something. Perhaps taking the photo from a lower position, pointing up, and a tighter crop at the left would improve it.', '2003-11-10 07:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
