(478900, 46335, 327, '<td valign="top">Wow, very sad and touching. Written from the heart by someone [?] <br/></td>', 'Wow, very sad and touching. Written from the heart by someone [?] ', '2003-11-10 12:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(478904, 46287, 10151, '<td valign="top">Great composition, but I think its a bit over-exposed.  The grassy knoll it washed out. 6</td>', 'Great composition, but I think its a bit over-exposed.  The grassy knoll it washed out. 6', '2003-11-10 12:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(478905, 45391, 7485, '<td valign="top">Beautifully composed and I like the framing. I would have used a small spotlight to add more definition to the foam.</td>', 'Beautifully composed and I like the framing. I would have used a small spotlight to add more definition to the foam.', '2003-11-10 12:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(478908, 46254, 327, '<td valign="top">Please don''t be insulted by my lack of knowledge. I had to look this up on google to know what is it. Wow....talk about an old history. It was built to last. Wonderful stone and windows. Love the b&amp;w. Thanks for this I really like it and think it fits the challenge well.</td>', 'Please don''t be insulted by my lack of knowledge. I had to look this up on google to know what is it. Wow....talk about an old history. It was built to last. Wonderful stone and windows. Love the b&w. Thanks for this I really like it and think it fits the challenge well.', '2003-11-10 12:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(478911, 45268, 327, '<td valign="top">Luscious looking chapel. You did a good job, I would imagine the lighting was not easy to work with.</td>', 'Luscious looking chapel. You did a good job, I would imagine the lighting was not easy to work with.', '2003-11-10 13:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(478912, 46265, 4388, '<td valign="top">I like the image, but I don''t understand why you have water on the cross, it doesn''t seem to fit.</td>', 'I like the image, but I don''t understand why you have water on the cross, it doesn''t seem to fit.', '2003-11-10 13:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(478916, 46272, 327, '<td valign="top">Very nice crop and composition. Good job.</td>', 'Very nice crop and composition. Good job.', '2003-11-10 13:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(478917, 46343, 327, '<td valign="top">Artistic shot, and I like it very much. Good job.</td>', 'Artistic shot, and I like it very much. Good job.', '2003-11-10 13:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(478918, 46115, 327, '<td valign="top">How lucky you are to have been there, it must of been very emotional. Good capture of the feeling that must be there.</td>', 'How lucky you are to have been there, it must of been very emotional. Good capture of the feeling that must be there.', '2003-11-10 13:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(478919, 46331, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty photo and I like the crop and lighting. Nice work.</td>', 'Pretty photo and I like the crop and lighting. Nice work.', '2003-11-10 13:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(478920, 46219, 11155, '<td valign="top">Good colors and interesting lines.  Good luck!</td>', 'Good colors and interesting lines.  Good luck!', '2003-11-10 13:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(478921, 45691, 327, '<td valign="top">Good title but the shot is just not appealing to me. The coffee cup is out of focus and it''s dirty looking. Sorry. Your idea was good.</td>', 'Good title but the shot is just not appealing to me. The coffee cup is out of focus and it''s dirty looking. Sorry. Your idea was good.', '2003-11-10 13:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(478923, 46281, 327, '<td valign="top">I like your idea but I think the execution falls short. We don''t really see a circle from this perspective. There isn''t enough of any ''one'' to get the concept. Sorry.</td>', 'I like your idea but I think the execution falls short. We don''t really see a circle from this perspective. There isn''t enough of any ''one'' to get the concept. Sorry.', '2003-11-10 13:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(478924, 45823, 327, '<td valign="top">Kool fisheye!</td>', 'Kool fisheye!', '2003-11-10 13:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(478925, 46281, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done photo, but relying entirely on the beauty of a statue is difficult. This would be a perfect shot for a catalog selling the statue, but it seems to be missing some spark of photographic creativity.</td>', 'Very nicely done photo, but relying entirely on the beauty of a statue is difficult. This would be a perfect shot for a catalog selling the statue, but it seems to be missing some spark of photographic creativity.', '2003-11-10 13:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(478926, 46244, 327, '<td valign="top">lol If your a Martian. :) it''s a nice shot, good lens.</td>', 'lol If your a Martian. :) it''s a nice shot, good lens.', '2003-11-10 13:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(478928, 46221, 327, '<td valign="top">Very pretty spot...wow nice shooting.</td>', 'Very pretty spot...wow nice shooting.', '2003-11-10 13:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(478929, 46252, 10151, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF of this shot (could have worked for the Infinity challenge too), but the photo seems very yellow.  White balance could be adjusted. 6</td>', 'I like the DOF of this shot (could have worked for the Infinity challenge too), but the photo seems very yellow.  White balance could be adjusted. 6', '2003-11-10 13:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(478930, 45945, 11155, '<td valign="top">Love the light of the candles, and very non-traditional (I like that too).  Hopefully, voters understand this image and don''t think it''s satanic...  Nice work, good luck.</td>', 'Love the light of the candles, and very non-traditional (I like that too).  Hopefully, voters understand this image and don''t think it''s satanic...  Nice work, good luck.', '2003-11-10 13:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(478931, 46036, 7485, '<td valign="top">Couldn''t agree more with your sentiment, but the photo is a little dull. A touch of sunshine would have helped, but increased contrast and saturation might also help.</td>', 'Couldn''t agree more with your sentiment, but the photo is a little dull. A touch of sunshine would have helped, but increased contrast and saturation might also help.', '2003-11-10 13:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(478932, 46130, 11155, '<td valign="top">Nice take on the challenge.  I like the warm colors and the ''dreamy'' effect of the blur.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice take on the challenge.  I like the warm colors and the ''dreamy'' effect of the blur.  Good luck.', '2003-11-10 13:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(478936, 46268, 11155, '<td valign="top">I like the B&amp;W aspect of this.  Very sharp.</td>', 'I like the B&W aspect of this.  Very sharp.', '2003-11-10 13:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(478937, 46146, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful camera positioning and good cropping. Nice shot I like this one.</td>', 'Wonderful camera positioning and good cropping. Nice shot I like this one.', '2003-11-10 13:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(478938, 45700, 10151, '<td valign="top">WOW! Truely amazing capture of a sunset! Being in the presence of such sights is truely Sacred and you''ve done a awsome job of capturing it! 9</td>', 'WOW! Truely amazing capture of a sunset! Being in the presence of such sights is truely Sacred and you''ve done a awsome job of capturing it! 9', '2003-11-10 13:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(478939, 46341, 11155, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that this is non-traditional lighting.  So many church pictures in this challenge, this stands out.  I like Orion''s belt there too!  Good luck.</td>', 'I like the fact that this is non-traditional lighting.  So many church pictures in this challenge, this stands out.  I like Orion''s belt there too!  Good luck.', '2003-11-10 13:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(478940, 45874, 10151, '<td valign="top">The concept is valid and I love the humor! However, the high key isn''t realy working for me with this shot. 5 for the effort.</td>', 'The concept is valid and I love the humor! However, the high key isn''t realy working for me with this shot. 5 for the effort.', '2003-11-10 13:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(478941, 46319, 327, '<td valign="top">Very wonderful. Love the b&amp;w. 29 and four kids....yikes! Terrilbe loss of life. Good crop and light.</td>', 'Very wonderful. Love the b&w. 29 and four kids....yikes! Terrilbe loss of life. Good crop and light.', '2003-11-10 13:16:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(478942, 46101, 11155, '<td valign="top">I really like this, but the steeple seems crooked.  Very sharp, nice lighting.  Good luck.</td>', 'I really like this, but the steeple seems crooked.  Very sharp, nice lighting.  Good luck.', '2003-11-10 13:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(478943, 46132, 10151, '<td valign="top">The crop is a little tight on the top and bottom for me.  The exposure is really hard to call on this shot due tot he bright lights coming from the steeples.  Good shot over all.</td>', 'The crop is a little tight on the top and bottom for me.  The exposure is really hard to call on this shot due tot he bright lights coming from the steeples.  Good shot over all.', '2003-11-10 13:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(478944, 46250, 327, '<td valign="top">Beautiful building and tones.</td>', 'Beautiful building and tones.', '2003-11-10 13:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(478945, 46144, 11155, '<td valign="top">I think you were going for a non-traditional composition on this, but it just makes me feel like I''m falling over in my chair.  Lighting is nice.</td>', 'I think you were going for a non-traditional composition on this, but it just makes me feel like I''m falling over in my chair.  Lighting is nice.', '2003-11-10 13:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(478946, 45823, 675, '<td valign="top">very overexposed fisheye doesn''t add anything to the composition...3</td>', 'very overexposed fisheye doesn''t add anything to the composition...3', '2003-11-10 13:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(478947, 46253, 11155, '<td valign="top">Image is a little small.  The subject(s) aren''t that interesting, but the composition/point of view is interesting.</td>', 'Image is a little small.  The subject(s) aren''t that interesting, but the composition/point of view is interesting.', '2003-11-10 13:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(478948, 46184, 675, '<td valign="top">very nice...7</td>', 'very nice...7', '2003-11-10 13:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(478949, 45945, 10151, '<td valign="top">A wonderful alter!  The crop is a bit tight for my liking, but the exposure is great.</td>', 'A wonderful alter!  The crop is a bit tight for my liking, but the exposure is great.', '2003-11-10 13:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(478950, 46078, 327, '<td valign="top">Wow the lightposts and the fog are really cool. Nice crop.</td>', 'Wow the lightposts and the fog are really cool. Nice crop.', '2003-11-10 13:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(478952, 46181, 10151, '<td valign="top">Wish there was more of the temple to see in this photo.  The exposure is good and the colors are wonderful, but the composition is lacking. 4</td>', 'Wish there was more of the temple to see in this photo.  The exposure is good and the colors are wonderful, but the composition is lacking. 4', '2003-11-10 13:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(478955, 45918, 11155, '<td valign="top">Image is great - love the reflection.  I''m not getting a sense of a place that is "Sacred" though.  I guess this is in nature, but without the title, I just don''t see it.  Still a magnificent image though.</td>', 'Image is great - love the reflection.  I''m not getting a sense of a place that is "Sacred" though.  I guess this is in nature, but without the title, I just don''t see it.  Still a magnificent image though.', '2003-11-10 13:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
