(478968, 45268, 10151, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully composed, but seems a bit over-exposed due to the fuzzy windows.  I''ve had better luck under-exposing photos then bright/contrast in PS or PSP. 6</td>', 'Wonderfully composed, but seems a bit over-exposed due to the fuzzy windows.  I''ve had better luck under-exposing photos then bright/contrast in PS or PSP. 6', '2003-11-10 13:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
