(478987, 46087, 6458, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this picture, but it''s suffering from a lot of noise - I''m not sure why tho. Possibly a low quality digicam?</td>', 'I like the idea of this picture, but it''s suffering from a lot of noise - I''m not sure why tho. Possibly a low quality digicam?', '2003-11-10 14:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
