(479022, 45665, 6130, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.</td>', 'Fantastic.', '2003-11-10 14:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(479023, 46191, 12045, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, I really like the lighting on the building.  The gate light or whatever light it is that seems to be very bright at the lower right of the picture should have been cropped out I think.  Other than that its a great shot with very nice colors.  I really like the color of the sky.</td>', 'Nice picture, I really like the lighting on the building.  The gate light or whatever light it is that seems to be very bright at the lower right of the picture should have been cropped out I think.  Other than that its a great shot with very nice colors.  I really like the color of the sky.', '2003-11-10 14:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
