(479029, 46244, 12045, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the moon!  It must have been very bright on the night of this photograph.  I can''t see another light in the sky.  That makes this a very nice picture.</td>', 'Great shot of the moon!  It must have been very bright on the night of this photograph.  I can''t see another light in the sky.  That makes this a very nice picture.', '2003-11-10 14:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
