(479069, 45237, 12045, '<td valign="top">Great Framing!  I like it.</td>', 'Great Framing!  I like it.', '2003-11-10 15:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(479090, 46238, 10643, '<td valign="top">My favorite in the challenge. Love the contrast, love the subject, love the background, love the lighting. The only change I''d make would be to take it as more of a horizontal panorama, so we could see the full shadow of the steeple.</td>', 'My favorite in the challenge. Love the contrast, love the subject, love the background, love the lighting. The only change I''d make would be to take it as more of a horizontal panorama, so we could see the full shadow of the steeple.', '2003-11-10 15:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(479091, 46090, 10643, '<td valign="top">One of my top five this challenge. Reminds me of the "grace" picture in the Utah salt flats. I won''t be a bit surprised to find out it''s the same area. Unlike some of the others with centered church-roof compositions, this has subtlety to it and obviously careful lighting and attention to detail.</td>', 'One of my top five this challenge. Reminds me of the "grace" picture in the Utah salt flats. I won''t be a bit surprised to find out it''s the same area. Unlike some of the others with centered church-roof compositions, this has subtlety to it and obviously careful lighting and attention to detail.', '2003-11-10 15:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(479093, 46329, 10643, '<td valign="top">One of the simplest shots in the challenge, but very moving and not at all preachy or sectarian (which is starting to bug me as I vote). Perfect focus. Nice work.</td>', 'One of the simplest shots in the challenge, but very moving and not at all preachy or sectarian (which is starting to bug me as I vote). Perfect focus. Nice work.', '2003-11-10 15:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(479094, 46221, 7889, '<td valign="top">Sky is overexposed, plant in foreground would be better off removed. The main subject is nice and sharp and the relection works well. 6</td>', 'Sky is overexposed, plant in foreground would be better off removed. The main subject is nice and sharp and the relection works well. 6', '2003-11-10 15:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(479095, 46336, 10643, '<td valign="top">One of my top five in the challenge. The color and lighting under the arch are extraordinarily warm and inviting.</td>', 'One of my top five in the challenge. The color and lighting under the arch are extraordinarily warm and inviting.', '2003-11-10 15:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(479096, 45970, 10643, '<td valign="top">My favorite "nature" shot this challenge. I think I''d like to see it from a little earlier or a little later, with more red and less blue in the sky. The band of red along the horizon seems too defined.</td>', 'My favorite "nature" shot this challenge. I think I''d like to see it from a little earlier or a little later, with more red and less blue in the sky. The band of red along the horizon seems too defined.', '2003-11-10 15:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(479097, 46144, 10643, '<td valign="top">a daring and moving composition that really gives a feeling of imposing, soaring height.</td>', 'a daring and moving composition that really gives a feeling of imposing, soaring height.', '2003-11-10 15:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(479099, 46288, 10643, '<td valign="top">can see some camera shake on the rocks and leaves. did you have a tripod? Nice composition, lighting, and color; just the technical aspects need a little work.</td>', 'can see some camera shake on the rocks and leaves. did you have a tripod? Nice composition, lighting, and color; just the technical aspects need a little work.', '2003-11-10 15:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(479101, 46341, 10643, '<td valign="top">nice juxtapositions and contrasts here: the neon lighting and the stars of Orion, the natural beauty of the starlight and tree versus the brick building, the spire at the center and the cross at the left. I think moving the composition a little to the left so the cross is at the 1/3 mark might help, but losing the Orion''s belt stars wouldn''t be worth it.</td>', 'nice juxtapositions and contrasts here: the neon lighting and the stars of Orion, the natural beauty of the starlight and tree versus the brick building, the spire at the center and the cross at the left. I think moving the composition a little to the left so the cross is at the 1/3 mark might help, but losing the Orion''s belt stars wouldn''t be worth it.', '2003-11-10 15:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(479102, 46181, 10643, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. I like the palm(?) fronds with their softness and motion against the stark and stationary detail of the intricate tile work. Would like to see it without the peaked roof cut off at the top.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. I like the palm(?) fronds with their softness and motion against the stark and stationary detail of the intricate tile work. Would like to see it without the peaked roof cut off at the top.', '2003-11-10 15:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(479103, 46230, 10643, '<td valign="top">My grandmother has had a picture of this church on her wall for 20 years. A beautiful place, and you''ve captured it extremely well, showing its integration with the nature around it. There seems to be a slight "halo" around the rock, maybe from slight oversharpening or overcorrection of the blue sky. A softer focus or very slight gaussian blur might help that.</td>', 'My grandmother has had a picture of this church on her wall for 20 years. A beautiful place, and you''ve captured it extremely well, showing its integration with the nature around it. There seems to be a slight "halo" around the rock, maybe from slight oversharpening or overcorrection of the blue sky. A softer focus or very slight gaussian blur might help that.', '2003-11-10 15:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(479105, 46283, 10643, '<td valign="top">For some reason this is much more arresting than most of the other simple shots of statuary and shrines. The bright summer colors are very welcome to the gray November I''m in. I wish the tiled roof at the back were cropped out or hidden by a different angle of the trees. It would help give this a larger scale.</td>', 'For some reason this is much more arresting than most of the other simple shots of statuary and shrines. The bright summer colors are very welcome to the gray November I''m in. I wish the tiled roof at the back were cropped out or hidden by a different angle of the trees. It would help give this a larger scale.', '2003-11-10 15:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(479107, 46337, 10643, '<td valign="top">One of the best water/nature/horizon/infinity shots this challenge. I like the one stark cloud and the single seagull, and the color and reflections are lovely. The lens flare around the sun is distracting, but perhaps intentional or unavoidable.</td>', 'One of the best water/nature/horizon/infinity shots this challenge. I like the one stark cloud and the single seagull, and the color and reflections are lovely. The lens flare around the sun is distracting, but perhaps intentional or unavoidable.', '2003-11-10 15:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(479109, 46130, 10643, '<td valign="top">soft focus works very well to make this room look inviting and so warm. I would crop this picture so you only see the one door. The handle on the right-side door is distracting. Half (or one-third) door and half (or two-thirds) bedroom would be a simpler and more effective composition.</td>', 'soft focus works very well to make this room look inviting and so warm. I would crop this picture so you only see the one door. The handle on the right-side door is distracting. Half (or one-third) door and half (or two-thirds) bedroom would be a simpler and more effective composition.', '2003-11-10 15:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(479110, 45268, 7889, '<td valign="top">Bit overexposed, good colour and focus. 6</td>', 'Bit overexposed, good colour and focus. 6', '2003-11-10 15:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(479111, 46219, 10643, '<td valign="top">This has that sort of hazy halo about it that makes it look blown-up, oversharpened, or perhaps taken with digital zoom? Getting closer to the head of the aisle and having fewer pews in the photo might have made everything clearer.</td>', 'This has that sort of hazy halo about it that makes it look blown-up, oversharpened, or perhaps taken with digital zoom? Getting closer to the head of the aisle and having fewer pews in the photo might have made everything clearer.', '2003-11-10 15:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(479112, 46168, 7889, '<td valign="top">Flash/lighting is too harsh, which has spoilt this. 4</td>', 'Flash/lighting is too harsh, which has spoilt this. 4', '2003-11-10 15:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(479116, 46319, 7889, '<td valign="top">The ground at the left of the photo makes this too untidy. Would have been better to crop it off. 4</td>', 'The ground at the left of the photo makes this too untidy. Would have been better to crop it off. 4', '2003-11-10 15:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(479117, 46168, 10643, '<td valign="top">This would benefit greatly from softer lighting (not a flash), perhaps a longer exposure *with* a tripod (to avoid the blur on the leaves) and a higher angle (so we could see some of the statue''s face).</td>', 'This would benefit greatly from softer lighting (not a flash), perhaps a longer exposure *with* a tripod (to avoid the blur on the leaves) and a higher angle (so we could see some of the statue''s face).', '2003-11-10 15:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(479119, 46035, 10643, '<td valign="top">would like this better in color. the wood tones would be very warm and help the sacrosanct impression. also a slight rotation to the left of about half a degree to make the tabletop perfectly horizontal.</td>', 'would like this better in color. the wood tones would be very warm and help the sacrosanct impression. also a slight rotation to the left of about half a degree to make the tabletop perfectly horizontal.', '2003-11-10 15:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(479120, 46101, 7889, '<td valign="top">Something bothers me about this shot. The exposure is just too perfect! Is this a real building or a model?</td>', 'Something bothers me about this shot. The exposure is just too perfect! Is this a real building or a model?', '2003-11-10 15:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(479121, 45912, 10643, '<td valign="top">I like this, I just wish it was in color (to show the gold leaf) and the lighting had more contrast--showing the light coming in from the left-hand window illuminating the pulpit would be very striking.</td>', 'I like this, I just wish it was in color (to show the gold leaf) and the lighting had more contrast--showing the light coming in from the left-hand window illuminating the pulpit would be very striking.', '2003-11-10 15:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(479123, 45823, 7889, '<td valign="top">Good use of wide angle and good colours, bit overexposed. 6</td>', 'Good use of wide angle and good colours, bit overexposed. 6', '2003-11-10 15:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(479124, 46234, 7889, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting, good focus, 7</td>', 'Excellent lighting, good focus, 7', '2003-11-10 15:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(479125, 46100, 7889, '<td valign="top">Good shadows, stands out well. 6</td>', 'Good shadows, stands out well. 6', '2003-11-10 15:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(479126, 45874, 7889, '<td valign="top">Yeh - i can relate to this place of worship! nice one. 6</td>', 'Yeh - i can relate to this place of worship! nice one. 6', '2003-11-10 15:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(479127, 46316, 10643, '<td valign="top">I haven''t been to this garden (I''m 99% sure I know where it is) since the summer. Its feeling in November is very different, quieter, with all the flowers "sleeping." That''s what gives this a meditative quality. I''m not sure I''d call it "sacred" but it''s definitely contemplative and emotive, especially with the curving path disappearing into the near horizon.</td>', 'I haven''t been to this garden (I''m 99% sure I know where it is) since the summer. Its feeling in November is very different, quieter, with all the flowers "sleeping." That''s what gives this a meditative quality. I''m not sure I''d call it "sacred" but it''s definitely contemplative and emotive, especially with the curving path disappearing into the near horizon.', '2003-11-10 15:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(479128, 45391, 7889, '<td valign="top">My wife''s fav place. excellent job. 7</td>', 'My wife''s fav place. excellent job. 7', '2003-11-10 15:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(479129, 45665, 10643, '<td valign="top">terrific lighting. this might be more striking in black &amp; white or even duotone, picking up the mid shade of the brown brick.</td>', 'terrific lighting. this might be more striking in black & white or even duotone, picking up the mid shade of the brown brick.', '2003-11-10 15:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(479130, 46260, 10643, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this, with the brown-green on the rocks, the teal in the water, and the blue in the sky. it''s a real shame how noisy it is. neatimage might help with that, but you might lose a lot of the detail in the water sparkle.</td>', 'I like the colors in this, with the brown-green on the rocks, the teal in the water, and the blue in the sky. it''s a real shame how noisy it is. neatimage might help with that, but you might lose a lot of the detail in the water sparkle.', '2003-11-10 15:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(479131, 46261, 7889, '<td valign="top">Great colours on sky and tress, lovely reflection, good exposure and focus. 7</td>', 'Great colours on sky and tress, lovely reflection, good exposure and focus. 7', '2003-11-10 15:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(479138, 45939, 7889, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Exposure is good, colour is very good. my fav of the challenge. 8</td>', 'Nice shot. Exposure is good, colour is very good. my fav of the challenge. 8', '2003-11-10 16:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(479140, 45700, 7628, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen sunsets like this except in Iceland. Increadible.  I love the texture of the clouds.  Did you do much to the saturation?  Seeing something like this would be a spiritual experience.  It looks nnice with just a bit of the bottom cropped too. 9</td>', 'I''ve never seen sunsets like this except in Iceland. Increadible.  I love the texture of the clouds.  Did you do much to the saturation?  Seeing something like this would be a spiritual experience.  It looks nnice with just a bit of the bottom cropped too. 9', '2003-11-10 16:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(479141, 46263, 7628, '<td valign="top">Is this the cemetary south of Reykjavik? Perhaps all such lovely places bear a similarity. I like the way the branches reach out of the shadows into the light against the blue sky.  I wish there was something in the foreground that caught our attention more - perhaps placing those sunlit stone at the front of your picture - then the eye would have a place to start, and then follow the trees up.</td>', 'Is this the cemetary south of Reykjavik? Perhaps all such lovely places bear a similarity. I like the way the branches reach out of the shadows into the light against the blue sky.  I wish there was something in the foreground that caught our attention more - perhaps placing those sunlit stone at the front of your picture - then the eye would have a place to start, and then follow the trees up.', '2003-11-10 16:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(479143, 46261, 7628, '<td valign="top">This photo has a very nostalgic feeling with its soft light, the quiet reflections in the water.</td>', 'This photo has a very nostalgic feeling with its soft light, the quiet reflections in the water.', '2003-11-10 16:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(479146, 45939, 7628, '<td valign="top">The gold of the leaves and the lights comliments the dark dark blue of the sky with the floodlit tower inbetween - wow!  I like the golden branched framing hte pic on the left - wish we could see a bit more to the right to finish the line of the roof...9</td>', 'The gold of the leaves and the lights comliments the dark dark blue of the sky with the floodlit tower inbetween - wow!  I like the golden branched framing hte pic on the left - wish we could see a bit more to the right to finish the line of the roof...9', '2003-11-10 16:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(479147, 45455, 2764, '<td valign="top">straighten it</td>', 'straighten it', '2003-11-10 16:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(479148, 46130, 2764, '<td valign="top">ooohhh - rotate it a little and I''ll give you a ten - 9</td>', 'ooohhh - rotate it a little and I''ll give you a ten - 9', '2003-11-10 16:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(479149, 46014, 7628, '<td valign="top">Wild composition - very abstract in a way. The city looks like miniatures.  The lone tree, the line of the mountains, the white of the city against the dark ground.  Very eye-catching.  9</td>', 'Wild composition - very abstract in a way. The city looks like miniatures.  The lone tree, the line of the mountains, the white of the city against the dark ground.  Very eye-catching.  9', '2003-11-10 16:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
