(479155, 46249, 3569, '<td valign="top">Great fall colors.  A bit more contrast and I would have given you a higher score.  Nice though.</td>', 'Great fall colors.  A bit more contrast and I would have given you a higher score.  Nice though.', '2003-11-10 16:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
