(479187, 45823, 9146, '<td valign="top">not sure if I like the use of the fisheye or it makes the pic. it dosnt really say "sacred" to me but there are those who on''t think my entry says sacred either. looking foward to seeing what other things you can do with this lens though.<br/> <br/>good luck</td>', 'not sure if I like the use of the fisheye or it makes the pic. it dosnt really say "sacred" to me but there are those who on''t think my entry says sacred either. looking foward to seeing what other things you can do with this lens though. good luck', '2003-11-10 17:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(479189, 46130, 9146, '<td valign="top">I love this! my bedroom has always been my personal sacruary. I had debated doing a shot like this but I would have had to cleen and make the bed.<br/> <br/>is that a difusing/warming filter i see?<br/> <br/></td>', 'I love this! my bedroom has always been my personal sacruary. I had debated doing a shot like this but I would have had to cleen and make the bed. is that a difusing/warming filter i see? ', '2003-11-10 17:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(479227, 45391, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting how the black bars channel us into the tub - but leave us horizontal room to move.  Interesting choice.  I''m not sure about cropping the plant at the top.</td>', 'Interesting how the black bars channel us into the tub - but leave us horizontal room to move.  Interesting choice.  I''m not sure about cropping the plant at the top.', '2003-11-10 17:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(479229, 46087, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice light.  I''d crop at the bottom, the shadows are uninteresting.  The strange artifacts around the tower and the graininess of parts of the sky is from some sharpenning?  Perhaps less drastic processing is in order.</td>', 'Nice light.  I''d crop at the bottom, the shadows are uninteresting.  The strange artifacts around the tower and the graininess of parts of the sky is from some sharpenning?  Perhaps less drastic processing is in order.', '2003-11-10 17:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(479231, 46144, 7628, '<td valign="top">fun angle.  beautiful tower.  The light seems a bit washed out - at least on the lighter middle section of the tower - I''d be tempted to play with the contract/brightness and see if I could get some better definition.</td>', 'fun angle.  beautiful tower.  The light seems a bit washed out - at least on the lighter middle section of the tower - I''d be tempted to play with the contract/brightness and see if I could get some better definition.', '2003-11-10 17:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(479232, 46341, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like to see Orion leaning into the picture at the top - but it doesn''t balance the heavy brighness of the window - I wish it weren''t so far to the left.  The picture is very grainy?  what ISO?  Couldn''t you use a long exposure and a tripod?</td>', 'I like to see Orion leaning into the picture at the top - but it doesn''t balance the heavy brighness of the window - I wish it weren''t so far to the left.  The picture is very grainy?  what ISO?  Couldn''t you use a long exposure and a tripod?', '2003-11-10 17:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(479233, 46111, 7628, '<td valign="top">The pink cast is interesting.  Could be sharper.  I like your idea - a typerwriter is rare and sacred.</td>', 'The pink cast is interesting.  Could be sharper.  I like your idea - a typerwriter is rare and sacred.', '2003-11-10 17:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(479236, 46336, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like being able to peek through the arches to that water beyond.  very serene.  I''d be tempted to crop down to just the central arch - it is a different kind of entry - not to the building but to the light, air, water and earth.  It would be a simpler more powerful image.</td>', 'I like being able to peek through the arches to that water beyond.  very serene.  I''d be tempted to crop down to just the central arch - it is a different kind of entry - not to the building but to the light, air, water and earth.  It would be a simpler more powerful image.', '2003-11-10 17:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(479237, 45864, 7628, '<td valign="top">the blue sky is a perfect compliment.  Nice solid composition - pyramidal.</td>', 'the blue sky is a perfect compliment.  Nice solid composition - pyramidal.', '2003-11-10 17:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(479238, 46168, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like how she is surrounded by the rock and the plants - a circlular composition.  The flash is a bit bright - too much on the lilies in front drawing our eyes away from her.  Perhaps just natural light would have been better, or a light from a sourceother than the camera, more fom above?</td>', 'I like how she is surrounded by the rock and the plants - a circlular composition.  The flash is a bit bright - too much on the lilies in front drawing our eyes away from her.  Perhaps just natural light would have been better, or a light from a sourceother than the camera, more fom above?', '2003-11-10 17:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(479239, 46236, 7628, '<td valign="top">a peaceful blue, I like the curve of the tree in front.  A nice subject.  The light is so uniform that there is no real focus to the picture - I like to see some golden light on the door, or the tree.  You could try to add some brightness and contrast to it in photoshop or somesuch.</td>', 'a peaceful blue, I like the curve of the tree in front.  A nice subject.  The light is so uniform that there is no real focus to the picture - I like to see some golden light on the door, or the tree.  You could try to add some brightness and contrast to it in photoshop or somesuch.', '2003-11-10 17:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(479240, 46153, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like how the trees are silouetted against the light of the building.  I like the progression from black at the bottom the white at the top.</td>', 'I like how the trees are silouetted against the light of the building.  I like the progression from black at the bottom the white at the top.', '2003-11-10 17:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
