(479252, 46249, 327, '<td valign="top">Wish I was there [?] looks like a lovely spot. You did a good job with the reflection and colors. Too bad there wasn''t a blue sky. Still it feel like Fall. Good luck.</td>', 'Wish I was there [?] looks like a lovely spot. You did a good job with the reflection and colors. Too bad there wasn''t a blue sky. Still it feel like Fall. Good luck.', '2003-11-10 18:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(479253, 45379, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat shot...the blue and red...awesome. Like this one.</td>', 'Neat shot...the blue and red...awesome. Like this one.', '2003-11-10 18:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(479254, 45945, 7628, '<td valign="top">Those are some sparkly candles - magical! I like the red background.  I''d worry the feather would catch on fire, makes me a bit nervous.  I wish I could see more detal on the knife and the knife and featehr were all in the frame.</td>', 'Those are some sparkly candles - magical! I like the red background.  I''d worry the feather would catch on fire, makes me a bit nervous.  I wish I could see more detal on the knife and the knife and featehr were all in the frame.', '2003-11-10 18:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(479255, 46303, 327, '<td valign="top">I can see why...........lovely to look at.</td>', 'I can see why...........lovely to look at.', '2003-11-10 18:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(479256, 46337, 327, '<td valign="top">The bird is just a treasure. Nice shooting, wonderful color.</td>', 'The bird is just a treasure. Nice shooting, wonderful color.', '2003-11-10 18:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(479257, 46130, 9387, '<td valign="top">Very good idea and very well done.  I like the dreamy state. Very appealing bedroom and I can see why it is your sanctuary.</td>', 'Very good idea and very well done.  I like the dreamy state. Very appealing bedroom and I can see why it is your sanctuary.', '2003-11-10 18:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(479258, 46115, 7628, '<td valign="top">the trio of people is a nice composition, descending in hight as the flags and angels descend across the picture.  The grass makes a nice simple background.</td>', 'the trio of people is a nice composition, descending in hight as the flags and angels descend across the picture.  The grass makes a nice simple background.', '2003-11-10 18:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(479261, 46283, 9387, '<td valign="top">Religious statues generally don''t appeal to me but this one is very well done.  The flowers add a nice touch.  Composition is well done.  The only thing that could have made it better would have been a nicer sky, but we can only photograph what is there.</td>', 'Religious statues generally don''t appeal to me but this one is very well done.  The flowers add a nice touch.  Composition is well done.  The only thing that could have made it better would have been a nicer sky, but we can only photograph what is there.', '2003-11-10 18:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(479262, 46332, 7628, '<td valign="top">Beautiful dome, nice color and light - but the picture is so tightly composed I feel I want to see more - I want the picture to go somewhere - the top of the dome, or down to the people at the ground, I feel blocked in by that wall on the right.</td>', 'Beautiful dome, nice color and light - but the picture is so tightly composed I feel I want to see more - I want the picture to go somewhere - the top of the dome, or down to the people at the ground, I feel blocked in by that wall on the right.', '2003-11-10 18:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(479263, 46237, 9387, '<td valign="top">I had the same idea but don''t live near such a beautiful course.  This is well done and looks inviting.  I like the composition and the color.  Well done.</td>', 'I had the same idea but don''t live near such a beautiful course.  This is well done and looks inviting.  I like the composition and the color.  Well done.', '2003-11-10 18:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(479264, 45665, 7628, '<td valign="top">The light picks out beautiful details, and the lines of the arches curve away into darkness - very spiritual.  A light shining in the darkness. 9</td>', 'The light picks out beautiful details, and the lines of the arches curve away into darkness - very spiritual.  A light shining in the darkness. 9', '2003-11-10 18:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(479266, 46187, 7628, '<td valign="top">Waterfall is a good subject choice.  I like the long exposure making streams of white for the falls.  Wish it were sharper.  I don''t know about those blocks, I''d rather see more of the water above the falls.</td>', 'Waterfall is a good subject choice.  I like the long exposure making streams of white for the falls.  Wish it were sharper.  I don''t know about those blocks, I''d rather see more of the water above the falls.', '2003-11-10 18:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(479267, 46101, 9387, '<td valign="top">The lit area in this photo makes the picture.  I really like it.</td>', 'The lit area in this photo makes the picture.  I really like it.', '2003-11-10 18:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(479270, 46337, 7628, '<td valign="top">The line of clouds and the silouette of the bird are the perfect simple touches that make this view special.  Wonder what it would look like a bit less yellow?</td>', 'The line of clouds and the silouette of the bird are the perfect simple touches that make this view special.  Wonder what it would look like a bit less yellow?', '2003-11-10 18:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(479271, 45391, 9387, '<td valign="top">Great idea, great composition, cropping and color.  All in all a wonderful shot.  IF we were allowed to edit I might have toned down the light reflection in the tub but for the present rules this is a superior shot.</td>', 'Great idea, great composition, cropping and color.  All in all a wonderful shot.  IF we were allowed to edit I might have toned down the light reflection in the tub but for the present rules this is a superior shot.', '2003-11-10 18:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(479272, 46335, 9387, '<td valign="top">All I can say is "Wonderful!"</td>', 'All I can say is "Wonderful!"', '2003-11-10 18:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(479273, 46249, 9387, '<td valign="top">Good photo and in this case the frame draws you into the photo.  Too bad the sky wasn''t a little more compliant on this day.  A very good photo.</td>', 'Good photo and in this case the frame draws you into the photo.  Too bad the sky wasn''t a little more compliant on this day.  A very good photo.', '2003-11-10 18:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(479274, 46253, 7628, '<td valign="top">I love looking up at trees too.  These gray-barked ones are luminous reaching into the blue sky.  Wish it were sharper.</td>', 'I love looking up at trees too.  These gray-barked ones are luminous reaching into the blue sky.  Wish it were sharper.', '2003-11-10 18:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(479275, 46000, 9387, '<td valign="top">Very good photo.  It is very clear, the color stands out and the composition is good.</td>', 'Very good photo.  It is very clear, the color stands out and the composition is good.', '2003-11-10 18:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(479276, 46181, 9387, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  I like it a lot.  Too bad the sky wasn''t more compliant on the day you took this.</td>', 'Good photo.  I like it a lot.  Too bad the sky wasn''t more compliant on the day you took this.', '2003-11-10 18:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(479277, 46252, 9387, '<td valign="top">Very good shot and it must be a great old building with those mail boxes.  Like it a lot.</td>', 'Very good shot and it must be a great old building with those mail boxes.  Like it a lot.', '2003-11-10 18:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(479278, 46199, 7628, '<td valign="top">The lines of shadows add a nice diagonal to the picture.  I wish there were a central subject - both of the forground stones are chopped in half - perhaps if the flowers covered the forground and we could see the cemetary beyond?</td>', 'The lines of shadows add a nice diagonal to the picture.  I wish there were a central subject - both of the forground stones are chopped in half - perhaps if the flowers covered the forground and we could see the cemetary beyond?', '2003-11-10 18:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(479279, 46078, 9387, '<td valign="top">I like the mood of this photo.  Good shot.</td>', 'I like the mood of this photo.  Good shot.', '2003-11-10 18:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(479281, 45864, 9387, '<td valign="top">Good composition, color, cropping and clarity.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Good composition, color, cropping and clarity.  Nice shot.', '2003-11-10 18:28:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(479282, 46114, 5313, '<td valign="top">Amazing!  I can almost hear the bell ringing!</td>', 'Amazing!  I can almost hear the bell ringing!', '2003-11-10 18:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(479283, 45661, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting DOF I like the effect of the blurry beads and metal in the background.  Wish the foreground was all sharp.  I like the gradient of purple.</td>', 'Interesting DOF I like the effect of the blurry beads and metal in the background.  Wish the foreground was all sharp.  I like the gradient of purple.', '2003-11-10 18:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(479285, 45441, 5313, '<td valign="top">What a very interesting building and a great photo of it!  Fantastic shadows!</td>', 'What a very interesting building and a great photo of it!  Fantastic shadows!', '2003-11-10 18:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(479288, 46230, 7628, '<td valign="top">Frank Lloyd Wright''s Chapel in AZ - A nice composition with the angle of the building reaching out to the top left, but anchored by that beautiful rock with a touch of green.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Frank Lloyd Wright''s Chapel in AZ - A nice composition with the angle of the building reaching out to the top left, but anchored by that beautiful rock with a touch of green.  Nicely done.', '2003-11-10 18:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(479289, 46017, 5313, '<td valign="top">Amazing photo!  I love the gleam on the red paint.  Just beautiful!</td>', 'Amazing photo!  I love the gleam on the red paint.  Just beautiful!', '2003-11-10 18:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(479290, 45441, 7628, '<td valign="top">For all the pictures I have taken and seen of Hallgrimskirkja This is the coolest angle.  I''d be tempted to see how it would look with a tad more contrast, but it is gorgeous just the way it is! 10</td>', 'For all the pictures I have taken and seen of Hallgrimskirkja This is the coolest angle.  I''d be tempted to see how it would look with a tad more contrast, but it is gorgeous just the way it is! 10', '2003-11-10 18:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(479292, 46304, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice layers in this image, nice use of DOF.</td>', 'Nice layers in this image, nice use of DOF.', '2003-11-10 18:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(479294, 46036, 7628, '<td valign="top">funny - I wish you''d tried a more dramatic angle - like from below with the Bank of NY sign soaring into the sky like a church spire - would be even funnier.</td>', 'funny - I wish you''d tried a more dramatic angle - like from below with the Bank of NY sign soaring into the sky like a church spire - would be even funnier.', '2003-11-10 18:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(479296, 45970, 7628, '<td valign="top">Simply lovely!  The title is wonderful, the trees communing, huddled at the edge of the water watching the beautiful light.  10</td>', 'Simply lovely!  The title is wonderful, the trees communing, huddled at the edge of the water watching the beautiful light.  10', '2003-11-10 18:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(479299, 46217, 7628, '<td valign="top">nice subtle sunrise colors.  So much dark space at the bottom - you could crop closer to the tower from the left right and bottom- a more vertical composition -reaching into the sky.</td>', 'nice subtle sunrise colors.  So much dark space at the bottom - you could crop closer to the tower from the left right and bottom- a more vertical composition -reaching into the sky.', '2003-11-10 18:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(479300, 46303, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like how the mist defines the space between the hill tops.  This kind of place is sacred to me too.  Crop a bit at the top?</td>', 'I like how the mist defines the space between the hill tops.  This kind of place is sacred to me too.  Crop a bit at the top?', '2003-11-10 18:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(479301, 46298, 5313, '<td valign="top">Oh, what a lovely photo.  Having just in the past couple of years lost my dear husband, cemeteries are special sacred places to me.  This is a lovely marker for sure.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh, what a lovely photo.  Having just in the past couple of years lost my dear husband, cemeteries are special sacred places to me.  This is a lovely marker for sure. ', '2003-11-10 18:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(479303, 46331, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the spot of light on her face, quite an unearthly glow.  The bits of light that pick out the fold of her robe make her seem as if she if floating. nice.  I wish I could see this against a black, or very dark background, I find the vertical lines distracting.</td>', 'I like the spot of light on her face, quite an unearthly glow.  The bits of light that pick out the fold of her robe make her seem as if she if floating. nice.  I wish I could see this against a black, or very dark background, I find the vertical lines distracting.', '2003-11-10 18:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(479304, 46261, 5313, '<td valign="top">Great reflections!  I bet you did have some happy times there as a child.  I love the shadows all over the buildings.  Great photo!</td>', 'Great reflections!  I bet you did have some happy times there as a child.  I love the shadows all over the buildings.  Great photo!', '2003-11-10 18:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(479306, 46334, 7628, '<td valign="top">Okay, I''m biased, but I really like this picture.  The energy of those sparks, the blue glow of the moon, all isolated in the darkness. You can feel the cool air and smell the smoke.  I like the diagonal direction of the sparks, and the line of glowing flame.  I like the moon way above in the right corner giving an idea of the height of the black sky.</td>', 'Okay, I''m biased, but I really like this picture.  The energy of those sparks, the blue glow of the moon, all isolated in the darkness. You can feel the cool air and smell the smoke.  I like the diagonal direction of the sparks, and the line of glowing flame.  I like the moon way above in the right corner giving an idea of the height of the black sky.', '2003-11-10 18:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(479309, 46336, 5313, '<td valign="top">What a superb clear photo!  I love the light coming past the pillars.  Just a terrific photo!  What a nice place for a church too by a lake!<br/> <br/></td>', 'What a superb clear photo!  I love the light coming past the pillars.  Just a terrific photo!  What a nice place for a church too by a lake! ', '2003-11-10 18:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(479310, 46291, 5313, '<td valign="top">Uniquely beautiful!  What wonderful lighting!</td>', 'Uniquely beautiful!  What wonderful lighting!', '2003-11-10 18:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(479312, 46268, 5313, '<td valign="top">Beautiful clarity!  Lovely focus!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Beautiful clarity!  Lovely focus! ', '2003-11-10 18:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(479315, 46332, 5313, '<td valign="top">Amazing!  Vast!  Lovely focus.  I love this photo!</td>', 'Amazing!  Vast!  Lovely focus.  I love this photo!', '2003-11-10 18:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(479318, 46199, 5313, '<td valign="top">Oh, wonderful!  I love the shadows.  Since I lost my husband, cemeteries are special sacred places.</td>', 'Oh, wonderful!  I love the shadows.  Since I lost my husband, cemeteries are special sacred places.', '2003-11-10 18:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(479392, 46329, 9387, '<td valign="top">While I do believe that you have filled the requirement of the challenge the execution is a little not quite there.  The picture has no punch, the grave stone is washed out (the one that is leaning on the other) and the blurry grass in front is taking away from the picture.  In this case I think that maybe this would have come out better in color with some saturation of the grass.  Only my opinion though.</td>', 'While I do believe that you have filled the requirement of the challenge the execution is a little not quite there.  The picture has no punch, the grave stone is washed out (the one that is leaning on the other) and the blurry grass in front is taking away from the picture.  In this case I think that maybe this would have come out better in color with some saturation of the grass.  Only my opinion though.', '2003-11-10 19:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(479397, 46132, 9387, '<td valign="top">This must be a beautiful church but I don''t think it worked really well as a night shot.  The windows that are lit are completely overexposed and the parts near the top are totally underexposed.  The bottom half of the picture is a little better than the top portion.</td>', 'This must be a beautiful church but I don''t think it worked really well as a night shot.  The windows that are lit are completely overexposed and the parts near the top are totally underexposed.  The bottom half of the picture is a little better than the top portion.', '2003-11-10 19:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(479398, 45918, 10625, '<td valign="top">fantastic photo, i just thought that this picture didn''t identify a sacred place.</td>', 'fantastic photo, i just thought that this picture didn''t identify a sacred place.', '2003-11-10 19:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(479400, 46144, 9387, '<td valign="top">While I think the colors work well and thesky is great I''m not crazy about the angle.  In my opinion I think that it would have worked better as a straight forward shot.</td>', 'While I think the colors work well and thesky is great I''m not crazy about the angle.  In my opinion I think that it would have worked better as a straight forward shot.', '2003-11-10 19:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(479405, 46291, 10625, '<td valign="top">excellent choice of border, black and white at night is perfect.  good composition and centering this photo was a good idea, very symmetrical. 9</td>', 'excellent choice of border, black and white at night is perfect.  good composition and centering this photo was a good idea, very symmetrical. 9', '2003-11-10 19:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(479408, 45993, 9387, '<td valign="top">While I agree that being in a park or woods can be very uplifting and definitely a sanctuary for many this photo just doesn''t have that punch to make it very interesting.  The trees are over-exposed and seem to be blurry and the foreground is dark and doesn''t really add to the photo.  I understand that you were trying to create a mood and it might have looked different in person.  Of course this is just my opinion which probably accounts for nothing.</td>', 'While I agree that being in a park or woods can be very uplifting and definitely a sanctuary for many this photo just doesn''t have that punch to make it very interesting.  The trees are over-exposed and seem to be blurry and the foreground is dark and doesn''t really add to the photo.  I understand that you were trying to create a mood and it might have looked different in person.  Of course this is just my opinion which probably accounts for nothing.', '2003-11-10 19:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(479411, 46231, 9387, '<td valign="top">While I like your idea very much this shot seems to be very pixelated in the sky and not much definition in the bottom part of the pic.  I would have liked this shot much better had it been clearer.</td>', 'While I like your idea very much this shot seems to be very pixelated in the sky and not much definition in the bottom part of the pic.  I would have liked this shot much better had it been clearer.', '2003-11-10 19:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(479412, 46035, 10625, '<td valign="top">just slightly off balance, but a great black and white.</td>', 'just slightly off balance, but a great black and white.', '2003-11-10 19:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(479415, 46319, 10625, '<td valign="top">nice perspective.</td>', 'nice perspective.', '2003-11-10 19:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(479417, 45874, 9387, '<td valign="top">Love this idea but what I don''t care for is the top portion of the photo.  It is too blank and doesn''t add much to the photo being as how white it already is in parts.  IMHO.</td>', 'Love this idea but what I don''t care for is the top portion of the photo.  It is too blank and doesn''t add much to the photo being as how white it already is in parts.  IMHO.', '2003-11-10 19:58:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(479418, 46329, 10625, '<td valign="top">simplicity.  great DOF.  this has character. 9.</td>', 'simplicity.  great DOF.  this has character. 9.', '2003-11-10 19:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(479419, 45665, 9387, '<td valign="top">While I like your angle of view I would have liked to have seen a little more of the rest of the building.  I know that this might have been impossible and I know this might look better bigger but that is my opinion.</td>', 'While I like your angle of view I would have liked to have seen a little more of the rest of the building.  I know that this might have been impossible and I know this might look better bigger but that is my opinion.', '2003-11-10 19:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(479423, 46263, 9387, '<td valign="top">My focus in this photo totally goes to the trees.  I can barely make out what is at the bottom of the photo.  A different exposure was needed.</td>', 'My focus in this photo totally goes to the trees.  I can barely make out what is at the bottom of the photo.  A different exposure was needed.', '2003-11-10 20:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(479425, 46304, 9387, '<td valign="top">While this was a good idea and I love things with red in them, this picture was not clear at all.  IMHO I would have preferred that the crosses were really sharp.  The sky also loooks very noisy.</td>', 'While this was a good idea and I love things with red in them, this picture was not clear at all.  IMHO I would have preferred that the crosses were really sharp.  The sky also loooks very noisy.', '2003-11-10 20:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(479427, 46219, 10625, '<td valign="top">excellent choice of colour. fits the theme perfectly. symmetrical. i like how the light shines to the floor adding to the impact of the title. 10.</td>', 'excellent choice of colour. fits the theme perfectly. symmetrical. i like how the light shines to the floor adding to the impact of the title. 10.', '2003-11-10 20:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(479429, 45999, 9387, '<td valign="top">That sun shining on the tombstone does nothing for it.  The picture looks really blurry with little definition.</td>', 'That sun shining on the tombstone does nothing for it.  The picture looks really blurry with little definition.', '2003-11-10 20:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(479432, 46036, 9387, '<td valign="top">Amen!</td>', 'Amen!', '2003-11-10 20:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(479435, 46199, 9387, '<td valign="top">While I think you fulfilled the challenge there does not seem to be a point of focus in your picture.  Maybe a different angle or zooming in on one section might have looked better.</td>', 'While I think you fulfilled the challenge there does not seem to be a point of focus in your picture.  Maybe a different angle or zooming in on one section might have looked better.', '2003-11-10 20:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(479438, 46286, 10625, '<td valign="top">i would have chosen a different body for a temple, no offense.  it may have improved the aesthetic appeal of your pic.</td>', 'i would have chosen a different body for a temple, no offense.  it may have improved the aesthetic appeal of your pic.', '2003-11-10 20:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(479446, 46278, 9387, '<td valign="top">While I really like this photo a lot it seems like you used lights to brighten it up a little and they were placed in the wrong position.  I don''t like the harsh shadows and it makes the side of the building being lit seem washed out.  I actually think this would have been an excellent photo taken in daylight.</td>', 'While I really like this photo a lot it seems like you used lights to brighten it up a little and they were placed in the wrong position.  I don''t like the harsh shadows and it makes the side of the building being lit seem washed out.  I actually think this would have been an excellent photo taken in daylight.', '2003-11-10 20:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(479448, 45268, 10625, '<td valign="top">i would have liked this better if it had included more of the ceiling.</td>', 'i would have liked this better if it had included more of the ceiling.', '2003-11-10 20:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(479453, 46199, 10625, '<td valign="top">oversaturated.</td>', 'oversaturated.', '2003-11-10 20:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(479459, 46114, 7628, '<td valign="top">A very bold blue sky, sunlight create nice shadows.  The bell is a little lost in all the brightness.  What about desaturating the blue and upping the green?</td>', 'A very bold blue sky, sunlight create nice shadows.  The bell is a little lost in all the brightness.  What about desaturating the blue and upping the green?', '2003-11-10 20:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(479464, 45993, 7628, '<td valign="top">The silouetted branches lead the eye out to the young bright green sunlit trees.  The dapples of light under the big tree give a nice foreground.  The branches overhead are like the roof of a sanctuary, the green trees like the stained glass. Perhaps a bit bright on the background trees? 8</td>', 'The silouetted branches lead the eye out to the young bright green sunlit trees.  The dapples of light under the big tree give a nice foreground.  The branches overhead are like the roof of a sanctuary, the green trees like the stained glass. Perhaps a bit bright on the background trees? 8', '2003-11-10 20:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(479466, 45746, 7628, '<td valign="top">The hazy light shining down behind the stones flows diagonally like the hillside.  A bit of glare in the upper middle is distracting.  I wish the cropping o the side was less haphazard.</td>', 'The hazy light shining down behind the stones flows diagonally like the hillside.  A bit of glare in the upper middle is distracting.  I wish the cropping o the side was less haphazard.', '2003-11-10 20:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(479469, 46244, 7628, '<td valign="top">The moon looked just like this that night.  Nice detail - the craters are distinct.  That copper color is right on.  I might have made the photo less long - crop on the right.  8</td>', 'The moon looked just like this that night.  Nice detail - the craters are distinct.  That copper color is right on.  I might have made the photo less long - crop on the right.  8', '2003-11-10 20:20:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(479472, 46203, 7628, '<td valign="top">The mosiac or tapestry in the bacgroundin trigues me - I wish I could see it better.  While the seat is in the spot light and is solid and sharp it isn;t as interesting as the background.</td>', 'The mosiac or tapestry in the bacgroundin trigues me - I wish I could see it better.  While the seat is in the spot light and is solid and sharp it isn;t as interesting as the background.', '2003-11-10 20:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(479475, 46231, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the dark trees and the bright moon.  Wish the trees were sharper.</td>', 'I like the dark trees and the bright moon.  Wish the trees were sharper.', '2003-11-10 20:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(479479, 46329, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of the composition.  I like how one stone leans against the other and appears to "look" into the heavens.  If the stones were composed in the bottom right corner it would give some space for the stone to be facing into.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of the composition.  I like how one stone leans against the other and appears to "look" into the heavens.  If the stones were composed in the bottom right corner it would give some space for the stone to be facing into.', '2003-11-10 20:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(479482, 46301, 7628, '<td valign="top">Cool lighting.  The shadows of the trees on the fron tof the church are lovely, the bold shadows on the domes add dimension.  Might look more compelling cropped on the right to bring more attention to that dynamic tree on the left.</td>', 'Cool lighting.  The shadows of the trees on the fron tof the church are lovely, the bold shadows on the domes add dimension.  Might look more compelling cropped on the right to bring more attention to that dynamic tree on the left.', '2003-11-10 20:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(479486, 46028, 7628, '<td valign="top">Imposing structure.  Image seems a bit dark -but in a dusky (or dawn) way, and it is very blue but again that might work for dusk of dawn.  Needs to be tilted to the left so the steps are horizontal.</td>', 'Imposing structure.  Image seems a bit dark -but in a dusky (or dawn) way, and it is very blue but again that might work for dusk of dawn.  Needs to be tilted to the left so the steps are horizontal.', '2003-11-10 20:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(479490, 46181, 7628, '<td valign="top">An interesting idea to put the plant in the foreground.  Provides a nice contrast to the ornate golden temple.  Everything seems a bit bright, and I wish the top on the temple wasn''t cut off.</td>', 'An interesting idea to put the plant in the foreground.  Provides a nice contrast to the ornate golden temple.  Everything seems a bit bright, and I wish the top on the temple wasn''t cut off.', '2003-11-10 20:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(479493, 45268, 7628, '<td valign="top">Neat and tidy.  Very balanced, wonderif it would be more interesting less balanced?  But that wouldn''t be Brittish! I like the difuse glow from the window.  I would have included less of the floor and more of the ceiling.</td>', 'Neat and tidy.  Very balanced, wonderif it would be more interesting less balanced?  But that wouldn''t be Brittish! I like the difuse glow from the window.  I would have included less of the floor and more of the ceiling.', '2003-11-10 20:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(479496, 46219, 7628, '<td valign="top">A nice sense of the builing reaching up. it would be more natural less yellow, and better shaper.</td>', 'A nice sense of the builing reaching up. it would be more natural less yellow, and better shaper.', '2003-11-10 20:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(479504, 45973, 7628, '<td valign="top">The clouds follow the line of the canal, nice way to guide the eye left to right.    The siloutted buildings are nice against the orange sky.</td>', 'The clouds follow the line of the canal, nice way to guide the eye left to right.    The siloutted buildings are nice against the orange sky.', '2003-11-10 20:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(479507, 45973, 10084, '<td valign="top">The colors help to give off a warm feeling. The silhouettes of the landscape gives the shot some good interest. The clouds also helps to give a serene mood.</td>', 'The colors help to give off a warm feeling. The silhouettes of the landscape gives the shot some good interest. The clouds also helps to give a serene mood.', '2003-11-10 20:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(479510, 45996, 7628, '<td valign="top">nice colors.  it is a nice window - but what does the photo tell us about the window - it is a recording more than an interpretation.</td>', 'nice colors.  it is a nice window - but what does the photo tell us about the window - it is a recording more than an interpretation.', '2003-11-10 20:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(479511, 46101, 7628, '<td valign="top">the clean stone against the blackness is dramatic.  The light on the steeple is unearthly.  Wish there weren;t the green light on the left.  Perhaps cropping on the left would make the composition more focused?</td>', 'the clean stone against the blackness is dramatic.  The light on the steeple is unearthly.  Wish there weren;t the green light on the left.  Perhaps cropping on the left would make the composition more focused?', '2003-11-10 20:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(479513, 46100, 10084, '<td valign="top">Contrast and the lighting is captured perfectly. I like how the the shadows help to define the beautiful shapes on the churchs'' buttresses. The light helps to give it a holy feeling.</td>', 'Contrast and the lighting is captured perfectly. I like how the the shadows help to define the beautiful shapes on the churchs'' buttresses. The light helps to give it a holy feeling.', '2003-11-10 20:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(479516, 46260, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice composition: 3 elements - air land and water - I like the billowing blue clouds, and the sparkle of the water.  photo seems grainy particularly in the clouds, and the glare is distracting.</td>', 'Nice composition: 3 elements - air land and water - I like the billowing blue clouds, and the sparkle of the water.  photo seems grainy particularly in the clouds, and the glare is distracting.', '2003-11-10 20:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(479520, 46343, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great angle used in the shot. Helps make the composition very interesting. I like the selection of a soft focus. Gives the feeling of a hot bath. The mist of the hot water on my glasses. All the colors above the tub helps to give it a serene feeling. Beautiful.</td>', 'Great angle used in the shot. Helps make the composition very interesting. I like the selection of a soft focus. Gives the feeling of a hot bath. The mist of the hot water on my glasses. All the colors above the tub helps to give it a serene feeling. Beautiful.', '2003-11-10 20:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(479524, 46283, 7628, '<td valign="top">The white really stands out against the greenery, wish the composition centered more on the statue, not including the roof.  The flowers are colorful and bright, but the way the scatter arounf the base and are half in and out of the frame is more distracting than useful.</td>', 'The white really stands out against the greenery, wish the composition centered more on the statue, not including the roof.  The flowers are colorful and bright, but the way the scatter arounf the base and are half in and out of the frame is more distracting than useful.', '2003-11-10 20:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(479526, 46244, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the moon. The orange of the eclipse helps to give the moon an eerie feeling. The highlight on the bottom right side of the moon helps to give it a warm feeling even though there is blackness in the background.</td>', 'Great capture of the moon. The orange of the eclipse helps to give the moon an eerie feeling. The highlight on the bottom right side of the moon helps to give it a warm feeling even though there is blackness in the background.', '2003-11-10 20:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(479527, 46092, 7628, '<td valign="top">very soft, gentle.  Whiel I like the feeling of peace this picture evokes, I''d like to see how it would look with a bit more contrast, if we could better see the difference between the grass and the sand.</td>', 'very soft, gentle.  Whiel I like the feeling of peace this picture evokes, I''d like to see how it would look with a bit more contrast, if we could better see the difference between the grass and the sand.', '2003-11-10 20:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(479528, 45939, 10084, '<td valign="top">Exposure was done perfectly. You were able to capture the great detail in the church with the incredible lighting. The great autumn colors on the ground and in the trees. The blue hues in the sky help to give it a warming feeling.</td>', 'Exposure was done perfectly. You were able to capture the great detail in the church with the incredible lighting. The great autumn colors on the ground and in the trees. The blue hues in the sky help to give it a warming feeling.', '2003-11-10 20:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(479529, 45874, 7628, '<td valign="top">A dramatic rendering - like a sculpture of a god...funny.  I like the angle of looking up at it.  Odd black spots at the top.  If your lighting had illuminated the back ( under on the right) of the toilet it wouldn;t have the big amorphous black shape o the right.  Or perhaps just cropping in from the right would pull things together more?</td>', 'A dramatic rendering - like a sculpture of a god...funny.  I like the angle of looking up at it.  Odd black spots at the top.  If your lighting had illuminated the back ( under on the right) of the toilet it wouldn;t have the big amorphous black shape o the right.  Or perhaps just cropping in from the right would pull things together more?', '2003-11-10 20:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(479531, 46078, 7628, '<td valign="top">The misty building looms behind, a perfect backdrop for the statue, and mimicking the shape and balance of the statue and the lights.  8</td>', 'The misty building looms behind, a perfect backdrop for the statue, and mimicking the shape and balance of the statue and the lights.  8', '2003-11-10 20:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(479532, 45237, 7628, '<td valign="top">shelter from the storm, I like the combination of siloutetted and lighted rock to frame the trees, gives both a feeling of solidity and texture.  I might crop in a bit at top and bottom.</td>', 'shelter from the storm, I like the combination of siloutetted and lighted rock to frame the trees, gives both a feeling of solidity and texture.  I might crop in a bit at top and bottom.', '2003-11-10 20:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(479537, 45999, 7628, '<td valign="top">The burst of light from behind the cross is very thematic.  Wish the cross was shaper.</td>', 'The burst of light from behind the cross is very thematic.  Wish the cross was shaper.', '2003-11-10 20:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(479543, 46237, 7628, '<td valign="top">nice curvy composition eye goes from the front curves around to the back left - I like how the solid objects are blanced by their distinct shadows.  I like the light in the distant trees picking them out against the dark background.  Almost makes me want to play golf.</td>', 'nice curvy composition eye goes from the front curves around to the back left - I like how the solid objects are blanced by their distinct shadows.  I like the light in the distant trees picking them out against the dark background.  Almost makes me want to play golf.', '2003-11-10 20:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(479550, 46272, 7628, '<td valign="top">The shadow of the guard mimics the monument.  Everything lines up so well, horizontals, verticals and diagonals.  very well planned out.  Wish the guard dint; have his hand i his pockets (wass it cold?)  Perhaps you could boost the greens a bit? 9</td>', 'The shadow of the guard mimics the monument.  Everything lines up so well, horizontals, verticals and diagonals.  very well planned out.  Wish the guard dint; have his hand i his pockets (wass it cold?)  Perhaps you could boost the greens a bit? 9', '2003-11-10 20:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(479554, 45379, 7628, '<td valign="top">cool lighting.  Wish the figure on the left was as blue as the figure on the right is red.</td>', 'cool lighting.  Wish the figure on the left was as blue as the figure on the right is red.', '2003-11-10 20:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(479559, 45912, 7628, '<td valign="top">fantastic detail and range of grays.  Wow.  That window on the left is so lovely at that angle. 10</td>', 'fantastic detail and range of grays.  Wow.  That window on the left is so lovely at that angle. 10', '2003-11-10 21:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(479561, 46121, 7628, '<td valign="top">an admirable subject to try.  A nice idea to include th man-made and the natural sacred places.  However I wouldn''t have known that was the moon and not a street lamp.  If you had moved to the left to take the picture could you have gotten the moon more over the church?  With a tripod and a long lens perhaps the exposure on the moon would have been better.</td>', 'an admirable subject to try.  A nice idea to include th man-made and the natural sacred places.  However I wouldn''t have known that was the moon and not a street lamp.  If you had moved to the left to take the picture could you have gotten the moon more over the church?  With a tripod and a long lens perhaps the exposure on the moon would have been better.', '2003-11-10 21:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(479565, 46249, 7628, '<td valign="top">lovely colors, nicely framed by the branches, great idea to have the reflection and misty quality of light. 10</td>', 'lovely colors, nicely framed by the branches, great idea to have the reflection and misty quality of light. 10', '2003-11-10 21:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(479570, 46285, 7628, '<td valign="top">true.  chocolate is heavenly.  this is a nice snapshot for the family album.  Doesn''t have a lot of impact on me.  The photo is more about 2D sign than the actual 3D house.</td>', 'true.  chocolate is heavenly.  this is a nice snapshot for the family album.  Doesn''t have a lot of impact on me.  The photo is more about 2D sign than the actual 3D house.', '2003-11-10 21:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(479572, 45455, 7628, '<td valign="top">the use of reflection is intriguing.  the picture is a bit tilted to the left.  Wish you had included the floor of the building giving the viewer a way to visually traverse between inside and out.</td>', 'the use of reflection is intriguing.  the picture is a bit tilted to the left.  Wish you had included the floor of the building giving the viewer a way to visually traverse between inside and out.', '2003-11-10 21:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(479575, 46234, 7628, '<td valign="top">dramatic composition - the light on the steeple is a bit bright,, and there is an odd shadow of the tower in the darkness.  I like the look of the building against the black.</td>', 'dramatic composition - the light on the steeple is a bit bright,, and there is an odd shadow of the tower in the darkness.  I like the look of the building against the black.', '2003-11-10 21:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(479577, 46237, 10625, '<td valign="top">this a refreshing shot copared to the bunch in his challenge, too bad the leaves weren''t still on the trees.</td>', 'this a refreshing shot copared to the bunch in his challenge, too bad the leaves weren''t still on the trees.', '2003-11-10 21:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(479579, 46268, 7628, '<td valign="top">the black against white and the white against black works well.  wish there was a bit more grays inbetween - perhps a little too contrasty, but that is what you get in bright sun.</td>', 'the black against white and the white against black works well.  wish there was a bit more grays inbetween - perhps a little too contrasty, but that is what you get in bright sun.', '2003-11-10 21:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
