(479583, 46132, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is almost spooky with the bright burning light blaring out of the towers and that shadowy fingure in the front.  I like the colorful leaves.  Some way to tone down the light inside the tower?</td>', 'This is almost spooky with the bright burning light blaring out of the towers and that shadowy fingure in the front.  I like the colorful leaves.  Some way to tone down the light inside the tower?', '2003-11-10 21:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(479584, 46278, 12045, '<td valign="top">Great Color in this picture.  Very nice.</td>', 'Great Color in this picture.  Very nice.', '2003-11-10 21:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(479585, 46146, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple - I like the stark white of the stones, lined up and coming out of the corner - wish the grass were a deeper green, and wish the sky weren''t so light (polarizing filter would work)</td>', 'Nice and simple - I like the stark white of the stones, lined up and coming out of the corner - wish the grass were a deeper green, and wish the sky weren''t so light (polarizing filter would work)', '2003-11-10 21:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(479586, 46237, 12045, '<td valign="top">I was wondering if anyone would do this.  I was going to do a shot of a green myself but decided not to in the end.  Seeing how few there were I''m sorry I didn''t.  Very nice shot well framed.  Good Job!</td>', 'I was wondering if anyone would do this.  I was going to do a shot of a green myself but decided not to in the end.  Seeing how few there were I''m sorry I didn''t.  Very nice shot well framed.  Good Job!', '2003-11-10 21:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(479587, 46287, 7628, '<td valign="top">The dappled light is nice.  The reaching limbs of the trees are graceful.  The background is too bright.  It would be ok to have the tree more silouetted and have the rest of the picture better exposed.</td>', 'The dappled light is nice.  The reaching limbs of the trees are graceful.  The background is too bright.  It would be ok to have the tree more silouetted and have the rest of the picture better exposed.', '2003-11-10 21:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(479588, 46306, 7628, '<td valign="top">Mysterious fog and mountain peeks.  But why all that blank sky?  If you are atop a mountain I''d like to seee more of what you see below you.</td>', 'Mysterious fog and mountain peeks.  But why all that blank sky?  If you are atop a mountain I''d like to seee more of what you see below you.', '2003-11-10 21:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
