(479590, 46149, 7628, '<td valign="top">an interesting contrast.  I like the diagonal of the stairs and how the railing points to the bottom left corner.  the botto of the picture is a bit bright. 8</td>', 'an interesting contrast.  I like the diagonal of the stairs and how the railing points to the bottom left corner.  the botto of the picture is a bit bright. 8', '2003-11-10 21:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
