(479607, 45830, 7628, '<td valign="top">Great to have that bright orage hat, it really stands out.  I understand the reverence for geology - but the stone is so complex in the photo it is hard for your eye to know where to look.  Perhaps a closer composition would work better?</td>', 'Great to have that bright orage hat, it really stands out.  I understand the reverence for geology - but the stone is so complex in the photo it is hard for your eye to know where to look.  Perhaps a closer composition would work better?', '2003-11-10 21:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(479608, 45455, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection- but the maroon ford ranger blows it for me. Also, sharpen up the focus or make it a lot blurrier. I like the title and the creativity, but the altar looks like a terrifically beautiful shot righ behind you.</td>', 'Nice reflection- but the maroon ford ranger blows it for me. Also, sharpen up the focus or make it a lot blurrier. I like the title and the creativity, but the altar looks like a terrifically beautiful shot righ behind you.', '2003-11-10 21:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
