(479746, 45912, 10260, '<td valign="top">Very ornate pulpit.  Much different than the hardwood one in our little country church. :)</td>', 'Very ornate pulpit.  Much different than the hardwood one in our little country church. :)', '2003-11-10 22:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(479747, 46337, 6477, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot! did you use a filter??<br/>the perfect sacred place for me</td>', 'Amazing shot! did you use a filter??the perfect sacred place for me', '2003-11-10 22:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(479748, 46168, 13576, '<td valign="top">Looks like you may have used your flash and it washed out some detail. If your camera allows, next time try playing with your shutter speed. I think if she is uplit from the bottom, this could have added some depth and demension to the photograph.</td>', 'Looks like you may have used your flash and it washed out some detail. If your camera allows, next time try playing with your shutter speed. I think if she is uplit from the bottom, this could have added some depth and demension to the photograph.', '2003-11-10 22:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(479751, 46230, 10260, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.  I hope you tell us.......is there a building under there somewhere, or just the cross?  I love the rock colors and green of foliage, then blue-blue of sky.  Very attractive photo.</td>', 'Very interesting shot.  I hope you tell us.......is there a building under there somewhere, or just the cross?  I love the rock colors and green of foliage, then blue-blue of sky.  Very attractive photo.', '2003-11-10 22:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(479752, 45918, 13576, '<td valign="top">I like the photo I just cannot tell what it is or how it relates to the challange. Because I cannot tell what this is "3"</td>', 'I like the photo I just cannot tell what it is or how it relates to the challange. Because I cannot tell what this is "3"', '2003-11-10 22:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(479754, 46121, 13576, '<td valign="top">I think I see the moon and I know it was probably not an easy shot to get. However, the moon (top right corner) is a bit blurry. Along with the stop sign and the brigntess of the marquee, the blurriness of the moon just takes away from the beautiful lighting of this building.</td>', 'I think I see the moon and I know it was probably not an easy shot to get. However, the moon (top right corner) is a bit blurry. Along with the stop sign and the brigntess of the marquee, the blurriness of the moon just takes away from the beautiful lighting of this building.', '2003-11-10 23:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(479755, 45875, 10260, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I can see why it''s your "morning spot".   I''m sure some who are not photographically challenged as myself will give you great tips...but I just have to say I like it very much.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I can see why it''s your "morning spot".   I''m sure some who are not photographically challenged as myself will give you great tips...but I just have to say I like it very much.', '2003-11-10 23:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(479759, 45939, 10260, '<td valign="top">Lighting is gorgeous. I love orange of leaves and yellow of light. composition is appealing, contrast and detail keep me looking further.  8</td>', 'Lighting is gorgeous. I love orange of leaves and yellow of light. composition is appealing, contrast and detail keep me looking further.  8', '2003-11-10 23:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(479761, 46303, 13576, '<td valign="top">This shot in b/w may have had more of an impact due to the overcast conditions. It feels fuzzy and cold. I can also see a powerline through the shot that, although has minor sanificance, is a bit distracting.</td>', 'This shot in b/w may have had more of an impact due to the overcast conditions. It feels fuzzy and cold. I can also see a powerline through the shot that, although has minor sanificance, is a bit distracting.', '2003-11-10 23:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(479762, 46281, 13576, '<td valign="top">creative, good composition, good lighting, but I fail to see the challange connection. <br/>6</td>', 'creative, good composition, good lighting, but I fail to see the challange connection. 6', '2003-11-10 23:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(479763, 46078, 10260, '<td valign="top">I know this is mist, but to me.....it''s almost washed out too much.  I bet it''s just what you wanted though, and I''m not very good at this anyway. :)   5</td>', 'I know this is mist, but to me.....it''s almost washed out too much.  I bet it''s just what you wanted though, and I''m not very good at this anyway. :)   5', '2003-11-10 23:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(479764, 46238, 13576, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting. It really adds demension to the photograph. Good Job.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-11-19 21:10:03.</i></td>', 'I like the lighting. It really adds demension to the photograph. Good Job.', '2003-11-10 23:07:46.000000', '2003-11-19 21:10:03.000000', 1),
(479768, 46286, 13576, '<td valign="top">Nice creative twist to the challenge! I like how you leave some to the imagination. I think some more creative lighting would have done wonders with this idea though. This photo feels a bit flat.</td>', 'Nice creative twist to the challenge! I like how you leave some to the imagination. I think some more creative lighting would have done wonders with this idea though. This photo feels a bit flat.', '2003-11-10 23:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(479771, 46316, 13576, '<td valign="top">Another example of what would be stunningly georgeous in b/w imho . They grey sky is just not pleasing. Good comp though. I would have liked to seen the shot from a lower perspective.</td>', 'Another example of what would be stunningly georgeous in b/w imho . They grey sky is just not pleasing. Good comp though. I would have liked to seen the shot from a lower perspective.', '2003-11-10 23:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(479773, 45665, 13576, '<td valign="top">This is more my taste. I like SHADOWS!  Photo''s like this leave much to the imagination and I am an imaginative girl. I like the angle you shot. Bravo!<br/></td>', 'This is more my taste. I like SHADOWS!  Photo''s like this leave much to the imagination and I am an imaginative girl. I like the angle you shot. Bravo!', '2003-11-10 23:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(479775, 46261, 13576, '<td valign="top">Yeah! filters.. So many photos suffer because the nut behind the camera does not polorize. This is a superb example as to why one should screw one on. Good Job.</td>', 'Yeah! filters.. So many photos suffer because the nut behind the camera does not polorize. This is a superb example as to why one should screw one on. Good Job.', '2003-11-10 23:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(479776, 46111, 13576, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but the focus is a bit soft to the point of kinda hurting my eyes.<br/>I like the composition, and the lighting.<br/>5</td>', 'I like the idea but the focus is a bit soft to the point of kinda hurting my eyes.I like the composition, and the lighting.5', '2003-11-10 23:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(479777, 46184, 13576, '<td valign="top">Ok, ok! You made me sit on my head trying to figure this out. I LOVE IT! Great creativness. Bravo!<br/>10</td>', 'Ok, ok! You made me sit on my head trying to figure this out. I LOVE IT! Great creativness. Bravo!10', '2003-11-10 23:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(479778, 46201, 13576, '<td valign="top">If the barn was your main subject, focus should have been on the barn, not the trees in front of the camera.<br/>Good composition, I like the lighting, and the colors are phenominal.<br/>I just wished the focus was one the barn... 5  ( I would have given you a 9 or 10 )</td>', 'If the barn was your main subject, focus should have been on the barn, not the trees in front of the camera.Good composition, I like the lighting, and the colors are phenominal.I just wished the focus was one the barn... 5  ( I would have given you a 9 or 10 )', '2003-11-10 23:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(479779, 45939, 13576, '<td valign="top">awesome.</td>', 'awesome.', '2003-11-10 23:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(479781, 46028, 13576, '<td valign="top">Focus too soft, not enough contrast.  Tree on the right is a bit distracting. Not a bad photo though.</td>', 'Focus too soft, not enough contrast.  Tree on the right is a bit distracting. Not a bad photo though.', '2003-11-10 23:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(479783, 46237, 13576, '<td valign="top">Golf couse sacred? I could see that. Nice shot.</td>', 'Golf couse sacred? I could see that. Nice shot.', '2003-11-10 23:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(479787, 46035, 13576, '<td valign="top">a smidge on the too dark side. b/w are tough.</td>', 'a smidge on the too dark side. b/w are tough.', '2003-11-10 23:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(479793, 46331, 13576, '<td valign="top">great lighting, great angle!</td>', 'great lighting, great angle!', '2003-11-10 23:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(479794, 46014, 13576, '<td valign="top">I''m confused and I like it.</td>', 'I''m confused and I like it.', '2003-11-10 23:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(479808, 45970, 13576, '<td valign="top">Wow! The first photo of the challenge that has stirred some emotion. This is a breathtaking scene. What a great capture. Please make prints available. I must have.<br/>10</td>', 'Wow! The first photo of the challenge that has stirred some emotion. This is a breathtaking scene. What a great capture. Please make prints available. I must have.10', '2003-11-11 00:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(479810, 45970, 6477, '<td valign="top">Wow! this is a very strong image, simply BEAUTIFUL!  a perfect communion<br/>=10</td>', 'Wow! this is a very strong image, simply BEAUTIFUL!  a perfect communion=10', '2003-11-11 00:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(479812, 46181, 6477, '<td valign="top">what a beautiful building, is that gold? I would like to see another perspective, good work</td>', 'what a beautiful building, is that gold? I would like to see another perspective, good work', '2003-11-11 00:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(479816, 45945, 13576, '<td valign="top">Yet another photo that stirs emotion. It offends me, but, it is good compositionally. I suppose the challange is sacred places and to each his own. <br/>Reluctantly (on emotions) 8</td>', 'Yet another photo that stirs emotion. It offends me, but, it is good compositionally. I suppose the challange is sacred places and to each his own. Reluctantly (on emotions) 8', '2003-11-11 00:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(479821, 46298, 13576, '<td valign="top">A nice photo. And yes, a sacared place. But, I think you could have taken this a bit further. The photo seems to be missing something. Perhaps a candid looking shot of a couple of people observing the stone. Also, the straigt on shot seems to me to lack much creativity. Experiment with angles.. it will draw the eye through the photo and tell a better story.</td>', 'A nice photo. And yes, a sacared place. But, I think you could have taken this a bit further. The photo seems to be missing something. Perhaps a candid looking shot of a couple of people observing the stone. Also, the straigt on shot seems to me to lack much creativity. Experiment with angles.. it will draw the eye through the photo and tell a better story.', '2003-11-11 00:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(479874, 46219, 3585, '<td valign="top">desaturating the yellows caused by of the artificial lighting and leveling the horizon would improve this otherwise fine view.</td>', 'desaturating the yellows caused by of the artificial lighting and leveling the horizon would improve this otherwise fine view.', '2003-11-11 03:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(479895, 46301, 3585, '<td valign="top">I think you could have zoomed a little closer towards the top of this spectacular building where the staight lines, curves and shades offer the most compositional options.</td>', 'I think you could have zoomed a little closer towards the top of this spectacular building where the staight lines, curves and shades offer the most compositional options.', '2003-11-11 04:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(479897, 46252, 3585, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, could benefit from desaturation of the yellow</td>', 'Nice idea, could benefit from desaturation of the yellow', '2003-11-11 04:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(479903, 46132, 3585, '<td valign="top">This is one of the trickyest shot to succed at. The only way i know to have a nice balanced light throughout involves working with two different shots; one for the bright lights and one for the dimmer lights and then combining them in a photo editor. (not DPC legal...) be carefull with tilting horizons</td>', 'This is one of the trickyest shot to succed at. The only way i know to have a nice balanced light throughout involves working with two different shots; one for the bright lights and one for the dimmer lights and then combining them in a photo editor. (not DPC legal...) be carefull with tilting horizons', '2003-11-11 04:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(479908, 46149, 8987, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the sacred?</td>', 'I don''t see the sacred?', '2003-11-11 04:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(479909, 46035, 8987, '<td valign="top">a bit dark, otherwise good</td>', 'a bit dark, otherwise good', '2003-11-11 04:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(479910, 46090, 5728, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, the perspective you have chosen is also good. Did you climb up a tree or something to get the top of the roof at the same height and level? I find the composition is leaning a little to the right however. If you put a ruler at the bottom of the photo following the horizintal line you''ll see what I mean. It is quite minimal actually, but the eyes pick it up quickly.</td>', 'Interesting concept, the perspective you have chosen is also good. Did you climb up a tree or something to get the top of the roof at the same height and level? I find the composition is leaning a little to the right however. If you put a ruler at the bottom of the photo following the horizintal line you''ll see what I mean. It is quite minimal actually, but the eyes pick it up quickly.', '2003-11-11 04:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(479911, 45441, 8987, '<td valign="top">perhaps a little more contrast would have been better?</td>', 'perhaps a little more contrast would have been better?', '2003-11-11 04:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(479913, 46181, 8987, '<td valign="top">the leaves are a bit too present?</td>', 'the leaves are a bit too present?', '2003-11-11 04:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(479914, 45665, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good play of shadow and light, especially the way the sunlight is highlighting a parallel line toward the top of the photo there. The perspective is also very appropriate.</td>', 'Good play of shadow and light, especially the way the sunlight is highlighting a parallel line toward the top of the photo there. The perspective is also very appropriate.', '2003-11-11 04:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(479916, 46252, 8987, '<td valign="top">although I don''t necessarily see the sacred in this picture, I think it''s original and the composition looks good. a 7</td>', 'although I don''t necessarily see the sacred in this picture, I think it''s original and the composition looks good. a 7', '2003-11-11 04:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(479920, 46184, 5728, '<td valign="top">Cool effect! I always like seeing originality in photos and people trying out new ideas. The effect is very good here, the criss cross lines look like a kind of grid being beamed outwards by the church in the background. The blue works well and brings an element of coolness into the image. A slight tilt to the left might have squared it up a little, I get the feeling it is leaning to the right, but then again it might be because I had too much wine last night and can''t look at things on a normal level this morning :-) You''ve flipped this image, haven''t you!</td>', 'Cool effect! I always like seeing originality in photos and people trying out new ideas. The effect is very good here, the criss cross lines look like a kind of grid being beamed outwards by the church in the background. The blue works well and brings an element of coolness into the image. A slight tilt to the left might have squared it up a little, I get the feeling it is leaning to the right, but then again it might be because I had too much wine last night and can''t look at things on a normal level this morning :-) You''ve flipped this image, haven''t you!', '2003-11-11 04:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(479933, 46149, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonder how many will take the time to read ''God Will Forgive'' in the graffiti? Not many I fear ... it''s a good subject, but I don''t think I find your approach convincing - seems an arbitrary angle to shoot from, especially as the graphic elements of the staircase would be stronger from more of an angle - perhaps facing those bottom steps? Also seems either to have been overly lightened or exposed in tthe bottom corner. Intersting effort though. 6</td>', 'Wonder how many will take the time to read ''God Will Forgive'' in the graffiti? Not many I fear ... it''s a good subject, but I don''t think I find your approach convincing - seems an arbitrary angle to shoot from, especially as the graphic elements of the staircase would be stronger from more of an angle - perhaps facing those bottom steps? Also seems either to have been overly lightened or exposed in tthe bottom corner. Intersting effort though. 6', '2003-11-11 06:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(479934, 46100, 6999, '<td valign="top">Intersting effect with that uplighting - really like the progression of the shadows on the walls.</td>', 'Intersting effect with that uplighting - really like the progression of the shadows on the walls.', '2003-11-11 06:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(479936, 46230, 6999, '<td valign="top">Fascinating place - though I''m not sure your depictio of it is all it could be: the light is pretty flat and harsh, and you haven''t managed to get any real depth of texture into those rocks to show the contrast with the smooth stone of the church. I guess this is one of those shots best taken with the warm low light of dawn or dusk ...</td>', 'Fascinating place - though I''m not sure your depictio of it is all it could be: the light is pretty flat and harsh, and you haven''t managed to get any real depth of texture into those rocks to show the contrast with the smooth stone of the church. I guess this is one of those shots best taken with the warm low light of dawn or dusk ...', '2003-11-11 06:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(479937, 45970, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good capture - real stillness in the detail of those leaves. The Shaping of the light of the evening(?) against the trees is good too. I''d love to see this cropped to perhaps just above the horizon and to contain just the silhouettes of the trees - I''d certainly have played with that idea myself. Good stufff though.</td>', 'Good capture - real stillness in the detail of those leaves. The Shaping of the light of the evening(?) against the trees is good too. I''d love to see this cropped to perhaps just above the horizon and to contain just the silhouettes of the trees - I''d certainly have played with that idea myself. Good stufff though.', '2003-11-11 06:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(479938, 46249, 6999, '<td valign="top">The framing with those near-ground branches is fabulous - both in terms of framing and of contrast with the more distant trees too.</td>', 'The framing with those near-ground branches is fabulous - both in terms of framing and of contrast with the more distant trees too.', '2003-11-11 06:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(479940, 46115, 6999, '<td valign="top">''Heroes'', with an e. Don''t really like this shot - but I DO like the contrating attitude of the young girl - the evident misery of the adult couple, and the poor young thing just looks bored, scuffing away at the gravel with here foot ... or am I just imagining things</td>', '''Heroes'', with an e. Don''t really like this shot - but I DO like the contrating attitude of the young girl - the evident misery of the adult couple, and the poor young thing just looks bored, scuffing away at the gravel with here foot ... or am I just imagining things', '2003-11-11 06:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(479942, 46035, 6999, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the very low whites level is helpful to this shot: you haven''t really got any brighter than the background grey of the site, and that reduces your options in the black anf white field enormously.</td>', 'I''m not sure the very low whites level is helpful to this shot: you haven''t really got any brighter than the background grey of the site, and that reduces your options in the black anf white field enormously.', '2003-11-11 06:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(479946, 45441, 6999, '<td valign="top">Something odd here - there''s jpeg artefacts around the edges of the building, and I''m not quite sure how you would have got those into a black and white shot - there should be no increased compression to get down to the file size. After checking, I see that this is only 25Kb - don;t forget you have another 125K available - and that compression is ruining the detail in what would otherwise be a tremendous shot.</td>', 'Something odd here - there''s jpeg artefacts around the edges of the building, and I''m not quite sure how you would have got those into a black and white shot - there should be no increased compression to get down to the file size. After checking, I see that this is only 25Kb - don;t forget you have another 125K available - and that compression is ruining the detail in what would otherwise be a tremendous shot.', '2003-11-11 06:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(479947, 46014, 6999, '<td valign="top">Damn. I was just about to stop voting and this piece of genius comes up. don''t get the title, don''t care. Wish you;d got all the edge of the tree in, mind you. Very very elegant - pictorially and graphically. Hope it isn''t too odd for the rest of dpc :-)</td>', 'Damn. I was just about to stop voting and this piece of genius comes up. don''t get the title, don''t care. Wish you;d got all the edge of the tree in, mind you. Very very elegant - pictorially and graphically. Hope it isn''t too odd for the rest of dpc :-)', '2003-11-11 06:49:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(479948, 45939, 5728, '<td valign="top">The contrasts of the dark blue sky and the orange toned leaves and light are a perfect mix as a surrounding for your church. It gives your image a lot of life and charachter. Had you only had the church alone the effect wouldn''t have been as good as it is here. Top marks for this one (10)</td>', 'The contrasts of the dark blue sky and the orange toned leaves and light are a perfect mix as a surrounding for your church. It gives your image a lot of life and charachter. Had you only had the church alone the effect wouldn''t have been as good as it is here. Top marks for this one (10)', '2003-11-11 06:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(479949, 45379, 5728, '<td valign="top">The smoke in the light effect is fantastic. The people with their arms up in the air is a good capture, the red light from the right and the bluish light from the left increase the impact a lot. The crop is a little uncentered, I would have given a little more space to the girl on the right, or less to the girl on the left. (9)<br/> <br/>Looking at this again I only just realised the guy is holding a guitar.</td>', 'The smoke in the light effect is fantastic. The people with their arms up in the air is a good capture, the red light from the right and the bluish light from the left increase the impact a lot. The crop is a little uncentered, I would have given a little more space to the girl on the right, or less to the girl on the left. (9) Looking at this again I only just realised the guy is holding a guitar.', '2003-11-11 06:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(479952, 46087, 11693, '<td valign="top">Over all good composition, however the pixelation around the edges distacts from the image. 5</td>', 'Over all good composition, however the pixelation around the edges distacts from the image. 5', '2003-11-11 07:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(479953, 46191, 11693, '<td valign="top">The trees to the left have little detail and detract from your capture.  Maybe a tighter or verticle crop would be better. 5</td>', 'The trees to the left have little detail and detract from your capture.  Maybe a tighter or verticle crop would be better. 5', '2003-11-11 07:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(479956, 46260, 11693, '<td valign="top">The graininess in this image take away from the effect.  The moment was right but the exposure was off.  I like the composition. 5</td>', 'The graininess in this image take away from the effect.  The moment was right but the exposure was off.  I like the composition. 5', '2003-11-11 07:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(479958, 46101, 11693, '<td valign="top">The perspective tilt really takes away from a great shot. 6</td>', 'The perspective tilt really takes away from a great shot. 6', '2003-11-11 07:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(479960, 46219, 11693, '<td valign="top">I love the composition.  Your focus is off though.  6</td>', 'I love the composition.  Your focus is off though.  6', '2003-11-11 07:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(479962, 45912, 11693, '<td valign="top">Great detail and focus.  B&amp;W brightness and contrast right on.  Good shot. 7</td>', 'Great detail and focus.  B&W brightness and contrast right on.  Good shot. 7', '2003-11-11 07:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(479964, 46028, 11693, '<td valign="top">Way too dark.  The light was all wrong for my eyes. 5</td>', 'Way too dark.  The light was all wrong for my eyes. 5', '2003-11-11 07:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(479966, 46100, 11693, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  I like the light.  Too bad the top of the spire was out of the light a little.7</td>', 'Good shot.  I like the light.  Too bad the top of the spire was out of the light a little.7', '2003-11-11 07:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(479969, 45665, 11693, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting and the diagonal.  8</td>', 'I love the lighting and the diagonal.  8', '2003-11-11 07:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(479971, 46331, 11693, '<td valign="top">Lighting, color and saturation are great.  Focus is sharp and DOF wonderfull.  7</td>', 'Lighting, color and saturation are great.  Focus is sharp and DOF wonderfull.  7', '2003-11-11 07:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(479974, 45875, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this very much.</td>', 'I like this very much.', '2003-11-11 07:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(479975, 46231, 6130, '<td valign="top">Lovely and I like it.</td>', 'Lovely and I like it.', '2003-11-11 07:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(479978, 46111, 6130, '<td valign="top">Unusual.</td>', 'Unusual.', '2003-11-11 07:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(480041, 46149, 9387, '<td valign="top">I''m a city person so I understand this photo and I like it a lot.  Good composition and I like the context.</td>', 'I''m a city person so I understand this photo and I like it a lot.  Good composition and I like the context.', '2003-11-11 08:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(480043, 46319, 9387, '<td valign="top">I like your picture a lot.  Took the shot from a very interesting perspective and I like that you can actually read the first tombstone.  The composition is great and I like that you did it in black and white.  The fall leaves also make their own statement and add greatly to the shot.  Well done.   Out of curiosity -- where is this memorial?</td>', 'I like your picture a lot.  Took the shot from a very interesting perspective and I like that you can actually read the first tombstone.  The composition is great and I like that you did it in black and white.  The fall leaves also make their own statement and add greatly to the shot.  Well done.   Out of curiosity -- where is this memorial?', '2003-11-11 08:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(480045, 46054, 9387, '<td valign="top">I like your photo and the blue tone.  Good composition.</td>', 'I like your photo and the blue tone.  Good composition.', '2003-11-11 08:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(480064, 46281, 12448, '<td valign="top">My gut instinct vote on this shot was a 4, now that I''m looking at it closer I see the circle that is created by the heads of the "family" coming together.  I like the off centering that was done and the DOF is well done.  The reasoning behind the initial low score is at a glance it looks someone holding up two balls and my thought was, "What does that have to do with family?"  But light to dark effect from top to bottom is also very nice and the reflections off the heads works very well.  Raising this score to an 8</td>', 'My gut instinct vote on this shot was a 4, now that I''m looking at it closer I see the circle that is created by the heads of the "family" coming together.  I like the off centering that was done and the DOF is well done.  The reasoning behind the initial low score is at a glance it looks someone holding up two balls and my thought was, "What does that have to do with family?"  But light to dark effect from top to bottom is also very nice and the reflections off the heads works very well.  Raising this score to an 8', '2003-11-11 09:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(480066, 46219, 12448, '<td valign="top">A nice shot overall but the lack of focus is very distracting.  The brightness of the top is also a bit overwhelming though I do llike the reflection of the light in the aisle.  The cropping is well done, the pews and aisle work well together to bring you into the shot and take you through the back.  Started with a 4, ending with a 5</td>', 'A nice shot overall but the lack of focus is very distracting.  The brightness of the top is also a bit overwhelming though I do llike the reflection of the light in the aisle.  The cropping is well done, the pews and aisle work well together to bring you into the shot and take you through the back.  Started with a 4, ending with a 5', '2003-11-11 09:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(480069, 45939, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great warm colors and sharpness.  Lighting is perfect.  Good luck.  jacko 10</td>', 'Great warm colors and sharpness.  Lighting is perfect.  Good luck.  jacko 10', '2003-11-11 09:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
