(480313, 46301, 9387, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  Nice composition and I like the lighting at the top of the church.</td>', 'Good photo.  Nice composition and I like the lighting at the top of the church.', '2003-11-11 12:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(480317, 46201, 9387, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo.  Good composition and nice coloring.  Like the softening effect.  My only criticism is the background seems a little noisy.</td>', 'Very nice photo.  Good composition and nice coloring.  Like the softening effect.  My only criticism is the background seems a little noisy.', '2003-11-11 12:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(480319, 46334, 9387, '<td valign="top">Although I think this is a very creative idea of a campfire it doesn''t jump out at me.    Without the title I would have no idea what I was looking at.  However, I am marking you on your skills and not my personal preference.</td>', 'Although I think this is a very creative idea of a campfire it doesn''t jump out at me.    Without the title I would have no idea what I was looking at.  However, I am marking you on your skills and not my personal preference.', '2003-11-11 12:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(480320, 46115, 9387, '<td valign="top">Very moving.</td>', 'Very moving.', '2003-11-11 12:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(480321, 46340, 5728, '<td valign="top">A very appropriate title, and I like your idea of differring contrasts here. There seem to be three phases. The tree at the front is in high contrast, the trees behind less and the cemetary out the back even less, as if it is in the fog (which I guess it is).</td>', 'A very appropriate title, and I like your idea of differring contrasts here. There seem to be three phases. The tree at the front is in high contrast, the trees behind less and the cemetary out the back even less, as if it is in the fog (which I guess it is).', '2003-11-11 12:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(480323, 45661, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, going shallower towards the back parallel to the white to purple gradient. It comes over very well.</td>', 'Good DOF, going shallower towards the back parallel to the white to purple gradient. It comes over very well.', '2003-11-11 12:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(480330, 45441, 5728, '<td valign="top">Lovely B &amp; W pic, especially the way you''ve captured the sunlight only on one portion of the building. The shadows are still light enough to see the details of the church. Way to go Reykjavik :-)</td>', 'Lovely B & W pic, especially the way you''ve captured the sunlight only on one portion of the building. The shadows are still light enough to see the details of the church. Way to go Reykjavik :-)', '2003-11-11 12:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(480336, 46230, 5728, '<td valign="top">Looks like something out of a scifi movie. The saturation is very rich bringing out the greens, blues and reds to full advantage. Top composition too.</td>', 'Looks like something out of a scifi movie. The saturation is very rich bringing out the greens, blues and reds to full advantage. Top composition too.', '2003-11-11 12:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(480359, 46306, 5728, '<td valign="top">This would have been amazing had the sky been deep blue contrasting against the fog sitting behind those trees. The overcast day has prevented you from bringing out the colors the way you wanted, which is a pity. I guess we can''t all have sunny days and blue skies all the time.</td>', 'This would have been amazing had the sky been deep blue contrasting against the fog sitting behind those trees. The overcast day has prevented you from bringing out the colors the way you wanted, which is a pity. I guess we can''t all have sunny days and blue skies all the time.', '2003-11-11 12:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(480363, 46201, 5728, '<td valign="top">Had this photo been larger and with everything in focus with the saturation pushed up to bring out the greens and reds more, it wold have done a lot better. The natural framing using the tree and branches adds to the composition, although that one branch hanging down from the top right is distracting.</td>', 'Had this photo been larger and with everything in focus with the saturation pushed up to bring out the greens and reds more, it wold have done a lot better. The natural framing using the tree and branches adds to the composition, although that one branch hanging down from the top right is distracting.', '2003-11-11 12:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(480371, 46278, 5728, '<td valign="top">You used a polarizer huh? The sky is a very deep blue, especially at the top there, or maybe it was taken at dusk with the sun going down in the background. In a way the lighting does seems a little off. The top is too dark in comparision to the church, and the left side looks brighter than the right side. Going from the glare on the door I guess you used a flash on this photo. Personally I would have liked to see the whole steeple with the cross at the top still visible. Otherwise a quaint old little church.</td>', 'You used a polarizer huh? The sky is a very deep blue, especially at the top there, or maybe it was taken at dusk with the sun going down in the background. In a way the lighting does seems a little off. The top is too dark in comparision to the church, and the left side looks brighter than the right side. Going from the glare on the door I guess you used a flash on this photo. Personally I would have liked to see the whole steeple with the cross at the top still visible. Otherwise a quaint old little church.', '2003-11-11 13:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(480373, 45391, 5728, '<td valign="top">For some a very sacred place indeed. Nice lighting, no glares at all except for the candle light in the tiles, but that isn''t bad. It took me a few seconds to realise the bath is full and foaming. I hope you didn''t waste that water and jumped right in there after the photo :-)</td>', 'For some a very sacred place indeed. Nice lighting, no glares at all except for the candle light in the tiles, but that isn''t bad. It took me a few seconds to realise the bath is full and foaming. I hope you didn''t waste that water and jumped right in there after the photo :-)', '2003-11-11 13:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(480423, 45918, 12045, '<td valign="top">The large drop with the reflection in it makes this a great photograph.</td>', 'The large drop with the reflection in it makes this a great photograph.', '2003-11-11 13:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(480428, 46244, 12448, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, very cute!  I love the idea and the moon is considered sacred in many cultures.  As for the shot, not to bad overall, I like the set up but the red border is distracting to me and the moon is a bit small and slightly blurred, so hard to get a decent shot, I know, I''ve been trying!  The lack of stars also is a bit odd to me.  A 4 to start</td>', 'Hahaha, very cute!  I love the idea and the moon is considered sacred in many cultures.  As for the shot, not to bad overall, I like the set up but the red border is distracting to me and the moon is a bit small and slightly blurred, so hard to get a decent shot, I know, I''ve been trying!  The lack of stars also is a bit odd to me.  A 4 to start', '2003-11-11 14:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(480474, 46078, 4482, '<td valign="top">Great shot! A tad off centre but barely noticable! :-) <br/>The composition is spot on and I''m glad you didn''t try to saturate the colors as it would''ve ruined the "misty" quality of the shot.<br/>I fin the shot as more of a political genre than a sacred one but that''s jsut me!<br/> <br/>Keep it up! 8</td>', 'Great shot! A tad off centre but barely noticable! :-) The composition is spot on and I''m glad you didn''t try to saturate the colors as it would''ve ruined the "misty" quality of the shot.I fin the shot as more of a political genre than a sacred one but that''s jsut me! Keep it up! 8', '2003-11-11 14:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(480476, 45939, 4482, '<td valign="top">The best church night sht of the challenge! The perspective gives drama. The lighting isn''t too harsh, it''s actually soothing. Keep it up! 9</td>', 'The best church night sht of the challenge! The perspective gives drama. The lighting isn''t too harsh, it''s actually soothing. Keep it up! 9', '2003-11-11 14:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
