(480501, 46130, 4482, '<td valign="top">I look at this shot and go. ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh....  the tones are spot on and the slight softness is quite appropriate here. I don''t know why but the black dorr on the right is distracting to me.... still a great shot! 8</td>', 'I look at this shot and go. ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh....  the tones are spot on and the slight softness is quite appropriate here. I don''t know why but the black dorr on the right is distracting to me.... still a great shot! 8', '2003-11-11 15:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
