(480660, 46288, 9146, '<td valign="top">this is a very pretty spot<br/> <br/>However you might want to adjust your WB if you can. There''s a slight blue cast here. Not enough to ruin the pic but I''m sure your getting that.  Next time you try this bring a tripod. I know it''s a hassle but in any low light situation I have found that I get cleaner, sharper pix if I use a tripod. I learned that when I was still shooting regularly with my old kodak. It''s ecential now with my rebel.  It also provides something stable to lean on when I''m trogging through the woods. I got mine at wallmart only $40 they have cheeper ones but when I went to price tripods  realized this was a good deal. <br/> <br/>Have you tried long sutter spped for a soft look?? You don''t have to the pic is good as it stands It''s only that I''m experementing with them and I''ve found it frustrating and ultimatly satifying when I get a good result.<br/> <br/>good luck. <br/>It''s a beautifll stream<br/> <br/>7 :)</td>', 'this is a very pretty spot However you might want to adjust your WB if you can. There''s a slight blue cast here. Not enough to ruin the pic but I''m sure your getting that.  Next time you try this bring a tripod. I know it''s a hassle but in any low light situation I have found that I get cleaner, sharper pix if I use a tripod. I learned that when I was still shooting regularly with my old kodak. It''s ecential now with my rebel.  It also provides something stable to lean on when I''m trogging through the woods. I got mine at wallmart only $40 they have cheeper ones but when I went to price tripods  realized this was a good deal.  Have you tried long sutter spped for a soft look?? You don''t have to the pic is good as it stands It''s only that I''m experementing with them and I''ve found it frustrating and ultimatly satifying when I get a good result. good luck. It''s a beautifll stream 7 :)', '2003-11-11 17:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(480663, 46331, 9146, '<td valign="top">beautifull =10<br/> <br/>One thing did you use a difusing fillter or something else. I''m looking for a filter that will give me that soft glowy efect.</td>', 'beautifull =10 One thing did you use a difusing fillter or something else. I''m looking for a filter that will give me that soft glowy efect.', '2003-11-11 17:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(480684, 46334, 9146, '<td valign="top">OK this NEEDS another title. As a campfire there''s really no "sacred" tie in. However fire is a sacred element to many cultures around the world. had you tied it in to one of those cultures and their rituals especaly with the almost full moon in the backgrownd I think you would have scored better from the "dose not fit challenge" police. <br/> <br/>I almost scored it a 3 for that reason till I really looked at it. it''s a solid photograph but I''m taking points off for a rotten title.<br/> <br/>7 ;)</td>', 'OK this NEEDS another title. As a campfire there''s really no "sacred" tie in. However fire is a sacred element to many cultures around the world. had you tied it in to one of those cultures and their rituals especaly with the almost full moon in the backgrownd I think you would have scored better from the "dose not fit challenge" police.  I almost scored it a 3 for that reason till I really looked at it. it''s a solid photograph but I''m taking points off for a rotten title. 7 ;)', '2003-11-11 17:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
