(480891, 46028, 12448, '<td valign="top">Or just about any other church one can see :)  It''s a lovely church and the angle of the shot is very well done.  The lighting leaves much to be desired for me, the darkness towards the bottom would work better if the light was stronger on the top.  The tree branches are a bit distracting but you can''t make nature co=operate now can we?  A 4</td>', 'Or just about any other church one can see :)  It''s a lovely church and the angle of the shot is very well done.  The lighting leaves much to be desired for me, the darkness towards the bottom would work better if the light was stronger on the top.  The tree branches are a bit distracting but you can''t make nature co=operate now can we?  A 4', '2003-11-11 19:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(480897, 46254, 12448, '<td valign="top">A beautiful building and the black and white is very nice, good contrast and light but I would really like to have seen this shot in color to see if it might pop somre more.  The (spiral?) in the center is interesting but it''s cut off and so bright.  Also the light is a bit blown out on the corner and to the left of the door.  A tighter crop on the bottom might also help to me.  A 4</td>', 'A beautiful building and the black and white is very nice, good contrast and light but I would really like to have seen this shot in color to see if it might pop somre more.  The (spiral?) in the center is interesting but it''s cut off and so bright.  Also the light is a bit blown out on the corner and to the left of the door.  A tighter crop on the bottom might also help to me.  A 4', '2003-11-11 19:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(480901, 46132, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice church, the statue in the front without light works very well but the lights in the towers are a bit too bright compared to the rest of the shot.  Are they really that bright?  The sharpness is a bit lacking in this shot but the crop is nice overall.  A 4 to start</td>', 'Nice church, the statue in the front without light works very well but the lights in the towers are a bit too bright compared to the rest of the shot.  Are they really that bright?  The sharpness is a bit lacking in this shot but the crop is nice overall.  A 4 to start', '2003-11-11 19:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(480904, 46265, 13749, '<td valign="top">i like the high amount of detail on the Bible - nice placement of the cross and an attractive overall composition.  my favorite of the competition.</td>', 'i like the high amount of detail on the Bible - nice placement of the cross and an attractive overall composition.  my favorite of the competition.', '2003-11-11 19:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(480908, 46230, 13749, '<td valign="top">interesting location for a church, which makes this picture a bit more appealing and inspiring. nice choice.</td>', 'interesting location for a church, which makes this picture a bit more appealing and inspiring. nice choice.', '2003-11-11 19:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(480912, 46291, 12448, '<td valign="top">Haven''t I seen this church before?  From a different angle?  Will have to check back after the challenge to see if it''s the one I think.    I like the angle of the shot and the curves of the roof. The lighting is just about perfect but the white border line is distracting to me. If the crop was on that line the shot would be close to perfect in that aspect.   My gut instinct vote on this was a 4, it looked fuzzy and a bit dark at first but upon closer inspection I know now it was my glasses!  EEK!  :)  Raising your score to an 8</td>', 'Haven''t I seen this church before?  From a different angle?  Will have to check back after the challenge to see if it''s the one I think.    I like the angle of the shot and the curves of the roof. The lighting is just about perfect but the white border line is distracting to me. If the crop was on that line the shot would be close to perfect in that aspect.   My gut instinct vote on this was a 4, it looked fuzzy and a bit dark at first but upon closer inspection I know now it was my glasses!  EEK!  :)  Raising your score to an 8', '2003-11-11 19:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(480913, 46130, 13749, '<td valign="top">at first, the yellow cast seemed a bit off to me.. but after looking at it longer, it gives it more of that "sacred" feeling than it would without it.  nice lighting.</td>', 'at first, the yellow cast seemed a bit off to me.. but after looking at it longer, it gives it more of that "sacred" feeling than it would without it.  nice lighting.', '2003-11-11 19:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(480919, 46130, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice bed, wish my bedroom was that nice and that I had a door!  The softness of the shot offers a feeling of tranquility and peace, just what a bedroom should be.  The lighting is a bit too yellow for my taste, maybe if it was toned down just a bit, even a little darker?  I started at a four on this shot, the right side is also a bit of a distraction, maybe a slightly tighter crop?  I''m raising it to a 7</td>', 'Nice bed, wish my bedroom was that nice and that I had a door!  The softness of the shot offers a feeling of tranquility and peace, just what a bedroom should be.  The lighting is a bit too yellow for my taste, maybe if it was toned down just a bit, even a little darker?  I started at a four on this shot, the right side is also a bit of a distraction, maybe a slightly tighter crop?  I''m raising it to a 7', '2003-11-11 19:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(480930, 46184, 12448, '<td valign="top">Now why would this have to be validated?  I see a great reflective shot myself that my gut instinct told me was a 4 to start because the reflection was so wavy but coming back and looking again, I like the lines, the way they draw you into the shot and the way they take you through.  A slightly less wavy effect would have gotten you a 9 or 10, raising to an 8</td>', 'Now why would this have to be validated?  I see a great reflective shot myself that my gut instinct told me was a 4 to start because the reflection was so wavy but coming back and looking again, I like the lines, the way they draw you into the shot and the way they take you through.  A slightly less wavy effect would have gotten you a 9 or 10, raising to an 8', '2003-11-11 19:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
