(480995, 46250, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing because of the three doors you are trying to say that you can choose door number one, two or three and your religion at the same time?  Interesting shot overall but the color really doesn''t do anything for me personally, maybe a black and white would have worked better?  The cutting off of the tips of the tops of the doors also leaves me wanting.  I started at a 4 on this but am raising it to a 7</td>', 'I''m guessing because of the three doors you are trying to say that you can choose door number one, two or three and your religion at the same time?  Interesting shot overall but the color really doesn''t do anything for me personally, maybe a black and white would have worked better?  The cutting off of the tips of the tops of the doors also leaves me wanting.  I started at a 4 on this but am raising it to a 7', '2003-11-11 19:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(481002, 46078, 12448, '<td valign="top">I know it''s misty and it really adds a sense of surrealness to the building in the background but my gut instinct vote on this one was a 4 because of the mist effect, I''m not a big fan of mist shots though I''ve tried them myself.  Coming back and I see the nice balance in this shot, the light is well done and the clarity is there if you look for it.  Going to an 8</td>', 'I know it''s misty and it really adds a sense of surrealness to the building in the background but my gut instinct vote on this one was a 4 because of the mist effect, I''m not a big fan of mist shots though I''ve tried them myself.  Coming back and I see the nice balance in this shot, the light is well done and the clarity is there if you look for it.  Going to an 8', '2003-11-11 19:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
