(481086, 46234, 12611, '<td valign="top">Awkward angle. Nice lighting, nice brown tones. strangely, it looks like a shadow is projected on a cloud or sky in th eupper right corner of the frame. Are those the heavenly shadows?  I like that.</td>', 'Awkward angle. Nice lighting, nice brown tones. strangely, it looks like a shadow is projected on a cloud or sky in th eupper right corner of the frame. Are those the heavenly shadows?  I like that.', '2003-11-11 21:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
