(481207, 46329, 6388, '<td valign="top">very nice.  feels lonely or something.  great tones...sepia is a difficult duptone to pull off well, and you - or your software ;) - did it well.<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'very nice.  feels lonely or something.  great tones...sepia is a difficult duptone to pull off well, and you - or your software ;) - did it well. Pedro', '2003-11-11 23:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(481211, 46265, 6388, '<td valign="top">the lighting needs work.  you can get rid of those hot spots by diffusing your light (or flash) through some tissue paper.  a little reflector use from behind, or some backlighting would fill in those shadows as well.  lastly, it might look a little softer on a darker surface - the white is overpowering in what i would consider a softer subject.  Nice idea, crisp focus.<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'the lighting needs work.  you can get rid of those hot spots by diffusing your light (or flash) through some tissue paper.  a little reflector use from behind, or some backlighting would fill in those shadows as well.  lastly, it might look a little softer on a darker surface - the white is overpowering in what i would consider a softer subject.  Nice idea, crisp focus. Pedro', '2003-11-11 23:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(481212, 46237, 6388, '<td valign="top">ahhh the Abbey :)  I miss golf already.  Stupid Calgary snow &lt;mutter, mumble&gt; oh...the picture..right.  your greens seem a little yellow (which may well be the time of year)  I''d maybe hue shift a little to green it up (so much cheaper than fertilizer).  I like the simple border.  might have cropped a little off the bottom to get rid of that tree or whatever it is in the bottom right corner.</td>', 'ahhh the Abbey :)  I miss golf already.  Stupid Calgary snow <mutter, mumble> oh...the picture..right.  your greens seem a little yellow (which may well be the time of year)  I''d maybe hue shift a little to green it up (so much cheaper than fertilizer).  I like the simple border.  might have cropped a little off the bottom to get rid of that tree or whatever it is in the bottom right corner.', '2003-11-11 23:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(481215, 46283, 6388, '<td valign="top">this is a hard angle to shoot from, given the shape of the bricks at the bottom.  cropping a little off the bottom might balance the image better (personal preference of course).  the colour is nice, but the sky flattens it out a little...a little fill-flash might have helped.  good job. -Pedro</td>', 'this is a hard angle to shoot from, given the shape of the bricks at the bottom.  cropping a little off the bottom might balance the image better (personal preference of course).  the colour is nice, but the sky flattens it out a little...a little fill-flash might have helped.  good job. -Pedro', '2003-11-11 23:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(481219, 45993, 6388, '<td valign="top">a little too much black in the foreground for my tastes, i might have cropped a little higher were it mine :)  nice rich colours, and i love the presence of the big tree up front.  -Pedro</td>', 'a little too much black in the foreground for my tastes, i might have cropped a little higher were it mine :)  nice rich colours, and i love the presence of the big tree up front.  -Pedro', '2003-11-11 23:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(481224, 46336, 6388, '<td valign="top">i would absolutely love this if you shot it at a different time of day.  the light hitting the left part of the building is just too overpowering to ignore.  that beautiful archway entry should be the focal point, in my opinion.  try it again at dusk or on a cloudy day :)  nice job.  -Pedro</td>', 'i would absolutely love this if you shot it at a different time of day.  the light hitting the left part of the building is just too overpowering to ignore.  that beautiful archway entry should be the focal point, in my opinion.  try it again at dusk or on a cloudy day :)  nice job.  -Pedro', '2003-11-11 23:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(481226, 46087, 6388, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I''m not the first to mention the compression artifacts (pixely appearance) of this.  The composition is very nice, and the light works well, but the quality detracts from it.  Let me know if you want help fixing that in the future...I''d love to help if I can. - Pedro</td>', 'I''m sure I''m not the first to mention the compression artifacts (pixely appearance) of this.  The composition is very nice, and the light works well, but the quality detracts from it.  Let me know if you want help fixing that in the future...I''d love to help if I can. - Pedro', '2003-11-11 23:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(481228, 46253, 6388, '<td valign="top">i like the idea, but it seems a little too busy to be relaxing to me ;).  try this same shot on a tree by itself...I''d be interested to see how it comes out. -Pedro</td>', 'i like the idea, but it seems a little too busy to be relaxing to me ;).  try this same shot on a tree by itself...I''d be interested to see how it comes out. -Pedro', '2003-11-11 23:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(481230, 46335, 6388, '<td valign="top">i like it. simple.  at first i thought it looked a little flat, but the softness is actually quite compelling. the subtle sunbeam is helpful.  nice simple border.  -Pedro</td>', 'i like it. simple.  at first i thought it looked a little flat, but the softness is actually quite compelling. the subtle sunbeam is helpful.  nice simple border.  -Pedro', '2003-11-11 23:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(481236, 46054, 6388, '<td valign="top">I''m going to start out by saying that i think this is a little too contrasty...the shadows obscure some of what i think are important details (like the face of the monument).  the sky is great.  i might have cropped a little off the left to simplify it a bit (only my preference, of course). Having said all that I''m using a pretty dark monitor, so I''m going to check back when i get home to see if i still feel the same way.  -Pedro</td>', 'I''m going to start out by saying that i think this is a little too contrasty...the shadows obscure some of what i think are important details (like the face of the monument).  the sky is great.  i might have cropped a little off the left to simplify it a bit (only my preference, of course). Having said all that I''m using a pretty dark monitor, so I''m going to check back when i get home to see if i still feel the same way.  -Pedro', '2003-11-11 23:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(481237, 46288, 6388, '<td valign="top">this is nice.  i like the slightly slower shutter to get the motion in the water, but it also seems to have a bit of blur from camera shake...did you use a tripod?  If not, that would solve it.  the colours are nice, but seem a little too much. a little less saturation would help i think.  good shot. -Pedro</td>', 'this is nice.  i like the slightly slower shutter to get the motion in the water, but it also seems to have a bit of blur from camera shake...did you use a tripod?  If not, that would solve it.  the colours are nice, but seem a little too much. a little less saturation would help i think.  good shot. -Pedro', '2003-11-11 23:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(481240, 45391, 6388, '<td valign="top">other than the border, i like this.  simple and soft.  the border however does not add to the image,and actually throws the perspective off a bit.  -Pedro</td>', 'other than the border, i like this.  simple and soft.  the border however does not add to the image,and actually throws the perspective off a bit.  -Pedro', '2003-11-11 23:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(481247, 46184, 6388, '<td valign="top">nice reflection  everybody thought it was photoshop I guess :)  i really like this.  assuming people treat it fairly, you should score quite well.  beautiful colours, and a crisp image.  -Pedro</td>', 'nice reflection  everybody thought it was photoshop I guess :)  i really like this.  assuming people treat it fairly, you should score quite well.  beautiful colours, and a crisp image.  -Pedro', '2003-11-12 00:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(481255, 46111, 6388, '<td valign="top">i don''t get the white line at the left side.  I assume it''s intentional, but it''s a little hard to place at first.  the tones are wonderful in this, and i really appreciate the concept.  nice simple border too. good job.  -Pedro</td>', 'i don''t get the white line at the left side.  I assume it''s intentional, but it''s a little hard to place at first.  the tones are wonderful in this, and i really appreciate the concept.  nice simple border too. good job.  -Pedro', '2003-11-12 00:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(481256, 46221, 12253, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture.  Wonderful light and colors, and hazy atmosphere.   I would have minimized the amount of the sky here, since it''s so white.</td>', 'Beautiful capture.  Wonderful light and colors, and hazy atmosphere.   I would have minimized the amount of the sky here, since it''s so white.', '2003-11-12 00:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(481266, 46036, 12253, '<td valign="top">A clever idea but the light was very flat that day.  I think you could have maybe found more interesting bank architecture and made a more dynamic picture.  this one''s a box.</td>', 'A clever idea but the light was very flat that day.  I think you could have maybe found more interesting bank architecture and made a more dynamic picture.  this one''s a box.', '2003-11-12 00:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(481292, 46014, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Good comp, though perhaps getting the tree in whole would have been good.  Also, it would have helped to run NeatImage on this.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Good comp, though perhaps getting the tree in whole would have been good.  Also, it would have helped to run NeatImage on this.', '2003-11-12 00:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(481461, 46336, 6130, '<td valign="top">This is good and I like it.</td>', 'This is good and I like it.', '2003-11-12 01:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(481465, 46268, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2003-11-12 02:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(481468, 46221, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like everything in this.</td>', 'I like everything in this.', '2003-11-12 02:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(481474, 46149, 6130, '<td valign="top">I don´t know why but I like this.Maybe it´s the light.</td>', 'I don´t know why but I like this.Maybe it´s the light.', '2003-11-12 02:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(481505, 45875, 6999, '<td valign="top">The noise in the sky is very odd - looks almost like it might be a serious amount of dust on your sensor, it has that irreguarity about it. There''s evidence of over-sharpening too - ghosting along the high contrast edges. But not a bad image; I think I''d have tried to bring in some foreground detail as well, which would add depth to it all, and those processing problems have robbed it of quite a bit of detail</td>', 'The noise in the sky is very odd - looks almost like it might be a serious amount of dust on your sensor, it has that irreguarity about it. There''s evidence of over-sharpening too - ghosting along the high contrast edges. But not a bad image; I think I''d have tried to bring in some foreground detail as well, which would add depth to it all, and those processing problems have robbed it of quite a bit of detail', '2003-11-12 02:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(481511, 46215, 6999, '<td valign="top">I think perhaps some work on the gradation of the mid-tones might help to bring out those rays of light a touch more. There''s a slightly wide-angle feeling to it too - that curve of the horizon, the nearer clouds, which hasn''t helped the impression of these clouds going on for ever: don;t know if the black one top of frame really helps that much - cropped out, and with therefore more contrast range to play with ... anyhow, good work.</td>', 'I think perhaps some work on the gradation of the mid-tones might help to bring out those rays of light a touch more. There''s a slightly wide-angle feeling to it too - that curve of the horizon, the nearer clouds, which hasn''t helped the impression of these clouds going on for ever: don;t know if the black one top of frame really helps that much - cropped out, and with therefore more contrast range to play with ... anyhow, good work.', '2003-11-12 02:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(481645, 46078, 4569, '<td valign="top">hola cielo, te he votado con un 10!!!!!, eres el mejor, la verdad es que quitando algún paisaje, las demás no son muy allá, verdad? Es muy buena (probablemente gane) la de la iglesia extraña en medio de unas montañas rojas tipo australia, le di un 6 pero se merece un 10...Te quiero!!</td>', 'hola cielo, te he votado con un 10!!!!!, eres el mejor, la verdad es que quitando algún paisaje, las demás no son muy allá, verdad? Es muy buena (probablemente gane) la de la iglesia extraña en medio de unas montañas rojas tipo australia, le di un 6 pero se merece un 10...Te quiero!!', '2003-11-12 04:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(481694, 46335, 14055, '<td valign="top">beautifull colors and composition, this is a winner for me.</td>', 'beautifull colors and composition, this is a winner for me.', '2003-11-12 06:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(481723, 45875, 14055, '<td valign="top">The sky doesn''t look to good. Its all grainy.</td>', 'The sky doesn''t look to good. Its all grainy.', '2003-11-12 06:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(481729, 46244, 8682, '<td valign="top">Very nice... I love your composition... 7</td>', 'Very nice... I love your composition... 7', '2003-11-12 06:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(481731, 46337, 8682, '<td valign="top">Beatiful, just beatiful. I love the composition with the bird in the up left.... 7<br/>One of my favourites of this week<br/></td>', 'Beatiful, just beatiful. I love the composition with the bird in the up left.... 7One of my favourites of this week', '2003-11-12 06:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(481733, 45700, 8682, '<td valign="top">Wow, wow, wow... what a great picture... I love the colour, one of my faovourites of this week.... 7<br/></td>', 'Wow, wow, wow... what a great picture... I love the colour, one of my faovourites of this week.... 7', '2003-11-12 06:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(481745, 46238, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting, composition and shadows. However, I think the wood grain really spoils the shot. A plain colour would have worked better for me. 6</td>', 'Wonderful lighting, composition and shadows. However, I think the wood grain really spoils the shot. A plain colour would have worked better for me. 6', '2003-11-12 07:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(482007, 46260, 9411, '<td valign="top">This would have been a wonderful shot if not for the light reflections on the lense.<br/>A polarizing filter would have helped and should have been able to still capture the rays. Good perspective and DOF.</td>', 'This would have been a wonderful shot if not for the light reflections on the lense.A polarizing filter would have helped and should have been able to still capture the rays. Good perspective and DOF.', '2003-11-12 10:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(482009, 46111, 9411, '<td valign="top">I applaud the subject and composition. The line down the left side is very distracting though. 6</td>', 'I applaud the subject and composition. The line down the left side is very distracting though. 6', '2003-11-12 10:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(482019, 46153, 9411, '<td valign="top">good use of sepia tones. The perspective is good but I''m rather feeling as though it will all tip over. A bit straighter in the frame would have helped. 7</td>', 'good use of sepia tones. The perspective is good but I''m rather feeling as though it will all tip over. A bit straighter in the frame would have helped. 7', '2003-11-12 10:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(482024, 46036, 9411, '<td valign="top">so true. The colours are a bit flat and I would suggest a bit more negative space at least at the top to give more interest to the shot. 5</td>', 'so true. The colours are a bit flat and I would suggest a bit more negative space at least at the top to give more interest to the shot. 5', '2003-11-12 10:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(482051, 46199, 7485, '<td valign="top">"ICK"? That''s a maybe not the best crop.</td>', '"ICK"? That''s a maybe not the best crop.', '2003-11-12 10:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(482067, 46183, 7485, '<td valign="top">I think there''s a very nice photo hiding in there if you crop in close to just the deer and immediate surround.</td>', 'I think there''s a very nice photo hiding in there if you crop in close to just the deer and immediate surround.', '2003-11-12 10:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(482239, 46230, 4321, '<td valign="top">I''ve been here (Sedona, I think) and the feeling is truly sacred and inspiring. Great shot</td>', 'I''ve been here (Sedona, I think) and the feeling is truly sacred and inspiring. Great shot', '2003-11-12 12:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(482297, 46249, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice composition; This would be helped by a more interesting sky.  Even as is, I think a haze filter and maybe polarizer would have helped.</td>', 'Nice composition; This would be helped by a more interesting sky.  Even as is, I think a haze filter and maybe polarizer would have helped.', '2003-11-12 12:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(482302, 46287, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nicely scene, but you really challenged yourself to a tough exposure!  The overexposed background is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nicely scene, but you really challenged yourself to a tough exposure!  The overexposed background is a bit distracting.', '2003-11-12 12:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(482305, 45973, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice sky and scene.  Not really a good horizon to measure, but it appears tilted slightly left.</td>', 'Nice sky and scene.  Not really a good horizon to measure, but it appears tilted slightly left.', '2003-11-12 12:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(482310, 46288, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice comp; good exposure; seems a little unsharp and unclear; perhaps movement blur for low shutter speed (not talking about the water, that''s fine, its the tree and rocks...)</td>', 'Nice comp; good exposure; seems a little unsharp and unclear; perhaps movement blur for low shutter speed (not talking about the water, that''s fine, its the tree and rocks...)', '2003-11-12 12:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(482353, 45970, 10077, '<td valign="top">I really like the title.  It fits the picture</td>', 'I really like the title.  It fits the picture', '2003-11-12 12:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(482391, 46036, 13991, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot.. all too true though.</td>', 'Fantastic shot.. all too true though.', '2003-11-12 12:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(482393, 45665, 13991, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting. Good Job.</td>', 'I like the lighting. Good Job.', '2003-11-12 13:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(482473, 45939, 4090, '<td valign="top">fab , great colours ,focus and compostion 10/10 hope this gets a ribbon</td>', 'fab , great colours ,focus and compostion 10/10 hope this gets a ribbon', '2003-11-12 13:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(482484, 45700, 4090, '<td valign="top">oh my god ... what a photo.... 10/10</td>', 'oh my god ... what a photo.... 10/10', '2003-11-12 13:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(482591, 46230, 14078, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, good resoulution.</td>', 'Very nice picture, good resoulution.', '2003-11-12 14:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(482610, 46291, 6008, '<td valign="top">I really like this. I think placing it in the center of the shadows/darkness works  for this image. Black and white also compliments it well and emphasizes the simplicity of it. A nice clean, sharp image with a good matching border.</td>', 'I really like this. I think placing it in the center of the shadows/darkness works  for this image. Black and white also compliments it well and emphasizes the simplicity of it. A nice clean, sharp image with a good matching border.', '2003-11-12 14:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(482611, 46100, 6008, '<td valign="top">I love the tones in this and the shadows really add some nice drama. It''s clean, sharp, almost abstract in a way.</td>', 'I love the tones in this and the shadows really add some nice drama. It''s clean, sharp, almost abstract in a way.', '2003-11-12 14:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(482615, 46090, 6008, '<td valign="top">There is a wonderful feeling of texture in this shot, and I think the black and white and contrasting grays really add to that. The composition is great with very strong lines. The dramatic sky compliments the tone of the building. This is a very classic image.</td>', 'There is a wonderful feeling of texture in this shot, and I think the black and white and contrasting grays really add to that. The composition is great with very strong lines. The dramatic sky compliments the tone of the building. This is a very classic image.', '2003-11-12 14:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(482618, 45700, 6008, '<td valign="top">My first thought was wow, that''s an amazing sky, such wonderful color, nice depth, and so pretty. But that''s about it really.</td>', 'My first thought was wow, that''s an amazing sky, such wonderful color, nice depth, and so pretty. But that''s about it really.', '2003-11-12 14:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(482635, 46281, 656, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t do much for me.  Seems to be some sort of statuette.</td>', 'Doesn''t do much for me.  Seems to be some sort of statuette.', '2003-11-12 15:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(482639, 46054, 656, '<td valign="top">Don''t know that the IR effect really improves or changes the composition or makes it more interesting.  Everything seems to be sliding to the left.</td>', 'Don''t know that the IR effect really improves or changes the composition or makes it more interesting.  Everything seems to be sliding to the left.', '2003-11-12 15:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(482642, 46130, 656, '<td valign="top">Soft focus mixes well with the soft lighting.   The double framing with the doors leading back to the bed is quite well done - though I''d maybe prefer not to have cropped the arrangement on the wall.  There doesn''t seem to be any real center of attention or point to his image - it seems like a great stage for an interesting picture to be made upon though.</td>', 'Soft focus mixes well with the soft lighting.   The double framing with the doors leading back to the bed is quite well done - though I''d maybe prefer not to have cropped the arrangement on the wall.  There doesn''t seem to be any real center of attention or point to his image - it seems like a great stage for an interesting picture to be made upon though.', '2003-11-12 15:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(482646, 46286, 656, '<td valign="top">Harsh light and shadows and an overall underexposed appearance  makes this not very interesting</td>', 'Harsh light and shadows and an overall underexposed appearance  makes this not very interesting', '2003-11-12 15:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(482649, 46230, 656, '<td valign="top">Dramatic location, strong colour, good framing</td>', 'Dramatic location, strong colour, good framing', '2003-11-12 15:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(482653, 46237, 656, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Great light, good framing, good colour.  A great stage.  Where are the actors ?  It really needs some people to provide some interest and focus</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Great light, good framing, good colour.  A great stage.  Where are the actors ?  It really needs some people to provide some interest and focus', '2003-11-12 15:13:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(482658, 45918, 656, '<td valign="top">spider webs make for interesting dew pictures - not so sure about the heavy black ''thing'' through the frame.  The water droplet reflections being out of focus and the at the same time the main point of interest is quite jarring.</td>', 'spider webs make for interesting dew pictures - not so sure about the heavy black ''thing'' through the frame.  The water droplet reflections being out of focus and the at the same time the main point of interest is quite jarring.', '2003-11-12 15:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(482661, 46149, 656, '<td valign="top">Competently taken, but I don''t quite see what the point was.  There seems to be a riot of options for close-ups and macro shots within this subject to make some really great abstract images.  This feels like a prelude to the real photography</td>', 'Competently taken, but I don''t quite see what the point was.  There seems to be a riot of options for close-ups and macro shots within this subject to make some really great abstract images.  This feels like a prelude to the real photography', '2003-11-12 15:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(482662, 45939, 811, '<td valign="top">Excellent work.  The exposure here is right on, and I like how the tallest part is also the brightest -  it really attracts the viewer''s attention.</td>', 'Excellent work.  The exposure here is right on, and I like how the tallest part is also the brightest -  it really attracts the viewer''s attention.', '2003-11-12 15:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(482663, 46217, 656, '<td valign="top">Some interesting clouds but a whole lot of wasted space and a very small tower doesn''t give much real focal point or interest.</td>', 'Some interesting clouds but a whole lot of wasted space and a very small tower doesn''t give much real focal point or interest.', '2003-11-12 15:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(482665, 45379, 811, '<td valign="top">this is cool.  I like the coloring -  it is balanced and adds interest to the shot.  Also, the "backlighting" gives this a very interesting feeling.</td>', 'this is cool.  I like the coloring -  it is balanced and adds interest to the shot.  Also, the "backlighting" gives this a very interesting feeling.', '2003-11-12 15:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(482667, 46183, 656, '<td valign="top">The foreground elements could provide great framing, but somehow it doesn''t work in this shot - the out of focus tree seems to clash with the other trees in the scene, all doing their utmost to detract attention from the deer, which I think was your subject</td>', 'The foreground elements could provide great framing, but somehow it doesn''t work in this shot - the out of focus tree seems to clash with the other trees in the scene, all doing their utmost to detract attention from the deer, which I think was your subject', '2003-11-12 15:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(482670, 46329, 656, '<td valign="top">Cute title.  Effect image.  Wish I could see the ''other'' side of the leaned on stone - did it have writing ?  I wonder if the B&amp;W, removing all the green actually detracts from this scene ?</td>', 'Cute title.  Effect image.  Wish I could see the ''other'' side of the leaned on stone - did it have writing ?  I wonder if the B&W, removing all the green actually detracts from this scene ?', '2003-11-12 15:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(482671, 45912, 811, '<td valign="top">I love the "richness" of the tones in this.</td>', 'I love the "richness" of the tones in this.', '2003-11-12 15:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(482672, 46036, 656, '<td valign="top">A very literal depiction, without much of anything to provide interest.  THe subject isn''t very visually exciting in the first place, though the widows and red panels could maybe be an interesting subject if photographed appropriately. 2</td>', 'A very literal depiction, without much of anything to provide interest.  THe subject isn''t very visually exciting in the first place, though the widows and red panels could maybe be an interesting subject if photographed appropriately. 2', '2003-11-12 15:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(482673, 46291, 811, '<td valign="top">Good exposure -- the lights are blown out, but you can still see much of the building.  Good choice for black and white, I think.</td>', 'Good exposure -- the lights are blown out, but you can still see much of the building.  Good choice for black and white, I think.', '2003-11-12 15:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(482674, 46035, 656, '<td valign="top">Very low contrast and an overal grey feeling.  Also seems quite busy - a closer abstrction to focus on some detail might make a stronger image</td>', 'Very low contrast and an overal grey feeling.  Also seems quite busy - a closer abstrction to focus on some detail might make a stronger image', '2003-11-12 15:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(482676, 46164, 811, '<td valign="top">I wanted to do something like this, but the light and the building didn''t quite match up.  Yours is much better than any I would have done, anyway -- great work.  Beautiful warm colors.</td>', 'I wanted to do something like this, but the light and the building didn''t quite match up.  Yours is much better than any I would have done, anyway -- great work.  Beautiful warm colors.', '2003-11-12 15:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(482677, 46115, 811, '<td valign="top">A powerful picture.</td>', 'A powerful picture.', '2003-11-12 15:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(482679, 46336, 656, '<td valign="top">Nice warm tones - but it feels like the shot was taken at the wrong time of day - all of the light is ''elsewhere.  Could be good with someone standing in the arches - maybe a bride</td>', 'Nice warm tones - but it feels like the shot was taken at the wrong time of day - all of the light is ''elsewhere.  Could be good with someone standing in the arches - maybe a bride', '2003-11-12 15:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(482681, 46237, 811, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I think this would also be a neat shot to show the four seasons in -- shot in fall, spring and summer, to show the differences.  Very well done.</td>', 'Great shot.  I think this would also be a neat shot to show the four seasons in -- shot in fall, spring and summer, to show the differences.  Very well done.', '2003-11-12 15:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(482682, 46288, 656, '<td valign="top">Whole image seems blurry as if the camera was handheld without enough light.  Strong top 2/3rds but the bottom 1/3rd could easily be removed</td>', 'Whole image seems blurry as if the camera was handheld without enough light.  Strong top 2/3rds but the bottom 1/3rd could easily be removed', '2003-11-12 15:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(482683, 46153, 656, '<td valign="top">A tough exposure to get right.  The buildings could really do with some more contrast</td>', 'A tough exposure to get right.  The buildings could really do with some more contrast', '2003-11-12 15:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(482686, 46144, 656, '<td valign="top">Any reason for the tilt ?  I don''t see how it improves this shot of a tower - its still just a tower, but now it is tilted</td>', 'Any reason for the tilt ?  I don''t see how it improves this shot of a tower - its still just a tower, but now it is tilted', '2003-11-12 15:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(482687, 45970, 656, '<td valign="top">Good choice making the trees the subject, rather than the sunset.</td>', 'Good choice making the trees the subject, rather than the sunset.', '2003-11-12 15:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(482691, 46341, 656, '<td valign="top">Shame you couldn''t get the whole of orion into the shot.  Well exposed given the range though.</td>', 'Shame you couldn''t get the whole of orion into the shot.  Well exposed given the range though.', '2003-11-12 15:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(482693, 45999, 656, '<td valign="top">its a grave, with some sun.  A very common subject.   Could possibly be good with some more thought to show something unique or different.   The tree in the background seems randomly located or accidental</td>', 'its a grave, with some sun.  A very common subject.   Could possibly be good with some more thought to show something unique or different.   The tree in the background seems randomly located or accidental', '2003-11-12 15:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(482694, 46111, 811, '<td valign="top">An interesting concept and idea.  I think the overall picture effectiveness could have been improved by a sharper focus on the typewriter, and perhaps a more horizontal crop because it feels really tight to me.</td>', 'An interesting concept and idea.  I think the overall picture effectiveness could have been improved by a sharper focus on the typewriter, and perhaps a more horizontal crop because it feels really tight to me.', '2003-11-12 15:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(482697, 46231, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this, but I think the overall effectiveness would be increased if it were slightly more in focus.</td>', 'I like the colors in this, but I think the overall effectiveness would be increased if it were slightly more in focus.', '2003-11-12 15:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(482698, 46000, 656, '<td valign="top">good, literal depiction of the theme and a reasonable recording of what is there</td>', 'good, literal depiction of the theme and a reasonable recording of what is there', '2003-11-12 15:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(482701, 46298, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition, and generally good lighting.  It feels like you need to move a couple of steps to the right and get it straighter -- if feels slightly tilted to me.</td>', 'Good composition, and generally good lighting.  It feels like you need to move a couple of steps to the right and get it straighter -- if feels slightly tilted to me.', '2003-11-12 15:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(482705, 46168, 811, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and subject choice.  I like that details are visible throughout, but it seems like the focus is just a hair off, and there are some overexposed spots on the flower (?) in front.</td>', 'Interesting composition and subject choice.  I like that details are visible throughout, but it seems like the focus is just a hair off, and there are some overexposed spots on the flower (?) in front.', '2003-11-12 15:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(482706, 46278, 656, '<td valign="top">This light seems really bad for the subject - lots of hard, harsh and unpleasant shadows - almost as if you''d used car headlights or a spot light.  Some other time of day would have helped, but it would still be a very straight on composition of a church</td>', 'This light seems really bad for the subject - lots of hard, harsh and unpleasant shadows - almost as if you''d used car headlights or a spot light.  Some other time of day would have helped, but it would still be a very straight on composition of a church', '2003-11-12 15:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(482709, 46149, 811, '<td valign="top">Good exposure -- the details are visible throughout.  Would it have been possible to get a more dramatic view of the staircase, as that seems to be the focal point of the picture?</td>', 'Good exposure -- the details are visible throughout.  Would it have been possible to get a more dramatic view of the staircase, as that seems to be the focal point of the picture?', '2003-11-12 15:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(482711, 46201, 656, '<td valign="top">The way the light is for this shot, it seems that everything but the barn is highlighted, from the bright foreground to the bright background.  You have a good idea, but you''d need to wait until the light changed - the dark twig through the frame doesn''t help much either</td>', 'The way the light is for this shot, it seems that everything but the barn is highlighted, from the bright foreground to the bright background.  You have a good idea, but you''d need to wait until the light changed - the dark twig through the frame doesn''t help much either', '2003-11-12 15:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(482712, 46132, 811, '<td valign="top">More light on the front of the building would have made this more effective I think.  If it was a long exposure, perhaps using a strong flashlight and shining it (kinda a painting thing) would have helped to bring out some of the details.  Or, get another camera and use its flash to illuminate the building more.  That way, perhaps you could have cut back on the exposure time and not overexposed the lights.</td>', 'More light on the front of the building would have made this more effective I think.  If it was a long exposure, perhaps using a strong flashlight and shining it (kinda a painting thing) would have helped to bring out some of the details.  Or, get another camera and use its flash to illuminate the building more.  That way, perhaps you could have cut back on the exposure time and not overexposed the lights.', '2003-11-12 15:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(482714, 46261, 656, '<td valign="top">Great colours - wish you hadn''t lost half the reflection though - Somehow you must have been able to get the sky, house and reflections all in the frame!  Maybe a really low angle to the water ?  Good shot - though the harsh shadows across the left of the building indicate a better time of day would have improved things ?</td>', 'Great colours - wish you hadn''t lost half the reflection though - Somehow you must have been able to get the sky, house and reflections all in the frame!  Maybe a really low angle to the water ?  Good shot - though the harsh shadows across the left of the building indicate a better time of day would have improved things ?', '2003-11-12 15:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(482715, 46201, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and colors in this, but I feel it suffers from not having something in good focus.  Either the leaves in the foreground or the barn in the distance needs to be in focus to give this shot "punch" I think.</td>', 'I really like the composition and colors in this, but I feel it suffers from not having something in good focus.  Either the leaves in the foreground or the barn in the distance needs to be in focus to give this shot "punch" I think.', '2003-11-12 15:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(482717, 46272, 656, '<td valign="top">Nice mirroring of the guard and the monument .<br/> <br/>Shame you didn''t ask him to step forward into that ''space'' and line things up more .  A lower angle would have helped you hide all the clutter at the bottom of the monument too (cranes, buildings etc)</td>', 'Nice mirroring of the guard and the monument . Shame you didn''t ask him to step forward into that ''space'' and line things up more .  A lower angle would have helped you hide all the clutter at the bottom of the monument too (cranes, buildings etc)', '2003-11-12 15:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(482718, 46319, 656, '<td valign="top">Good composition, leads the eye through the frame.  Shame there is no pay-off for following it back though.  Feels like something is missing.</td>', 'Good composition, leads the eye through the frame.  Shame there is no pay-off for following it back though.  Feels like something is missing.', '2003-11-12 15:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(482730, 46287, 656, '<td valign="top">The tree is a good element to use to frame this barn, but you''ve hidden it behind the tree too much - looks like there could have been a strong composition about 3 steps to the left and pointing back towards the barn.<br/> <br/>The light is extremely harsh too - looking to be almost mid-day - this is about the worst time you could be trying to take a shot like this</td>', 'The tree is a good element to use to frame this barn, but you''ve hidden it behind the tree too much - looks like there could have been a strong composition about 3 steps to the left and pointing back towards the barn. The light is extremely harsh too - looking to be almost mid-day - this is about the worst time you could be trying to take a shot like this', '2003-11-12 15:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(482734, 46249, 656, '<td valign="top">Great frame with the trees, lovely colours, good location - perhaps wrong time of day or just very dull, flat light.  some sort of GND filter would have helped with the sky exposure to keep things more even.  Great potential. (6)</td>', 'Great frame with the trees, lovely colours, good location - perhaps wrong time of day or just very dull, flat light.  some sort of GND filter would have helped with the sky exposure to keep things more even.  Great potential. (6)', '2003-11-12 15:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(482737, 46285, 656, '<td valign="top">Its a sign, in front of the building.  Other than that, I don''t see much of interest.(3)</td>', 'Its a sign, in front of the building.  Other than that, I don''t see much of interest.(3)', '2003-11-12 15:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(482740, 46253, 656, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t feel very relaxing.  The one tree with leaves seems to be poking in to the side as an afterthought or accident</td>', 'Doesn''t feel very relaxing.  The one tree with leaves seems to be poking in to the side as an afterthought or accident', '2003-11-12 15:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(482745, 46221, 656, '<td valign="top">Huge potential but the exposure needs more attention.  The bush in the lower right dosn''t seem to be included deliberately.  I''d suggest cropping evenly just above the tree line and reflection, but the sky will still be overexposed.</td>', 'Huge potential but the exposure needs more attention.  The bush in the lower right dosn''t seem to be included deliberately.  I''d suggest cropping evenly just above the tree line and reflection, but the sky will still be overexposed.', '2003-11-12 15:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(482750, 46028, 656, '<td valign="top">Using the trees as a frame can be a good element - but they just appear from nowhere for example in the upper left .  You''ve exposed the sky correctly but as a result left the building underexposed - a different time of day with better light seems to be required (2)</td>', 'Using the trees as a frame can be a good element - but they just appear from nowhere for example in the upper left .  You''ve exposed the sky correctly but as a result left the building underexposed - a different time of day with better light seems to be required (2)', '2003-11-12 15:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(482754, 46090, 656, '<td valign="top">Nice and dramatic - good abstraction from the building, like the burnt out cross and the light makes some interesting shadows.    I think there must be a time of day when the front cross would be shadowed on the rear building and that might make an even stronger image</td>', 'Nice and dramatic - good abstraction from the building, like the burnt out cross and the light makes some interesting shadows.    I think there must be a time of day when the front cross would be shadowed on the rear building and that might make an even stronger image', '2003-11-12 15:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(482755, 46301, 656, '<td valign="top">Interesting building, but really poor lighting to show it off.  Also seems to want a portrait orientation or a much tigher shot of the domes</td>', 'Interesting building, but really poor lighting to show it off.  Also seems to want a portrait orientation or a much tigher shot of the domes', '2003-11-12 15:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(482758, 46014, 656, '<td valign="top">Wow - that is awesome.  Striking, graphic, seems almost unreal.  Cool shot.</td>', 'Wow - that is awesome.  Striking, graphic, seems almost unreal.  Cool shot.', '2003-11-12 15:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(482761, 45874, 656, '<td valign="top">Yes, its a toilet.  Well done.  and you used a threshold function on it.  again, well done.  But other than that, why ?</td>', 'Yes, its a toilet.  Well done.  and you used a threshold function on it.  again, well done.  But other than that, why ?', '2003-11-12 15:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(482763, 46234, 656, '<td valign="top">Yup  I can see the shadow on the cloud and its a church, but I don''t get much more from it than that (3)</td>', 'Yup  I can see the shadow on the cloud and its a church, but I don''t get much more from it than that (3)', '2003-11-12 15:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(482765, 46164, 656, '<td valign="top">Good potential, maybe if shot from a less straight on position</td>', 'Good potential, maybe if shot from a less straight on position', '2003-11-12 15:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(482766, 46191, 656, '<td valign="top">The bright light in the lower right of your frame grabs all the attention away from what I assume was the point of your picture - you need to pay a bit more attention to highlights in the frame!</td>', 'The bright light in the lower right of your frame grabs all the attention away from what I assume was the point of your picture - you need to pay a bit more attention to highlights in the frame!', '2003-11-12 15:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(482775, 46087, 656, '<td valign="top">Suffers from bad JPEG compression.  Looks like it might have been good light to shoot in but your camera quality settings or post processing have really hurt the picture quality (3)</td>', 'Suffers from bad JPEG compression.  Looks like it might have been good light to shoot in but your camera quality settings or post processing have really hurt the picture quality (3)', '2003-11-12 15:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(482778, 45391, 656, '<td valign="top">Feels like a scene from a widescreen movie.  Very clean  (the image, well - and the bath!)   Seems like a perfect set for an interesting picture to be taken - when the subject arrives.</td>', 'Feels like a scene from a widescreen movie.  Very clean  (the image, well - and the bath!)   Seems like a perfect set for an interesting picture to be taken - when the subject arrives.', '2003-11-12 15:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(482781, 46304, 656, '<td valign="top">lots of potential - and feels like its almost there - the composition just seems a touch out of wack - with the top cross being cropped, and the left one merging with the roof behind it.  A scene with a lot of potental.  The tree shadow doesn''t seem appropriate either</td>', 'lots of potential - and feels like its almost there - the composition just seems a touch out of wack - with the top cross being cropped, and the left one merging with the roof behind it.  A scene with a lot of potental.  The tree shadow doesn''t seem appropriate either', '2003-11-12 16:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(482794, 46234, 3087, '<td valign="top">ery sacred. Unusual perspective. Just doesnt grab - nothing of real interest visually, ya know?<br/></td>', 'ery sacred. Unusual perspective. Just doesnt grab - nothing of real interest visually, ya know?', '2003-11-12 16:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(482806, 45823, 656, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of a very wide angle lens.  The effect still leaves it as a shot of a green door though.</td>', 'Interesting use of a very wide angle lens.  The effect still leaves it as a shot of a green door though.', '2003-11-12 16:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(482808, 46238, 656, '<td valign="top">looks like you could have done some more interesting things with the shadows with a different orientation or light source</td>', 'looks like you could have done some more interesting things with the shadows with a different orientation or light source', '2003-11-12 16:10:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(482812, 45993, 656, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, but somehow lacking a subject or point</td>', 'Nice scene, but somehow lacking a subject or point', '2003-11-12 16:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(482815, 46244, 656, '<td valign="top">Looks all alone up there!  Was there an eclipse or something ?  Haven''t seen such a reddish tint very often.</td>', 'Looks all alone up there!  Was there an eclipse or something ?  Haven''t seen such a reddish tint very often.', '2003-11-12 16:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(482818, 46303, 656, '<td valign="top">Lots of potential - if you could get some dramatic light.  Seems to be a lot of dirt on your lens or sensor too (e.g., upper right)</td>', 'Lots of potential - if you could get some dramatic light.  Seems to be a lot of dirt on your lens or sensor too (e.g., upper right)', '2003-11-12 16:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(482821, 46337, 656, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple.  Good capture</td>', 'Nice and simple.  Good capture', '2003-11-12 16:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(482823, 46254, 656, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried commenting on everything, but this doesn''t leave me with anything to say.</td>', 'I''ve tried commenting on everything, but this doesn''t leave me with anything to say.', '2003-11-12 16:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(482824, 46260, 656, '<td valign="top">Great light, good scene, but your camera has done horrible things with the noise and saturation, particularly in the clouds.  Least I hope it was your camera.</td>', 'Great light, good scene, but your camera has done horrible things with the noise and saturation, particularly in the clouds.  Least I hope it was your camera.', '2003-11-12 16:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(482825, 45700, 656, '<td valign="top">Wow - looks like the opening scene from Revelations or something.  The final battle is beginning.  Great sky</td>', 'Wow - looks like the opening scene from Revelations or something.  The final battle is beginning.  Great sky', '2003-11-12 16:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(482828, 46221, 13957, '<td valign="top">I must tell you that this was my favorite shot of this series.</td>', 'I must tell you that this was my favorite shot of this series.', '2003-11-12 16:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(482836, 45939, 656, '<td valign="top">well shot, well exposed, and a great time - the dusk light gives just enough defintion in the sky to keep it interesting</td>', 'well shot, well exposed, and a great time - the dusk light gives just enough defintion in the sky to keep it interesting', '2003-11-12 16:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(482837, 46331, 656, '<td valign="top">Very well lit statuette</td>', 'Very well lit statuette', '2003-11-12 16:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(482840, 46017, 656, '<td valign="top">Well composed door.</td>', 'Well composed door.', '2003-11-12 16:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(482841, 46100, 656, '<td valign="top">this is pretty cool - almost an abstraction of what a church or cathedral is - raising it up to being a more generic ''sacred place'' rather than this specific place.  The light has broken it down into some of the component pieces and you''ve exposed it to hide everything else.  The toning works well too. (10)</td>', 'this is pretty cool - almost an abstraction of what a church or cathedral is - raising it up to being a more generic ''sacred place'' rather than this specific place.  The light has broken it down into some of the component pieces and you''ve exposed it to hide everything else.  The toning works well too. (10)', '2003-11-12 16:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(482854, 45830, 656, '<td valign="top">The orange and blue add an interesting accent that lifts this image</td>', 'The orange and blue add an interesting accent that lifts this image', '2003-11-12 16:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(482855, 46215, 656, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  Just great.  Big sky, cool light - fantastic.</td>', 'Awesome.  Just great.  Big sky, cool light - fantastic.', '2003-11-12 16:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(482859, 46250, 656, '<td valign="top">Is this in San Diego ?  If it is I think I took a shot of this once :)<br/> <br/>The triple door is a strong element along with the triple arches.  Just needs someone walking past or opening a door to lift this to the next level</td>', 'Is this in San Diego ?  If it is I think I took a shot of this once :) The triple door is a strong element along with the triple arches.  Just needs someone walking past or opening a door to lift this to the next level', '2003-11-12 16:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(482882, 45379, 656, '<td valign="top">great use of light and colour.  Is that the same person on the left and right ?</td>', 'great use of light and colour.  Is that the same person on the left and right ?', '2003-11-12 16:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(482883, 45912, 656, '<td valign="top">a competent shot of a pulpit</td>', 'a competent shot of a pulpit', '2003-11-12 16:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(482884, 45268, 656, '<td valign="top">good composition, but I''d rather have seen the upper window not cropped.  Good exposure given the conditions too.  some people would have added some focal point or needed interest.</td>', 'good composition, but I''d rather have seen the upper window not cropped.  Good exposure given the conditions too.  some people would have added some focal point or needed interest.', '2003-11-12 16:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(482887, 45864, 656, '<td valign="top">good light, nice colour, very straight on.</td>', 'good light, nice colour, very straight on.', '2003-11-12 17:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(482963, 45268, 2553, '<td valign="top">I quite love this shot, and after coming back to it several times, have rated it higher.  The great repetition of lines and patterns gives this shot a lot of strength.  I like the lighting, and the somewhat "soft focus" around the stained glass windows.  The photo definitely represents something that is sacred to me, evokes the feeling of peace that I get in a church.  The only thing that detracts from the shot, for me, is the overwhelming expanse of red carpet at the bottom of the shot.  I would love to have seen some of that cropped out; it makes the photo feel somewhat unbalance to me.</td>', 'I quite love this shot, and after coming back to it several times, have rated it higher.  The great repetition of lines and patterns gives this shot a lot of strength.  I like the lighting, and the somewhat "soft focus" around the stained glass windows.  The photo definitely represents something that is sacred to me, evokes the feeling of peace that I get in a church.  The only thing that detracts from the shot, for me, is the overwhelming expanse of red carpet at the bottom of the shot.  I would love to have seen some of that cropped out; it makes the photo feel somewhat unbalance to me.', '2003-11-12 18:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(482980, 46286, 13381, '<td valign="top">In retrospect, I''m surprised nobody else used this idea, but since they didn''t, you get originality points.  And composition points, and technical points -- it''s really a very nice shot.</td>', 'In retrospect, I''m surprised nobody else used this idea, but since they didn''t, you get originality points.  And composition points, and technical points -- it''s really a very nice shot.', '2003-11-12 18:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(482993, 46221, 6870, '<td valign="top">You''ve give this a very sacred feel with your subdued colors and quiet composition.</td>', 'You''ve give this a very sacred feel with your subdued colors and quiet composition.', '2003-11-12 18:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(483007, 45864, 13381, '<td valign="top">I love the rust red and tan colors against that brilliantly blue sky.  The composition of this photo is lovely, as well.</td>', 'I love the rust red and tan colors against that brilliantly blue sky.  The composition of this photo is lovely, as well.', '2003-11-12 18:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(483021, 46231, 6870, '<td valign="top">The trees are a bit fuzzy, but the photo does build a sacred mood with your colors and tones. Nice.</td>', 'The trees are a bit fuzzy, but the photo does build a sacred mood with your colors and tones. Nice.', '2003-11-12 18:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(483022, 45912, 6870, '<td valign="top">Tones are just marvelous here. Nice B/W</td>', 'Tones are just marvelous here. Nice B/W', '2003-11-12 18:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(483026, 46149, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. I know some scholars who would laud you and claim that such places are indeed some of our most sacred. So great job! You might to experiment with a bit more contrast and/or color saturation, but I like the point of view, and the interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. I know some scholars who would laud you and claim that such places are indeed some of our most sacred. So great job! You might to experiment with a bit more contrast and/or color saturation, but I like the point of view, and the interpretation of the challenge.', '2003-11-12 18:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(483031, 45874, 6870, '<td valign="top">To be so graphic with your image doesn''t bother me so long as I know why. This communicates the majesty of the toilet very well both with the extreme contrast and the point of view. I''m not sure it communicates ''sacred'' to me, though.</td>', 'To be so graphic with your image doesn''t bother me so long as I know why. This communicates the majesty of the toilet very well both with the extreme contrast and the point of view. I''m not sure it communicates ''sacred'' to me, though.', '2003-11-12 18:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(483035, 45455, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation. It would sure be nice to be closer to that church in the window--and the outside. I like the tones here, and the contrast between sacred and non-sacred space.</td>', 'Interesting interpretation. It would sure be nice to be closer to that church in the window--and the outside. I like the tones here, and the contrast between sacred and non-sacred space.', '2003-11-12 18:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(483037, 45700, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s drama! Colors and lines make this image work for me in communicating the POWER of the heavens! 10</td>', 'Wow, that''s drama! Colors and lines make this image work for me in communicating the POWER of the heavens! 10', '2003-11-12 18:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(483041, 46244, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice work with a far away subject! I like the negative space here--it conjures so much more than the moon itself can communicate.</td>', 'Nice work with a far away subject! I like the negative space here--it conjures so much more than the moon itself can communicate.', '2003-11-12 18:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(483045, 46260, 6870, '<td valign="top">This image is quite grainy, but I like it a lot. The clouds, sparkling water and rocks in the foreground really combine to create a sacred mood.</td>', 'This image is quite grainy, but I like it a lot. The clouds, sparkling water and rocks in the foreground really combine to create a sacred mood.', '2003-11-12 18:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(483047, 46201, 6870, '<td valign="top">I was recently involved with a Barn project for the Smithsonian, and we often posited that barns were a sacred icon of our heritage! So nice work! The haze and colors work well to support your theme, too.</td>', 'I was recently involved with a Barn project for the Smithsonian, and we often posited that barns were a sacred icon of our heritage! So nice work! The haze and colors work well to support your theme, too.', '2003-11-12 18:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(483048, 45970, 6870, '<td valign="top">The three trees are like the HOly Trinity here, but in disguise! Wonderful use of silhouette. Marvelous and clear sunset shot!</td>', 'The three trees are like the HOly Trinity here, but in disguise! Wonderful use of silhouette. Marvelous and clear sunset shot!', '2003-11-12 18:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(483052, 45391, 6870, '<td valign="top">You''ve chosen the right colors and tones here to communicate the sacredness (grin) of this space!</td>', 'You''ve chosen the right colors and tones here to communicate the sacredness (grin) of this space!', '2003-11-12 18:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(483058, 46121, 6870, '<td valign="top">The colors and tones here evoke a sacred mood, but I''m afraid I''m missing other clues. I''ll think about it some more...</td>', 'The colors and tones here evoke a sacred mood, but I''m afraid I''m missing other clues. I''ll think about it some more...', '2003-11-12 18:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(483062, 46249, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice framing by the trees, and the colors are subdued and saturated, leading to a sacred mood. I do wish the tower in the back were a little clearer. But nice composition and nice work.</td>', 'Nice framing by the trees, and the colors are subdued and saturated, leading to a sacred mood. I do wish the tower in the back were a little clearer. But nice composition and nice work.', '2003-11-12 18:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(483064, 46183, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and colors for a sacred mood, and good eye for seeing her!</td>', 'Nice tones and colors for a sacred mood, and good eye for seeing her!', '2003-11-12 18:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(483068, 46286, 6870, '<td valign="top">I really like this idea. The skin tones and shadows/highlights would appear much more natural in natural sunlight. Try taking this outside on a bright day, but in shade to avoid harsh shadows. Nice composition; centered is a good choice for this subject.</td>', 'I really like this idea. The skin tones and shadows/highlights would appear much more natural in natural sunlight. Try taking this outside on a bright day, but in shade to avoid harsh shadows. Nice composition; centered is a good choice for this subject.', '2003-11-12 19:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(483069, 46114, 6870, '<td valign="top">Tones and colors build a sacred mood here. Nice work.</td>', 'Tones and colors build a sacred mood here. Nice work.', '2003-11-12 19:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(483071, 46036, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve used colors and tones to build a sacred mood for this ironic shot.</td>', 'I like how you''ve used colors and tones to build a sacred mood for this ironic shot.', '2003-11-12 19:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(483073, 46217, 6870, '<td valign="top">This might work better with a tighter crop on that tower, but I love the clouds the light,and the mood.</td>', 'This might work better with a tighter crop on that tower, but I love the clouds the light,and the mood.', '2003-11-12 19:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(483075, 46017, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super use of color and tone to communciate the sacred.</td>', 'Super use of color and tone to communciate the sacred.', '2003-11-12 19:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(483077, 46272, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like this idea a lot! I suppose the Washington Monument is sacred, so that''s okay. It would be nice if the guard were in a less casual pose so the sacred theme could be reinforced even more.</td>', 'I like this idea a lot! I suppose the Washington Monument is sacred, so that''s okay. It would be nice if the guard were in a less casual pose so the sacred theme could be reinforced even more.', '2003-11-12 19:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(483079, 45237, 6870, '<td valign="top">In a sacred space looking out--good idea. And I like the snow on all of the trees, too, which highlight the sacred theme further.</td>', 'In a sacred space looking out--good idea. And I like the snow on all of the trees, too, which highlight the sacred theme further.', '2003-11-12 19:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(483082, 46130, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color and soft focus here!</td>', 'Nice use of color and soft focus here!', '2003-11-12 19:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(483083, 46187, 6870, '<td valign="top">The tones here help craft a sacred mood. I''m a bit puzzled, though, by the water and do wish that something in the image were in sharp focus. Nice composition and exposure.</td>', 'The tones here help craft a sacred mood. I''m a bit puzzled, though, by the water and do wish that something in the image were in sharp focus. Nice composition and exposure.', '2003-11-12 19:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(483086, 46101, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and tones here! They help you build your sacred mood. I like the contrast between building and sky, too. 9</td>', 'Nice colors and tones here! They help you build your sacred mood. I like the contrast between building and sky, too. 9', '2003-11-12 19:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(483089, 46090, 6870, '<td valign="top">What I find wonderful here is that the sky so resembles the texture of the church! Nice work! 9</td>', 'What I find wonderful here is that the sky so resembles the texture of the church! Nice work! 9', '2003-11-12 19:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(483091, 46285, 6870, '<td valign="top">Some nice irony here. I wish things were more in focus, but I like the humor and the point of view with the building behind the sign.</td>', 'Some nice irony here. I wish things were more in focus, but I like the humor and the point of view with the building behind the sign.', '2003-11-12 19:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(483092, 46303, 6870, '<td valign="top">...to me too! The fog here helps build your sacred mood.</td>', '...to me too! The fog here helps build your sacred mood.', '2003-11-12 19:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(483148, 46329, 4985, '<td valign="top">This is quite special if you REALLY think about it. 9.0</td>', 'This is quite special if you REALLY think about it. 9.0', '2003-11-12 19:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(483193, 46111, 12674, '<td valign="top">I''m a bit confused by what all is in the picture, but I like the overall concept.</td>', 'I''m a bit confused by what all is in the picture, but I like the overall concept.', '2003-11-12 20:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(483197, 46092, 12674, '<td valign="top">Very attractive shot.</td>', 'Very attractive shot.', '2003-11-12 20:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(483215, 46130, 12674, '<td valign="top">I like the softness and the warmth.</td>', 'I like the softness and the warmth.', '2003-11-12 20:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(483217, 46249, 12674, '<td valign="top">Outstanding composition. Dark border does great job of highlighting foreground branches.</td>', 'Outstanding composition. Dark border does great job of highlighting foreground branches.', '2003-11-12 20:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(483219, 45830, 12674, '<td valign="top">I''m a little confused at where I should focus my attention. I''m guessing this is some kind of rock shelter archeological site?</td>', 'I''m a little confused at where I should focus my attention. I''m guessing this is some kind of rock shelter archeological site?', '2003-11-12 20:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(483222, 46121, 12674, '<td valign="top">Great idea...the lighted sign and street light detract attention from moon. I might not have noticed the moon without your descriptive title.</td>', 'Great idea...the lighted sign and street light detract attention from moon. I might not have noticed the moon without your descriptive title.', '2003-11-12 20:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(483225, 46301, 7696, '<td valign="top">Very nice clear picture.</td>', 'Very nice clear picture.', '2003-11-12 20:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(483242, 46236, 7696, '<td valign="top">I like the picture. I just wish it was a little sharper.</td>', 'I like the picture. I just wish it was a little sharper.', '2003-11-12 20:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(483243, 46337, 7696, '<td valign="top">Great picture,  Very peaceful.</td>', 'Great picture,  Very peaceful.', '2003-11-12 20:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(483248, 46092, 656, '<td valign="top">There''s a whole lot of nothing going on here.  Reminds me of home.<br/> <br/>Re: your email : I think you might have taken my comment as negative - I actually quite like the barren, wind-swept feel.  It does remind me of the west coast of Scotland.  The fact that you haven''t let anything disrupt the feel of the shot is a good thing in my mind - very tranquil (I gave it a 7)</td>', 'There''s a whole lot of nothing going on here.  Reminds me of home. Re: your email : I think you might have taken my comment as negative - I actually quite like the barren, wind-swept feel.  It does remind me of the west coast of Scotland.  The fact that you haven''t let anything disrupt the feel of the shot is a good thing in my mind - very tranquil (I gave it a 7)', '2003-11-12 20:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(483259, 45691, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good perspective, surface choice.  But the drops all over the cup are kind of subjectively unattractive.  Fresh full cup of coffee would have been great.  This is the right perspective though.  There was another one, a picture of a starbucks cup, and i told him do do something like this (even before I saw yours!)</td>', 'Good perspective, surface choice.  But the drops all over the cup are kind of subjectively unattractive.  Fresh full cup of coffee would have been great.  This is the right perspective though.  There was another one, a picture of a starbucks cup, and i told him do do something like this (even before I saw yours!)', '2003-11-12 21:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(483264, 46263, 12253, '<td valign="top">I see the trees and like the formation, but I can''t tell what I''m seeing on the ground.  A bit too dark.</td>', 'I see the trees and like the formation, but I can''t tell what I''m seeing on the ground.  A bit too dark.', '2003-11-12 21:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(483500, 45391, 11800, '<td valign="top">Exactly. If I had entered, I was going to do this! Only difference would have been my toes peeking out of the bubbles. Interesting presentation. Most of the time I like only a few items in the composition, but I think your setting would be more appealing if there was some motion, like the water running and some towels and soap or other bath related items. As it is, the weight is all on the right, so cropping off the left would not have been a bad thing to do. I voted just to make a comment, it will be stripped later.</td>', 'Exactly. If I had entered, I was going to do this! Only difference would have been my toes peeking out of the bubbles. Interesting presentation. Most of the time I like only a few items in the composition, but I think your setting would be more appealing if there was some motion, like the water running and some towels and soap or other bath related items. As it is, the weight is all on the right, so cropping off the left would not have been a bad thing to do. I voted just to make a comment, it will be stripped later.', '2003-11-12 23:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(483523, 46340, 11800, '<td valign="top">I''m not voting on this one. The levels of focus are well seen in this image. The cropping and composition pleasing. It makes me think of hands raised to heaven. The graves work to futher this theme. It looks oversharpened. I think I would like this even better if it was darker. I would have given you an 8 for this.</td>', 'I''m not voting on this one. The levels of focus are well seen in this image. The cropping and composition pleasing. It makes me think of hands raised to heaven. The graves work to futher this theme. It looks oversharpened. I think I would like this even better if it was darker. I would have given you an 8 for this.', '2003-11-13 00:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(483542, 46184, 11800, '<td valign="top">Very well done. I love it when symetrical things are photographed with precision. The perspective is unique. The blue confuses the brain, inviting the viewer to pause and discover if this is water or glass.</td>', 'Very well done. I love it when symetrical things are photographed with precision. The perspective is unique. The blue confuses the brain, inviting the viewer to pause and discover if this is water or glass.', '2003-11-13 00:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(483565, 45993, 6870, '<td valign="top">This image is fun because it''s like I''m in a dirty, dark place and can see the sacred space beyond.</td>', 'This image is fun because it''s like I''m in a dirty, dark place and can see the sacred space beyond.', '2003-11-13 00:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(483566, 46132, 6870, '<td valign="top">Looks tilted slightly to the right, but this image has a wonderful glow to it,and the symmetry is very nice. The church is very interestingly lit and keeps my interest and sparks my emotions.</td>', 'Looks tilted slightly to the right, but this image has a wonderful glow to it,and the symmetry is very nice. The church is very interestingly lit and keeps my interest and sparks my emotions.', '2003-11-13 00:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(483568, 46329, 6870, '<td valign="top">Quirky image that is playful, yet still manages to evoke sacredness. Weird. Weird but good.</td>', 'Quirky image that is playful, yet still manages to evoke sacredness. Weird. Weird but good.', '2003-11-13 00:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(483569, 46236, 6870, '<td valign="top">Dark tones with that lighter cross evoke emotion that stirs the sacred. INteresting colors and textures, too.</td>', 'Dark tones with that lighter cross evoke emotion that stirs the sacred. INteresting colors and textures, too.', '2003-11-13 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(483571, 46191, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful positioning of the church tower--though I''d like to see all of it and not have it cropped off. The bright light at right upstages the church a little. I love the light and colors on the tower itself, and I also enjoy the trees on the left.</td>', 'Wonderful positioning of the church tower--though I''d like to see all of it and not have it cropped off. The bright light at right upstages the church a little. I love the light and colors on the tower itself, and I also enjoy the trees on the left.', '2003-11-13 00:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(483573, 46278, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very tight crop, and harsh lightinghere. But I love the symmetry and the formal point of view. The light church works well with the soft blue background.</td>', 'Very tight crop, and harsh lightinghere. But I love the symmetry and the formal point of view. The light church works well with the soft blue background.', '2003-11-13 00:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(483574, 46332, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very grand image. Tones evoke sacredness to me. I kind of wish you''d either have cropped the little tower off completely and even some of the dome, or left it all on. Colors and shadows work so nicely here.</td>', 'Very grand image. Tones evoke sacredness to me. I kind of wish you''d either have cropped the little tower off completely and even some of the dome, or left it all on. Colors and shadows work so nicely here.', '2003-11-13 00:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(483575, 46092, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very peaceful mood that could easily be considered sacred. I love the flatness and the grass adds an interesting texture to the whole.</td>', 'Very peaceful mood that could easily be considered sacred. I love the flatness and the grass adds an interesting texture to the whole.', '2003-11-13 00:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(483576, 46291, 6870, '<td valign="top">NIce title for this image! I love the utter blackness surrounding the church and the church lights are very emotive themselves. Well seen!</td>', 'NIce title for this image! I love the utter blackness surrounding the church and the church lights are very emotive themselves. Well seen!', '2003-11-13 00:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(483578, 46306, 6870, '<td valign="top">The vast amount of negative space here does evoke emotions that verge on the sacred. It still appears slightly dark, though. You might try fiddling with your levels, and perhaps some contrast. Well seen.</td>', 'The vast amount of negative space here does evoke emotions that verge on the sacred. It still appears slightly dark, though. You might try fiddling with your levels, and perhaps some contrast. Well seen.', '2003-11-13 00:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(483580, 46238, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and nice lighting. I''d like to see the image without the top shadow on the table. I love how we get a view of the church''s shadow on the table, and how the steeple is the brightest part of the image.</td>', 'Clever idea and nice lighting. I''d like to see the image without the top shadow on the table. I love how we get a view of the church''s shadow on the table, and how the steeple is the brightest part of the image.', '2003-11-13 00:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(483581, 46334, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very delightful abstract. Fire has always been used in sacred contexts, so this image works well for me. Very lovely; well seen! 9</td>', 'Very delightful abstract. Fire has always been used in sacred contexts, so this image works well for me. Very lovely; well seen! 9', '2003-11-13 00:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(483582, 46203, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever and bold image. The myriad of details really bring this image some life--and some sacredness. Well done!</td>', 'Clever and bold image. The myriad of details really bring this image some life--and some sacredness. Well done!', '2003-11-13 00:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(483601, 46201, 7687, '<td valign="top">This photo drums up images of youth spent on a farm and a longing for the simple life.<br/> <br/>I like how you framed the barn with the trees and branchs, although I feel the branch on top dips a bit too close to the barn and becomes almost a distraction.<br/> <br/>The image seems a bit small and somewhat pixelated. <br/> <br/>It looks like the barn is pretty dark compared to the rest of the image...and the barn is the subject, right?  I can see by the patches of light on the ground, that there were breaks in the clouds.  In this instance you may have been better off waiting for a hole in the cloud to shed a bit of light on the barn...this would emphasize the subject (barn).<br/> <br/>I hope this helps,<br/>Quadrajet</td>', 'This photo drums up images of youth spent on a farm and a longing for the simple life. I like how you framed the barn with the trees and branchs, although I feel the branch on top dips a bit too close to the barn and becomes almost a distraction. The image seems a bit small and somewhat pixelated.  It looks like the barn is pretty dark compared to the rest of the image...and the barn is the subject, right?  I can see by the patches of light on the ground, that there were breaks in the clouds.  In this instance you may have been better off waiting for a hole in the cloud to shed a bit of light on the barn...this would emphasize the subject (barn). I hope this helps,Quadrajet', '2003-11-13 01:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(483609, 45455, 7687, '<td valign="top">It looks like the reflection in the door''s glass is the interior of a church.  I''m thinking that this is almost too much of an "overall shot" of the situation.  The whole bottom half of the image doesn''t really add anything...if anything it takes away from the top half of the image.  The door on the left, the truck, the sidewalk the dark bottom of the door, none of these things are really all that interesting (to me).  <br/> <br/>In my opinion, a person could with a horizontal orientation and move closer to the door.  That way you could get the buildings in the background as well as the reflection of the church interior in the shot without all the extraneous stuff in the bottom of the image.  <br/> <br/>The shot also looks like it''s a bit tilted to the left (see the door and the buildings).<br/> <br/>I hope this helps,<br/>Quadrajet<br/></td>', 'It looks like the reflection in the door''s glass is the interior of a church.  I''m thinking that this is almost too much of an "overall shot" of the situation.  The whole bottom half of the image doesn''t really add anything...if anything it takes away from the top half of the image.  The door on the left, the truck, the sidewalk the dark bottom of the door, none of these things are really all that interesting (to me).   In my opinion, a person could with a horizontal orientation and move closer to the door.  That way you could get the buildings in the background as well as the reflection of the church interior in the shot without all the extraneous stuff in the bottom of the image.   The shot also looks like it''s a bit tilted to the left (see the door and the buildings). I hope this helps,Quadrajet', '2003-11-13 02:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(483615, 45661, 7687, '<td valign="top">The shallow depth of field works well in this shot...it gives a sense of depth to the beads as they trail into the background.  I like the violet color of the image, but it''s a bit too brint in places for my liking.  Overall, I feel this is a decent shot, nice work.</td>', 'The shallow depth of field works well in this shot...it gives a sense of depth to the beads as they trail into the background.  I like the violet color of the image, but it''s a bit too brint in places for my liking.  Overall, I feel this is a decent shot, nice work.', '2003-11-13 02:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(483621, 46253, 7687, '<td valign="top">The first thing that I (and probably 7 other people) am going to say is the image is very small...almost too small to give yourself a fighting chance here at DPC.  <br/> <br/>The second thing I''m going to say is that I like the composition of the image, but the lighting isn''t very dramatic.  In order to make a photo of trees interesting a person could try to shoot the trees in an interesting light or with an interesting sky.<br/> <br/>I hope this helps,<br/>Quadrajet</td>', 'The first thing that I (and probably 7 other people) am going to say is the image is very small...almost too small to give yourself a fighting chance here at DPC.   The second thing I''m going to say is that I like the composition of the image, but the lighting isn''t very dramatic.  In order to make a photo of trees interesting a person could try to shoot the trees in an interesting light or with an interesting sky. I hope this helps,Quadrajet', '2003-11-13 02:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(483640, 46101, 4090, '<td valign="top">very nice ... love the angles, light is fab ... good luck 10/10</td>', 'very nice ... love the angles, light is fab ... good luck 10/10', '2003-11-13 03:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(483749, 46054, 12733, '<td valign="top">I love the background and tinting, which resembles infra-red photography. But the main subject seems obscured in the black and too glaring in the white - possibly a weak fill-flash would have balanced it better.</td>', 'I love the background and tinting, which resembles infra-red photography. But the main subject seems obscured in the black and too glaring in the white - possibly a weak fill-flash would have balanced it better.', '2003-11-13 06:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(483753, 46087, 12733, '<td valign="top">The sky, and the upper part of the buildings, are beautiful. The mass of black at the bottom, in my view, reduces its effectiveness. I scrooled the picture so only the part above the curved window in the triangular part of the church was visible, and I thought it improved it (in effect I cropped out most of the black).</td>', 'The sky, and the upper part of the buildings, are beautiful. The mass of black at the bottom, in my view, reduces its effectiveness. I scrooled the picture so only the part above the curved window in the triangular part of the church was visible, and I thought it improved it (in effect I cropped out most of the black).', '2003-11-13 06:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(483757, 46187, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty blur in the water. The red-topped blocks and the stick add an unanswered question that kept me looking for quite a while.</td>', 'Very pretty blur in the water. The red-topped blocks and the stick add an unanswered question that kept me looking for quite a while.', '2003-11-13 06:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(483760, 46219, 12733, '<td valign="top">A beautiful church interior and lovely color. Nice shot.</td>', 'A beautiful church interior and lovely color. Nice shot.', '2003-11-13 06:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(483767, 46244, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the eclipse. Possibly cropping away some of the black would help it stand out better.</td>', 'Nice capture of the eclipse. Possibly cropping away some of the black would help it stand out better.', '2003-11-13 06:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(483770, 46231, 12733, '<td valign="top">Great capture of a rare moment, both the moon and the sunrise in one shot.</td>', 'Great capture of a rare moment, both the moon and the sunrise in one shot.', '2003-11-13 06:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(483773, 46184, 12733, '<td valign="top">Quite an effect, I''m looking forward to seeing how you did it.</td>', 'Quite an effect, I''m looking forward to seeing how you did it.', '2003-11-13 06:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(483777, 46283, 12733, '<td valign="top">The white statue and the bright-colored flowers make a pleasing contrast.</td>', 'The white statue and the bright-colored flowers make a pleasing contrast.', '2003-11-13 06:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(483780, 46014, 12733, '<td valign="top">I like it, but I''m not sure how it relates to the title. What moon are you referring to?</td>', 'I like it, but I''m not sure how it relates to the title. What moon are you referring to?', '2003-11-13 06:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(483786, 46144, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful spire, and you''ve captured it well. I like the angle; it gives the picture a dynamic quality.</td>', 'This is a beautiful spire, and you''ve captured it well. I like the angle; it gives the picture a dynamic quality.', '2003-11-13 06:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(483789, 46111, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and a nice shot - but the white and black lines (wires?) at the left detract from the otherwise clean composition.</td>', 'Nice idea, and a nice shot - but the white and black lines (wires?) at the left detract from the otherwise clean composition.', '2003-11-13 06:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(483809, 46090, 8765, '<td valign="top">It´s so soft! Nice - 9</td>', 'It´s so soft! Nice - 9', '2003-11-13 07:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(483820, 46230, 14056, '<td valign="top">Lovely and very appropriate for this challenge.  Nature and a symbol of Christ.  This is indeed a sacred place.</td>', 'Lovely and very appropriate for this challenge.  Nature and a symbol of Christ.  This is indeed a sacred place.', '2003-11-13 07:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(483869, 46090, 6458, '<td valign="top">The tones, the composition, and the shapes really appeal to me in this shot. Great minimalistic, powerful image.The shadow being the only bit of asymmetry works very well.</td>', 'The tones, the composition, and the shapes really appeal to me in this shot. Great minimalistic, powerful image.The shadow being the only bit of asymmetry works very well.', '2003-11-13 08:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(483890, 46231, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the two of them, one setting, one rising or is it the opposite?   More clarity in this shot would really up the score for me, the colors are very nice, the dark to light sky.  I''m guessing it was a bit windy because of the blur of the trees?  I started with a 4 on first glance with this shot but am raising it to a 5</td>', 'Nice capture of the two of them, one setting, one rising or is it the opposite?   More clarity in this shot would really up the score for me, the colors are very nice, the dark to light sky.  I''m guessing it was a bit windy because of the blur of the trees?  I started with a 4 on first glance with this shot but am raising it to a 5', '2003-11-13 09:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(483903, 45661, 9906, '<td valign="top">The focus on the subject is a bit off (or is it the DOF is too shallow?)  I would also like to see the crop not so tight on the left.<br/>TC</td>', 'The focus on the subject is a bit off (or is it the DOF is too shallow?)  I would also like to see the crop not so tight on the left.TC', '2003-11-13 09:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(483907, 46036, 12448, '<td valign="top">Certainly not to me! ;)  Nice take on the challenge but the shot itself leaves me wanting, from the look of the sky behind it was a very sunny day and I think more light would have really made this shot pop, the red on the side looks dull to me.  The overall composition of the is well done, I like the cropping though it looks just a tad crooked.  I started with a 4 on this but am bumping it to a 5 :)</td>', 'Certainly not to me! ;)  Nice take on the challenge but the shot itself leaves me wanting, from the look of the sky behind it was a very sunny day and I think more light would have really made this shot pop, the red on the side looks dull to me.  The overall composition of the is well done, I like the cropping though it looks just a tad crooked.  I started with a 4 on this but am bumping it to a 5 :)', '2003-11-13 09:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(483911, 45999, 9906, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus, I like the back lighting, but somehow the sunrais detract from the overall impact of the Man on the Cross (In my opinion anyways!)  I''m still trying to figure out the nuances of lighting so I can''t offer any suggestions for improvement...<br/>TC</td>', 'I like the soft focus, I like the back lighting, but somehow the sunrais detract from the overall impact of the Man on the Cross (In my opinion anyways!)  I''m still trying to figure out the nuances of lighting so I can''t offer any suggestions for improvement...TC', '2003-11-13 09:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(483916, 46184, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very cool angle!  I wanna know 1)  Where is this &amp; 2) where the heck were you to get the reflection from this angle.  I''m gonna guess you were in center wing up high...<br/>TC</td>', 'Very cool angle!  I wanna know 1)  Where is this & 2) where the heck were you to get the reflection from this angle.  I''m gonna guess you were in center wing up high...TC', '2003-11-13 09:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(483923, 46017, 9906, '<td valign="top">I love the red here!  Very nice focus and DOF.<br/>TC</td>', 'I love the red here!  Very nice focus and DOF.TC', '2003-11-13 09:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(483931, 46221, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully subtle colors here!  Love the reflcetion of teh big rocks in the middle too.  The house in the background is almost like an after thought and the natural lines kind of take your eye there, but not untill there''s been a little exploration of the scene!  Nice capture!<br/>TC</td>', 'Wonderfully subtle colors here!  Love the reflcetion of teh big rocks in the middle too.  The house in the background is almost like an after thought and the natural lines kind of take your eye there, but not untill there''s been a little exploration of the scene!  Nice capture!TC', '2003-11-13 09:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(483939, 46252, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice image!  Love the golden hue!</td>', 'Nice image!  Love the golden hue!', '2003-11-13 09:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(483940, 46301, 11887, '<td valign="top">Good light!</td>', 'Good light!', '2003-11-13 09:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(483964, 46230, 6624, '<td valign="top">I really would love to know where and what this is...I would imagine Arizona?  It''s a very interesting image with strong colors for a "sacred"  place and yet the image works for me</td>', 'I really would love to know where and what this is...I would imagine Arizona?  It''s a very interesting image with strong colors for a "sacred"  place and yet the image works for me', '2003-11-13 10:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(484004, 46306, 9906, '<td valign="top">Too much negative space for my taste...<br/>TC</td>', 'Too much negative space for my taste...TC', '2003-11-13 10:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(484009, 46130, 9906, '<td valign="top">Love the compostion and the sepia treatment here!  Your image is a little tilted though.  There''s an easy fix for this in Photoshop!<br/>TC</td>', 'Love the compostion and the sepia treatment here!  Your image is a little tilted though.  There''s an easy fix for this in Photoshop!TC', '2003-11-13 10:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(484019, 46269, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure.  You captured nicely the details in the shadow with out totally blowing out the sunny side.  I like this and need to learn how to do it myself (probably need a new camera to get it right...)  You image is a little tilted though.  This is easy to fix in Photoshop.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice exposure.  You captured nicely the details in the shadow with out totally blowing out the sunny side.  I like this and need to learn how to do it myself (probably need a new camera to get it right...)  You image is a little tilted though.  This is easy to fix in Photoshop.TC', '2003-11-13 10:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(484024, 46268, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice B/W shot.  The detail in the shadows is a little distracting though.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice B/W shot.  The detail in the shadows is a little distracting though.TC', '2003-11-13 10:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(484033, 45691, 9906, '<td valign="top">I like what you are doing with this shot, but the cup (i''m sure it''s in the finish of the cup itself...) looks dirty and this creates an unpleasant affect.  If you used an all white cup or another color (carmel or brown would be PERFECT) this would keep the color scheme and make a much more pleasing affect!<br/>TC</td>', 'I like what you are doing with this shot, but the cup (i''m sure it''s in the finish of the cup itself...) looks dirty and this creates an unpleasant affect.  If you used an all white cup or another color (carmel or brown would be PERFECT) this would keep the color scheme and make a much more pleasing affect!TC', '2003-11-13 10:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(484037, 46236, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome capture of a twilight scene!  Kudos!<br/>TC</td>', 'This is an awesome capture of a twilight scene!  Kudos!TC', '2003-11-13 10:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(484043, 46272, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wow, the reflecting pool is empty....I''ve never seen that before.  I guess it''s better then the shade of green that it was the one time I made it to DC...<br/>TC</td>', 'Wow, the reflecting pool is empty....I''ve never seen that before.  I guess it''s better then the shade of green that it was the one time I made it to DC...TC', '2003-11-13 10:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(484066, 45700, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very good and fantastic.</td>', 'Very good and fantastic.', '2003-11-13 11:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(484141, 46199, 2891, '<td valign="top">The biggest issue I see here is focus.  Other than the "ICK" on the headstone in the left side, everything else is blurry, out of focus.  I do not know if a tripod was used here, but it needs to be.  Remember, out of focus is not soft focus.</td>', 'The biggest issue I see here is focus.  Other than the "ICK" on the headstone in the left side, everything else is blurry, out of focus.  I do not know if a tripod was used here, but it needs to be.  Remember, out of focus is not soft focus.', '2003-11-13 12:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(484151, 45945, 2891, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect.  I like using my star filter for fun and interesting shots.  Here, though, I think it takes away by washing out a lot of the other details.  You have a gorgeous dagger (athame) that is mostly hidden, out of frame and by the light.</td>', 'Interesting effect.  I like using my star filter for fun and interesting shots.  Here, though, I think it takes away by washing out a lot of the other details.  You have a gorgeous dagger (athame) that is mostly hidden, out of frame and by the light.', '2003-11-13 12:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(484159, 45455, 2891, '<td valign="top">I can only guess that the building in the background is some sort of government office.  It''s too bad that it does not come across more plainly.  Also, other than the small reflection (but nice job catching it in the extreme light difference) it is hard to tell.  I like what you were going for.</td>', 'I can only guess that the building in the background is some sort of government office.  It''s too bad that it does not come across more plainly.  Also, other than the small reflection (but nice job catching it in the extreme light difference) it is hard to tell.  I like what you were going for.', '2003-11-13 12:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(484164, 46304, 2891, '<td valign="top">Nice depth.  it would be interesting to see the focus on the middle cross.  It does lead one from the front to back fairly good, stopping in the middle.</td>', 'Nice depth.  it would be interesting to see the focus on the middle cross.  It does lead one from the front to back fairly good, stopping in the middle.', '2003-11-13 12:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(484183, 46341, 2891, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of Orion.  It can be difficult to get stars in even long exposures.  I would be interested in the camera settings.</td>', 'Nice capture of Orion.  It can be difficult to get stars in even long exposures.  I would be interested in the camera settings.', '2003-11-13 12:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(484221, 45665, 4090, '<td valign="top">this is a winner ... very clear , fab light, 10/10</td>', 'this is a winner ... very clear , fab light, 10/10', '2003-11-13 13:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(484350, 45918, 8067, '<td valign="top">Very good photo. I  think the spider net should not be there.</td>', 'Very good photo. I  think the spider net should not be there.', '2003-11-13 15:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(484370, 46286, 2170, '<td valign="top">i think this shot would have been better if you stood further out from the wall so it didn''t look like there was a drop shadow behind you.<br/> <br/>did you know before you took these pictures that one of your nipples is higher than the other?</td>', 'i think this shot would have been better if you stood further out from the wall so it didn''t look like there was a drop shadow behind you. did you know before you took these pictures that one of your nipples is higher than the other?', '2003-11-13 16:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(484371, 46149, 2170, '<td valign="top">i''m not sure why this would be a "sacred" place.  "scared" would be more like it.  cool staircase, though.... a bit overexposed.</td>', 'i''m not sure why this would be a "sacred" place.  "scared" would be more like it.  cool staircase, though.... a bit overexposed.', '2003-11-13 16:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(484373, 46054, 2170, '<td valign="top">i am not sure i like the coloring in this.  i do like the composition and framing, however.</td>', 'i am not sure i like the coloring in this.  i do like the composition and framing, however.', '2003-11-13 16:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(484374, 46199, 2170, '<td valign="top">i think this would have been better as a landscape shot instead of portrait -- there''s a lot of "dead space" (seriously, no pun intended...sorry) in the lower 1/4 of the picture.</td>', 'i think this would have been better as a landscape shot instead of portrait -- there''s a lot of "dead space" (seriously, no pun intended...sorry) in the lower 1/4 of the picture.', '2003-11-13 16:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(484377, 46181, 2170, '<td valign="top">very cool.  i would like to see more focus on the building and not the plant, but maybe that''s just me.</td>', 'very cool.  i would like to see more focus on the building and not the plant, but maybe that''s just me.', '2003-11-13 16:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(484379, 45746, 2170, '<td valign="top">nicely composed.</td>', 'nicely composed.', '2003-11-13 16:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(484427, 46263, 13498, '<td valign="top">Really need some light in this photo</td>', 'Really need some light in this photo', '2003-11-13 16:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(484429, 46130, 13498, '<td valign="top">nice lighting, nice soft look</td>', 'nice lighting, nice soft look', '2003-11-13 16:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(484433, 46265, 13498, '<td valign="top">Very good lighting, great idea.. I give this a big 10!</td>', 'Very good lighting, great idea.. I give this a big 10!', '2003-11-13 16:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(484439, 46202, 13498, '<td valign="top">nice night photo!</td>', 'nice night photo!', '2003-11-13 16:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(484441, 45268, 13498, '<td valign="top">The colors in this photo are outstanding, great photo!</td>', 'The colors in this photo are outstanding, great photo!', '2003-11-13 16:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(484444, 45912, 13498, '<td valign="top">This is a GREAT Black and White shot! great pic!</td>', 'This is a GREAT Black and White shot! great pic!', '2003-11-13 16:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(484446, 46260, 13498, '<td valign="top">Very nice.. a little grainy but nice.</td>', 'Very nice.. a little grainy but nice.', '2003-11-13 16:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(484448, 46236, 13498, '<td valign="top">way to dark, needs some light to capture the meaning of this photo</td>', 'way to dark, needs some light to capture the meaning of this photo', '2003-11-13 16:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(484451, 46215, 13498, '<td valign="top">gorgeous! this is awesome lighting!</td>', 'gorgeous! this is awesome lighting!', '2003-11-13 17:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(484617, 46343, 12061, '<td valign="top">nice colors, and there is something about that pink rose that makes this photo work. I feel that there is nothing really \"focused\" here though ... every element in the photograph seems to be blurred/softened too much, I think if the sink tap was more focused this would look better.</td>', 'nice colors, and there is something about that pink rose that makes this photo work. I feel that there is nothing really \"focused\" here though ... every element in the photograph seems to be blurred/softened too much, I think if the sink tap was more focused this would look better.', '2003-11-13 19:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(484665, 46238, 6999, '<td valign="top">Almost wonderful - I really think you could have crowded this less with your cropping - show all of the shadow perhaps, or more of the area of light in which it stands. Effective work though.</td>', 'Almost wonderful - I really think you could have crowded this less with your cropping - show all of the shadow perhaps, or more of the area of light in which it stands. Effective work though.', '2003-11-13 20:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(484681, 46201, 12674, '<td valign="top">I like the photo very much but it doesn''t seem like a sacred place to me.</td>', 'I like the photo very much but it doesn''t seem like a sacred place to me.', '2003-11-13 20:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(484717, 46181, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I might''ve cropped it a bit more to eliminate "leaning" structure on right.</td>', 'Nice shot. I might''ve cropped it a bit more to eliminate "leaning" structure on right.', '2003-11-13 20:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(484765, 46215, 11034, '<td valign="top">I love this kind of shots. I know how diffucult is to taked and you have a very beutiful shot here. Congrats.</td>', 'I love this kind of shots. I know how diffucult is to taked and you have a very beutiful shot here. Congrats.', '2003-11-13 21:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(484768, 46184, 11034, '<td valign="top">nice abs. how you didt?</td>', 'nice abs. how you didt?', '2003-11-13 21:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(484783, 46329, 4482, '<td valign="top">I find this shot quite powerful. The negative space works weel here. It makes me feel sad in a way to see that this place was once sacred but doesn''t lookt this way anymroe. The symbolism behind the leaning stone is also envoking. Great job! :-)</td>', 'I find this shot quite powerful. The negative space works weel here. It makes me feel sad in a way to see that this place was once sacred but doesn''t lookt this way anymroe. The symbolism behind the leaning stone is also envoking. Great job! :-)', '2003-11-13 21:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(484787, 45700, 4482, '<td valign="top">"another shy shot"... not! Mine is also a sky shot but this one blows me away! The color are well saturated (not over) and the composition does envoke heavenly feelings. A sacred place indeed! great work!</td>', '"another shy shot"... not! Mine is also a sky shot but this one blows me away! The color are well saturated (not over) and the composition does envoke heavenly feelings. A sacred place indeed! great work!', '2003-11-13 21:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(484790, 45665, 4482, '<td valign="top">Clean, simple and very pleasing to the eye. I love the angle. The light really focuses on the row of small pillars which i think brings out the majesty of the catehdral, It reminds me of the Cathedral in Cologne.</td>', 'Clean, simple and very pleasing to the eye. I love the angle. The light really focuses on the row of small pillars which i think brings out the majesty of the catehdral, It reminds me of the Cathedral in Cologne.', '2003-11-13 21:27:33.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(484792, 45912, 4482, '<td valign="top">Crisp, clean, simple,... powwerful. The levels are perfect and the composition spot on! A sacred place indeed.</td>', 'Crisp, clean, simple,... powwerful. The levels are perfect and the composition spot on! A sacred place indeed.', '2003-11-13 21:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(484796, 46261, 4482, '<td valign="top">Ya know what... this might seem like a plane photo at first glance but I kept comming back to it which means it brought out my curiosity. I would truly find this a sacred place if it were mine! The water reflction ads to the "sacredness" of the photo... and with so many lovely colors... good shot!</td>', 'Ya know what... this might seem like a plane photo at first glance but I kept comming back to it which means it brought out my curiosity. I would truly find this a sacred place if it were mine! The water reflction ads to the "sacredness" of the photo... and with so many lovely colors... good shot!', '2003-11-13 21:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(484801, 46184, 4482, '<td valign="top">Now this is by far the most original shot of the challenge! Bonus points for creativity! :-) Is it the glass that gives it this water effect? I like it when photos make me ponder! :-) The lines also seem to invite you to come into the church. Good job!</td>', 'Now this is by far the most original shot of the challenge! Bonus points for creativity! :-) Is it the glass that gives it this water effect? I like it when photos make me ponder! :-) The lines also seem to invite you to come into the church. Good job!', '2003-11-13 21:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(484806, 46337, 4482, '<td valign="top">Bird, sun, whispy cloud, water... a nice receipe for a great shot. :-)  Very pleasing to the eye. Due to the sun''s position I think the half sky half water work well here. Nice shot.</td>', 'Bird, sun, whispy cloud, water... a nice receipe for a great shot. :-)  Very pleasing to the eye. Due to the sun''s position I think the half sky half water work well here. Nice shot.', '2003-11-13 21:36:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(484807, 46250, 4482, '<td valign="top">The choice of sepia is pleasing to the eye and the levels are spot on! You chose a ncie subject even though churches have been overly used in this challenge. Only thing I would change would be to seethe tops of the pointy things there.  :-)</td>', 'The choice of sepia is pleasing to the eye and the levels are spot on! You chose a ncie subject even though churches have been overly used in this challenge. Only thing I would change would be to seethe tops of the pointy things there.  :-)', '2003-11-13 21:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(484810, 45874, 4482, '<td valign="top">Hehehehehe... I had this Idea but couldn''t find the perfect toilet for the job! :-) I unfortunately don''t like the way this was post processed as I don,t see the link with sacredness or College. 6</td>', 'Hehehehehe... I had this Idea but couldn''t find the perfect toilet for the job! :-) I unfortunately don''t like the way this was post processed as I don,t see the link with sacredness or College. 6', '2003-11-13 21:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(484862, 46286, 12253, '<td valign="top">Idea is good.  I think a little more crop of the top, the chin, and maybe above the belly button as well.  I would have stayed further from the wall as well, so you didn''t have a black outline/shadow.  Finally, maybe neatimage might have made the skin glow a little.</td>', 'Idea is good.  I think a little more crop of the top, the chin, and maybe above the belly button as well.  I would have stayed further from the wall as well, so you didn''t have a black outline/shadow.  Finally, maybe neatimage might have made the skin glow a little.', '2003-11-13 22:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(484880, 46253, 12448, '<td valign="top">Like you, I too feel that the great outdoors is the best place to find and get in touch with your spiritual side.  The idea is well thought out but the picture leaves me wanting.  FIrst the size seems a bit small overall and it''s so crowded in the small area.  I know the time of year leaves the trees bare in most areas but perhaps if you had come at a more straight angle instead of straight up?  Captured a more natural landscape setting?  A 4</td>', 'Like you, I too feel that the great outdoors is the best place to find and get in touch with your spiritual side.  The idea is well thought out but the picture leaves me wanting.  FIrst the size seems a bit small overall and it''s so crowded in the small area.  I know the time of year leaves the trees bare in most areas but perhaps if you had come at a more straight angle instead of straight up?  Captured a more natural landscape setting?  A 4', '2003-11-13 23:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(484881, 46240, 12448, '<td valign="top">What a pretty church and teh shadows are beautiful!  But the negative space at the top it just a bit much.  A tighter crop on the top, about 1/2 the sky gone would have really made this shot pop for me.  The colors of the church, are those natural or did you play with it a bit in PS?  They are very interesting.  I started with a 4 on this shot but am bumping it to a 6</td>', 'What a pretty church and teh shadows are beautiful!  But the negative space at the top it just a bit much.  A tighter crop on the top, about 1/2 the sky gone would have really made this shot pop for me.  The colors of the church, are those natural or did you play with it a bit in PS?  They are very interesting.  I started with a 4 on this shot but am bumping it to a 6', '2003-11-13 23:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(484882, 45455, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection of the alter in the door window, very cool.  I don''t really see the State connection since it''s just apartments and businesses across the street but the mix of the two is unique and different.  But I think if you had turned around and shot the alter alone it would have gone over much better.  A 4</td>', 'Nice reflection of the alter in the door window, very cool.  I don''t really see the State connection since it''s just apartments and businesses across the street but the mix of the two is unique and different.  But I think if you had turned around and shot the alter alone it would have gone over much better.  A 4', '2003-11-13 23:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(484883, 45665, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic shot here.  The lighting is very well done on the bannister but the darkness in the lower arch is a bit much for me personally, maybe a little different crop that would take the bannister from one corner to the other?  The thin white border is also a bit of a distraction.  I started at a 4 from the first glance but am going to a 7 on this one.</td>', 'Very dramatic shot here.  The lighting is very well done on the bannister but the darkness in the lower arch is a bit much for me personally, maybe a little different crop that would take the bannister from one corner to the other?  The thin white border is also a bit of a distraction.  I started at a 4 from the first glance but am going to a 7 on this one.', '2003-11-13 23:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(484885, 46035, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, good composition, well balanced and very nice clarity.  But the brightness and contrast, more the contrast is a bit bothersome to me.  I like the subdued light but it really doesn''t grab my attention and make me want to examine all the details of the shot.  I started at a 4 but am going to a 6 for the strong points.</td>', 'Very nice shot, good composition, well balanced and very nice clarity.  But the brightness and contrast, more the contrast is a bit bothersome to me.  I like the subdued light but it really doesn''t grab my attention and make me want to examine all the details of the shot.  I started at a 4 but am going to a 6 for the strong points.', '2003-11-13 23:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(484886, 46087, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic lighting on this shot, it''s strongest point.  I like the idea but the crop leaves me a bit distracted on the left especially.  The small building keeps pulling me away from the very dramatic tower.  Perhaps a bit tighter crop on that side and play with the contrast just a touch to really make the shot pop?  A 4</td>', 'Very dramatic lighting on this shot, it''s strongest point.  I like the idea but the crop leaves me a bit distracted on the left especially.  The small building keeps pulling me away from the very dramatic tower.  Perhaps a bit tighter crop on that side and play with the contrast just a touch to really make the shot pop?  A 4', '2003-11-13 23:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(484887, 46306, 12448, '<td valign="top">This so reminds me of home, back on Montana when you are sitting on top of the mountain and just gazing in amazement at the wonder of it all.  But the over abundance of sky on this shot is not helpful to me pesonally, I would have liked to seen more land, a more evened balance, if you will.  The shot could also be brightened just a tad to really help it pop out.  A 4</td>', 'This so reminds me of home, back on Montana when you are sitting on top of the mountain and just gazing in amazement at the wonder of it all.  But the over abundance of sky on this shot is not helpful to me pesonally, I would have liked to seen more land, a more evened balance, if you will.  The shot could also be brightened just a tad to really help it pop out.  A 4', '2003-11-13 23:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(484890, 46265, 12448, '<td valign="top">The clarity on this shot is amazing, almost too sharp but not quite.  The angle of the cross to the bible is well doen and the ribbon running through the shot is a bit of a distraction, maybe if it was at a different angle?  The white of the table in the lower left is a bit too bright, really draws me away from the rest of the shot.  I started this at a 4 but am bumping it up to a 6</td>', 'The clarity on this shot is amazing, almost too sharp but not quite.  The angle of the cross to the bible is well doen and the ribbon running through the shot is a bit of a distraction, maybe if it was at a different angle?  The white of the table in the lower left is a bit too bright, really draws me away from the rest of the shot.  I started this at a 4 but am bumping it up to a 6', '2003-11-13 23:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(484892, 46146, 12448, '<td valign="top">We have a similar cemetary here in our town, really makes you stop and think sometimes doesn''t it?  I like the idea behind the shot adn the different angle is nice to see because so many are done at an above tombstone level and the way you set it to draw one in from one side to the other.  I started at a 4 on this shot because at first glance the overall shot didn''t really appeal to me but upon further inspection I really like the way it was done and am bumping it up to an 8</td>', 'We have a similar cemetary here in our town, really makes you stop and think sometimes doesn''t it?  I like the idea behind the shot adn the different angle is nice to see because so many are done at an above tombstone level and the way you set it to draw one in from one side to the other.  I started at a 4 on this shot because at first glance the overall shot didn''t really appeal to me but upon further inspection I really like the way it was done and am bumping it up to an 8', '2003-11-13 23:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(484894, 45700, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing shot, almost unreal and I''ve been waiting to see the note saying it''s been validated by the administration!  The colors are very dramatic and enticing and the lower clouds leading up to the massive upper cloud is amazing.  A 9</td>', 'This is an amazing shot, almost unreal and I''ve been waiting to see the note saying it''s been validated by the administration!  The colors are very dramatic and enticing and the lower clouds leading up to the massive upper cloud is amazing.  A 9', '2003-11-13 23:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(484896, 46201, 1384, '<td valign="top">Great angle, it looks like a painting!!!! Very beautiful!!!</td>', 'Great angle, it looks like a painting!!!! Very beautiful!!!', '2003-11-13 23:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(484897, 46219, 1384, '<td valign="top">Its a wonderful church, the arcitechture is gorgous!!! The churches hieght, scale, warmth and beauty was captured perfectly!!!!!</td>', 'Its a wonderful church, the arcitechture is gorgous!!! The churches hieght, scale, warmth and beauty was captured perfectly!!!!!', '2003-11-13 23:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(484899, 46130, 1384, '<td valign="top">Very warm!! The room has a soothing calmness about it and the rooms mood was caught on film beautifully!!!</td>', 'Very warm!! The room has a soothing calmness about it and the rooms mood was caught on film beautifully!!!', '2003-11-13 23:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(484901, 46237, 10818, '<td valign="top">Thats awesome.  I thought of the same thing, but could get that kind of shot from my local muni.  :  )  Very nice shot.  10</td>', 'Thats awesome.  I thought of the same thing, but could get that kind of shot from my local muni.  :  )  Very nice shot.  10', '2003-11-13 23:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(484903, 45700, 1384, '<td valign="top">Really is heavenly!!! I thought it was a painting!!! Abosolutly my favorite. The colors are outstanding!!! Be very proud of this picture,whoever took it.</td>', 'Really is heavenly!!! I thought it was a painting!!! Abosolutly my favorite. The colors are outstanding!!! Be very proud of this picture,whoever took it.', '2003-11-13 23:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(484958, 45700, 8953, '<td valign="top">I am sure this has got to be the 10th "Wow" someone has shared with you...what a great image.the depth you managed to capture and the intense colors, the height so often lost in photographs of the sky came through perfectly. I voted this a ten when I came through the first time... I would bump up but Alas:( no place to bump! good Luck<br/> <br/>Richard<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-11-17 00:04:34.</i></td>', 'I am sure this has got to be the 10th "Wow" someone has shared with you...what a great image.the depth you managed to capture and the intense colors, the height so often lost in photographs of the sky came through perfectly. I voted this a ten when I came through the first time... I would bump up but Alas:( no place to bump! good Luck Richard', '2003-11-14 00:22:19.000000', '2003-11-17 00:04:34.000000', 1),
(484963, 45939, 8953, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites this time out! I love the capture of the tower and how well it is placed in the image. The ground level placement of your Camera also added so much to the majestic feel of this Church. I know impossible to get around but i wish those trees were not present at the very rear of this shot. still works for me:) Good luck 9<br/>Richard<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-11-17 00:06:41.</i></td>', 'One of my favorites this time out! I love the capture of the tower and how well it is placed in the image. The ground level placement of your Camera also added so much to the majestic feel of this Church. I know impossible to get around but i wish those trees were not present at the very rear of this shot. still works for me:) Good luck 9Richard', '2003-11-14 00:26:44.000000', '2003-11-17 00:06:41.000000', 1),
(484970, 46329, 8953, '<td valign="top">Understated, perfect take on challenge. Good use of thirds and well balanced image. Your DOF is spot on. I think the only thing that might have made this a better shot for me, just a bit more contrast. stiil in my top 4. a 9 from me:)<br/> <br/>Richard</td>', 'Understated, perfect take on challenge. Good use of thirds and well balanced image. Your DOF is spot on. I think the only thing that might have made this a better shot for me, just a bit more contrast. stiil in my top 4. a 9 from me:) Richard', '2003-11-14 00:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(484975, 46337, 8953, '<td valign="top">some how though you split the difference between sea and sky I still find this image quite appealing ( one of my top 5) the hue and saturation work well and of course the lone bird in the corner. a 9<br/> <br/>Good luck <br/>Richard</td>', 'some how though you split the difference between sea and sky I still find this image quite appealing ( one of my top 5) the hue and saturation work well and of course the lone bird in the corner. a 9 Good luck Richard', '2003-11-14 00:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(484980, 46340, 8953, '<td valign="top">Very nice! I love the way the trees have almost created the feeling of a room. the tones and contrast just bring this image together for me...I had given this an 8 first time through...more a 9 so another point<br/> <br/>Good Luck<br/> <br/>Richard</td>', 'Very nice! I love the way the trees have almost created the feeling of a room. the tones and contrast just bring this image together for me...I had given this an 8 first time through...more a 9 so another point Good Luck Richard', '2003-11-14 00:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
