(484993, 45864, 8953, '<td valign="top">I would have to venture a guess you were kind enough to have left a comment on my image given your statement  that yours was much the same as the one I produced. very well done! subtle colors nice perspective. I like the soft clouds in the sky as well.<br/> <br/>Good Luck <br/> <br/>Richard</td>', 'I would have to venture a guess you were kind enough to have left a comment on my image given your statement  that yours was much the same as the one I produced. very well done! subtle colors nice perspective. I like the soft clouds in the sky as well. Good Luck  Richard', '2003-11-14 00:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
