(485007, 45665, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting.  Your timing was good to get this.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting.  Your timing was good to get this.', '2003-11-14 01:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(485034, 46199, 13403, '<td valign="top">its interesting to me..   how sacred death is.   buried dead bodies.   It is somewhat of an abstract tradition.   Thinking about it really makes you wonder about its origins.   Was it at first simply a practical procedure to hide the bodies? - surely dead bodies above ground smelled horribly and attracted scavengers of many sorts...   Somewhere along the line it seemingly became something of a ceremony..  religious even.    The brain has some twisted learned behaviors.   Me, i''m a cremation kinda guy. ;)   its simple and it gets things done.  tombstones seem more of an attempt towards some form of immortality that humans seem to hunger for than anything else.  To be remembered is to live beyond life.</td>', 'its interesting to me..   how sacred death is.   buried dead bodies.   It is somewhat of an abstract tradition.   Thinking about it really makes you wonder about its origins.   Was it at first simply a practical procedure to hide the bodies? - surely dead bodies above ground smelled horribly and attracted scavengers of many sorts...   Somewhere along the line it seemingly became something of a ceremony..  religious even.    The brain has some twisted learned behaviors.   Me, i''m a cremation kinda guy. ;)   its simple and it gets things done.  tombstones seem more of an attempt towards some form of immortality that humans seem to hunger for than anything else.  To be remembered is to live beyond life.', '2003-11-14 02:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(485037, 46237, 13403, '<td valign="top">unless there''s more here than meets the eye- perhaps this place has a unique history of its own- but otherwise it looks like a golf-course..  i don''t see anything sacred about the place.  but then, golf has never been my favorite sport either.. :-P</td>', 'unless there''s more here than meets the eye- perhaps this place has a unique history of its own- but otherwise it looks like a golf-course..  i don''t see anything sacred about the place.  but then, golf has never been my favorite sport either.. :-P', '2003-11-14 02:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(485040, 45945, 13403, '<td valign="top">oh cute, a shrine.  i see a blade.. a feather, a pentagram... candles..  a little idol with boobies?   and another pentagram around the idol''s neck on a little bead necklace.     i guess i don''t know what the blade is about.. but i assume you''re wiccan?   i hate prismatic light rays.. they piss me off.     you obviously spent some time on this..  i will look forward to reading the photograph''s info.</td>', 'oh cute, a shrine.  i see a blade.. a feather, a pentagram... candles..  a little idol with boobies?   and another pentagram around the idol''s neck on a little bead necklace.     i guess i don''t know what the blade is about.. but i assume you''re wiccan?   i hate prismatic light rays.. they piss me off.     you obviously spent some time on this..  i will look forward to reading the photograph''s info.', '2003-11-14 02:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(485054, 45939, 12802, '<td valign="top">Excellent, love this picture.  Keep coming back, looking at it and appreciating it.  The details in the tower is brilliant, the colours all around in the leaves, the trees, the stone work and even the sky.  No hesitation in giving a 10</td>', 'Excellent, love this picture.  Keep coming back, looking at it and appreciating it.  The details in the tower is brilliant, the colours all around in the leaves, the trees, the stone work and even the sky.  No hesitation in giving a 10', '2003-11-14 02:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(485055, 45700, 12802, '<td valign="top">This sky is brilliant, reminds me of a horror movie when the evil spirits come down from the sky. 10</td>', 'This sky is brilliant, reminds me of a horror movie when the evil spirits come down from the sky. 10', '2003-11-14 02:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(485057, 45665, 12802, '<td valign="top">WOW, brilliant...  This remind me of a FMV scene from a high class computer game...  I love how the light just catches the stone across the middle of the picture, I can sense the colours in the stained glass windows too at the top.  Well deserved 10!</td>', 'WOW, brilliant...  This remind me of a FMV scene from a high class computer game...  I love how the light just catches the stone across the middle of the picture, I can sense the colours in the stained glass windows too at the top.  Well deserved 10!', '2003-11-14 02:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(485060, 46101, 12802, '<td valign="top">I really lke this!  It at first looked as if it was computer generated, but of course it isn''t.  The clear lines, the bright windows, the light on the roof thing is brilliant!  It feels as if this building s really tall.  A well deserved 10!</td>', 'I really lke this!  It at first looked as if it was computer generated, but of course it isn''t.  The clear lines, the bright windows, the light on the roof thing is brilliant!  It feels as if this building s really tall.  A well deserved 10!', '2003-11-14 02:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(485062, 46153, 12802, '<td valign="top">I really like this, the DOF is brilliant, the two towers at the top are also great.  A little sharper and I would have made this a 10. 9 from me.</td>', 'I really like this, the DOF is brilliant, the two towers at the top are also great.  A little sharper and I would have made this a 10. 9 from me.', '2003-11-14 03:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(485064, 46221, 12802, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this so many times and I''ve just noticed the wee hut in the background.  A brilliant shot, spot editing would have been nice on this to get the little leaf out of the water.  9</td>', 'I''ve looked at this so many times and I''ve just noticed the wee hut in the background.  A brilliant shot, spot editing would have been nice on this to get the little leaf out of the water.  9', '2003-11-14 03:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
