(485066, 46288, 12802, '<td valign="top">Personally I would have liked a longer exposure here to show the water flowing like silk (It''s just me though, I like pictures like that)  Your picture is great, the only bit that torubles me is the leaves at the top.7</td>', 'Personally I would have liked a longer exposure here to show the water flowing like silk (It''s just me though, I like pictures like that)  Your picture is great, the only bit that torubles me is the leaves at the top.7', '2003-11-14 03:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
