(485508, 46237, 6999, '<td valign="top">Haven''t a clue what to score this ... as an advertising/stock photograph of a golf course it''s faultless, I think; however I''m looking for something that says a little more about the sacredness of the subject than this purely technically expert representation. Perhaps there is that feeling of nature tamed, that cleaning-up of a natural world and in some sense fooling people with that here. Though I''m not certain it''s deliberate, I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt - 8, for now.</td>', 'Haven''t a clue what to score this ... as an advertising/stock photograph of a golf course it''s faultless, I think; however I''m looking for something that says a little more about the sacredness of the subject than this purely technically expert representation. Perhaps there is that feeling of nature tamed, that cleaning-up of a natural world and in some sense fooling people with that here. Though I''m not certain it''s deliberate, I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt - 8, for now.', '2003-11-14 15:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(485509, 46202, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully done, and gives a feeling of preciousness, of being a beacon. Can''t work out what''s going on with that white patch of water - where''s the light it''s reflecting? It somehow looks real though, so I''ll go with it :-)<br/> <br/>Love the foreground silhouettes, and won''t be at all surprised if you win with this.</td>', 'Wonderfully done, and gives a feeling of preciousness, of being a beacon. Can''t work out what''s going on with that white patch of water - where''s the light it''s reflecting? It somehow looks real though, so I''ll go with it :-) Love the foreground silhouettes, and won''t be at all surprised if you win with this.', '2003-11-14 15:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(485512, 46090, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful work - same guy as the Grado shot, I''d guess? and not just from the Italian title ... True sense of shape and tonal contrast here. Beautiful, beautiful work. Might be  little too complicated an image to rate a ribbon on dpc, in the sense of it''s almost abstract quality, it''s concentration on the formal, but I do hope not.<br/> <br/>Returning: seems to lack a little sharpness, though that might only be to avoid jagged edges.</td>', 'Wonderful work - same guy as the Grado shot, I''d guess? and not just from the Italian title ... True sense of shape and tonal contrast here. Beautiful, beautiful work. Might be  little too complicated an image to rate a ribbon on dpc, in the sense of it''s almost abstract quality, it''s concentration on the formal, but I do hope not. Returning: seems to lack a little sharpness, though that might only be to avoid jagged edges.', '2003-11-14 15:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(485518, 45665, 6999, '<td valign="top">8, or 9 I''m pondering. I wonder if it''s too dark for many here? It certainly isn''t for me ... my problem with it is that it''s perhaps a little straight-forward. A great moment of lighting to capture, placing the sunlight onto that line of pillars, and capturing the loom of the rest of the building. Great focus and detail, of course, but you don''t get a ten because in the end I don''t quite like it as much as my favourite of this challenge, and I find my second favourite a little preferable to this, but whether that''s a whole point''s worth ...</td>', '8, or 9 I''m pondering. I wonder if it''s too dark for many here? It certainly isn''t for me ... my problem with it is that it''s perhaps a little straight-forward. A great moment of lighting to capture, placing the sunlight onto that line of pillars, and capturing the loom of the rest of the building. Great focus and detail, of course, but you don''t get a ten because in the end I don''t quite like it as much as my favourite of this challenge, and I find my second favourite a little preferable to this, but whether that''s a whole point''s worth ...', '2003-11-14 15:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(485521, 46329, 6999, '<td valign="top">I like this use of DOF, and the stones seem perfectly centred in the deth of that field. Also like the simplicity, and the scattering of small leaves make me think this hasn''t been ''cleaned up''.</td>', 'I like this use of DOF, and the stones seem perfectly centred in the deth of that field. Also like the simplicity, and the scattering of small leaves make me think this hasn''t been ''cleaned up''.', '2003-11-14 15:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(485534, 46340, 6999, '<td valign="top">I live in Bow, in London, amd I''d love to know where this is ... or do you perhaps mean Bough? beautifully dark, private image, really like the small contrat between that nearest and the further trees.</td>', 'I live in Bow, in London, amd I''d love to know where this is ... or do you perhaps mean Bough? beautifully dark, private image, really like the small contrat between that nearest and the further trees.', '2003-11-14 15:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(485546, 46340, 1280, '<td valign="top">Really interesting photo.  Simple, yet strong.  Good job!</td>', 'Really interesting photo.  Simple, yet strong.  Good job!', '2003-11-14 15:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(485550, 45945, 1280, '<td valign="top">I don''t get it.  Blessed be what or who? The candle light works real good.</td>', 'I don''t get it.  Blessed be what or who? The candle light works real good.', '2003-11-14 15:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(485658, 46184, 14186, '<td valign="top">This is great! I took a similar photo this summer but i guess the wind was blowing over the pool and the temple looks more distorted. Still looks pretty cool though. Yes Temple Square is definitely a place of reflection ;) Great job!</td>', 'This is great! I took a similar photo this summer but i guess the wind was blowing over the pool and the temple looks more distorted. Still looks pretty cool though. Yes Temple Square is definitely a place of reflection ;) Great job!', '2003-11-14 17:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(485828, 46260, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot, very peaceful and serene.  The brightness of the water is very nice considering you can''t see the sun, very well done there.  The lightness of the shot is a bit wanting for me on the shore and the spots throughout the shot are a bit distracting.  And the clarity is a also a bit wanting.  I started at a 5 on this shot but am going to a 6</td>', 'This is a lovely shot, very peaceful and serene.  The brightness of the water is very nice considering you can''t see the sun, very well done there.  The lightness of the shot is a bit wanting for me on the shore and the spots throughout the shot are a bit distracting.  And the clarity is a also a bit wanting.  I started at a 5 on this shot but am going to a 6', '2003-11-14 20:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(485830, 45691, 12448, '<td valign="top">That is most sacred to some, like my husband. :)  The off center of the cup is a good call but the brightness is wanting, and it looks more like hot chocolate than coffee :)  A 5</td>', 'That is most sacred to some, like my husband. :)  The off center of the cup is a good call but the brightness is wanting, and it looks more like hot chocolate than coffee :)  A 5', '2003-11-14 20:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(485839, 46331, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very nice, the lighting on the statue is well done, but the background is a bit too dull to me.    The off center of the cropping is also well done but the black border is too heavy for this shot.  A 5 was my beginning score but am raising to a 7</td>', 'Very nice, the lighting on the statue is well done, but the background is a bit too dull to me.    The off center of the cropping is also well done but the black border is too heavy for this shot.  A 5 was my beginning score but am raising to a 7', '2003-11-14 20:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(485849, 46100, 12448, '<td valign="top">A dramatic shot no doubt, the contrast between the dark and lit areas is just a tad wanting.  I like the crop of the shot, the tall tower on the left and the shorter side of the building on the right.  The overall sharpening is a bit wanting to me and I started this at a 5 but am raising it to a 7</td>', 'A dramatic shot no doubt, the contrast between the dark and lit areas is just a tad wanting.  I like the crop of the shot, the tall tower on the left and the shorter side of the building on the right.  The overall sharpening is a bit wanting to me and I started this at a 5 but am raising it to a 7', '2003-11-14 20:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(485854, 46268, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot and the off centering of the statue works well in this shot but I would really like to have seen it in color, the black and white version leaves me wanting a bit.  Also, maybe just a slightly different angle so the piller on the right wasn''t in the shot?  A 5</td>', 'This is a very nice shot and the off centering of the statue works well in this shot but I would really like to have seen it in color, the black and white version leaves me wanting a bit.  Also, maybe just a slightly different angle so the piller on the right wasn''t in the shot?  A 5', '2003-11-14 20:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(485858, 46334, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot, I love the capture of the different sparks, if you had cropped out the white spot in the upper right, this would close to a 8 or 9 for me.  I started at a 5 but am bumping to a 7</td>', 'Very cool shot, I love the capture of the different sparks, if you had cropped out the white spot in the upper right, this would close to a 8 or 9 for me.  I started at a 5 but am bumping to a 7', '2003-11-14 20:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(485861, 46144, 12448, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful spire!  The work on it is amazing.  I''m not sure I like the crop or angle of the shot and the roof on the right is very distracting, perhaps if the shot was cropped a bit differently?  A 5</td>', 'What a beautiful spire!  The work on it is amazing.  I''m not sure I like the crop or angle of the shot and the roof on the right is very distracting, perhaps if the shot was cropped a bit differently?  A 5', '2003-11-14 20:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(485871, 46244, 806, '<td valign="top">great shot of the eclipse! this is what I had hoped to achieve (notice "hoped" :P)<br/>great use of negative space.. no pun intended.<br/></td>', 'great shot of the eclipse! this is what I had hoped to achieve (notice "hoped" :P)great use of negative space.. no pun intended.', '2003-11-14 21:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(485872, 45391, 806, '<td valign="top">ah.. how inviting. not sure I like the letterbox framing... but the lighting is wonderful and warm. I also like how you achieved the exposure without harsh glares and reflections. Well done!</td>', 'ah.. how inviting. not sure I like the letterbox framing... but the lighting is wonderful and warm. I also like how you achieved the exposure without harsh glares and reflections. Well done!', '2003-11-14 21:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(485879, 46260, 14193, '<td valign="top">Looks like my favorite place</td>', 'Looks like my favorite place', '2003-11-14 21:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(485880, 46230, 11078, '<td valign="top">An amazing photo looks unreal but as its been validated I see it is for real <br/>all I can say is Awsome! Where is this? Nice crisp focus</td>', 'An amazing photo looks unreal but as its been validated I see it is for real all I can say is Awsome! Where is this? Nice crisp focus', '2003-11-14 21:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(485882, 45700, 11769, '<td valign="top">Like a Turner, a wonderful abstract atmospheric image.</td>', 'Like a Turner, a wonderful abstract atmospheric image.', '2003-11-14 21:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(485884, 45973, 11078, '<td valign="top">a beautiful image  I would like to paint this in oils<br/>Nice work</td>', 'a beautiful image  I would like to paint this in oilsNice work', '2003-11-14 21:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(485885, 45996, 11078, '<td valign="top">I thought about doing this I like it very much</td>', 'I thought about doing this I like it very much', '2003-11-14 21:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(485887, 46181, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this shot, the vibrancy and the way it pops out at you.  The plant in the front is a bit of a distration though, blocking the front of the temple.  An 8</td>', 'I love the colors in this shot, the vibrancy and the way it pops out at you.  The plant in the front is a bit of a distration though, blocking the front of the temple.  An 8', '2003-11-14 21:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(485888, 45391, 11078, '<td valign="top">Your image seems to be cropped too much but I like the ides very inviting and definately a sacred place to get away from all the worries of the word <br/>nice sharp image <br/></td>', 'Your image seems to be cropped too much but I like the ides very inviting and definately a sacred place to get away from all the worries of the word nice sharp image ', '2003-11-14 21:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(485892, 46301, 11078, '<td valign="top">An unusual looking church, nice crisp image and nicely done.</td>', 'An unusual looking church, nice crisp image and nicely done.', '2003-11-14 21:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(485895, 46337, 11078, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I can see whyyou love it</td>', 'Beautiful! I can see whyyou love it', '2003-11-14 21:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(485900, 46236, 11078, '<td valign="top">its a bit on the dark side</td>', 'its a bit on the dark side', '2003-11-14 21:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(485904, 45875, 11078, '<td valign="top">This looks like an oil painting its beautiful and I see why you like it. Its Beautiful!</td>', 'This looks like an oil painting its beautiful and I see why you like it. Its Beautiful!', '2003-11-14 21:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(485907, 46219, 11078, '<td valign="top">Nicely done and nice colours</td>', 'Nicely done and nice colours', '2003-11-14 21:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(485920, 45973, 6870, '<td valign="top">The mood here is peaceful and gentle, and so does elicit a sacred mood. Well seen.</td>', 'The mood here is peaceful and gentle, and so does elicit a sacred mood. Well seen.', '2003-11-14 22:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(485921, 46263, 6870, '<td valign="top">The way your lighting works here, I can imagine these trees raising their limbs in supplication to the heavens. For this reason, I don''t mind it being kind of dark down on the bottom. The clarity suffers here a little, perhaps from over sharpening or something, but the trees just aren''t totally clear. Nice work, though!</td>', 'The way your lighting works here, I can imagine these trees raising their limbs in supplication to the heavens. For this reason, I don''t mind it being kind of dark down on the bottom. The clarity suffers here a little, perhaps from over sharpening or something, but the trees just aren''t totally clear. Nice work, though!', '2003-11-14 22:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(485924, 45875, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very lovely photo. Colors and mood are marvelous and evoke a sacred feeling. Clarity suffers just a little here; perhaps the trees and plants in the center could be more in focus? ANyway, very lovely shot. Very well seen!</td>', 'Very lovely photo. Colors and mood are marvelous and evoke a sacred feeling. Clarity suffers just a little here; perhaps the trees and plants in the center could be more in focus? ANyway, very lovely shot. Very well seen!', '2003-11-14 22:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(485926, 46078, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really engaging idea. The levels of clarity work so well here! The statue fiture in center seems military rather than sacred, but the whole mood is overwhelmingly of a sacred feeling. Well seen.</td>', 'Really engaging idea. The levels of clarity work so well here! The statue fiture in center seems military rather than sacred, but the whole mood is overwhelmingly of a sacred feeling. Well seen.', '2003-11-14 22:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(485928, 46340, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever, quiet pun. Nice mood evoked with your tones here. The soft cross, left, is a very nice touch!</td>', 'Clever, quiet pun. Nice mood evoked with your tones here. The soft cross, left, is a very nice touch!', '2003-11-14 22:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(485930, 46028, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very grand and nice, moody tones. I like the lens distortion here because it makes the church seem slightly unreal--as many sacred things seem.</td>', 'Very grand and nice, moody tones. I like the lens distortion here because it makes the church seem slightly unreal--as many sacred things seem.', '2003-11-14 22:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(485931, 46304, 6870, '<td valign="top">You may have cropped just a little too much here, or perhaps you were just too close. This shot is marvelous, and would only improve had all three crosses been complete and had breathing room. I love the focus and tones and contrasting textures and colors. Well seen! 8</td>', 'You may have cropped just a little too much here, or perhaps you were just too close. This shot is marvelous, and would only improve had all three crosses been complete and had breathing room. I love the focus and tones and contrasting textures and colors. Well seen! 8', '2003-11-14 22:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(485933, 46250, 6870, '<td valign="top">Magnificent tones here evoke a sacred, clean feeling in me. I kind of wish the points above the arches were still there, but the clariy and communication here is so, so nice!</td>', 'Magnificent tones here evoke a sacred, clean feeling in me. I kind of wish the points above the arches were still there, but the clariy and communication here is so, so nice!', '2003-11-14 22:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(485937, 46054, 6870, '<td valign="top">Unusual visuals here, but I like now they evoke an otherworldly feeling. The building and flowers are so white, they distract some of the focus, but I do like this image a lot.</td>', 'Unusual visuals here, but I like now they evoke an otherworldly feeling. The building and flowers are so white, they distract some of the focus, but I do like this image a lot.', '2003-11-14 22:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(485938, 46215, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice horizong line and the light beams are lovely and crisp. Well seen and well composed!</td>', 'Nice horizong line and the light beams are lovely and crisp. Well seen and well composed!', '2003-11-14 22:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(485941, 46319, 6870, '<td valign="top">What really adds to this photo to me are the leaves on the ground, which give a lovely texture and evokes things that are not square like the stones...I''m still thinking about it but to me they are key to this image''s success. Nice mood and tones, too. Well seen.</td>', 'What really adds to this photo to me are the leaves on the ground, which give a lovely texture and evokes things that are not square like the stones...I''m still thinking about it but to me they are key to this image''s success. Nice mood and tones, too. Well seen.', '2003-11-14 22:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(485944, 46199, 6870, '<td valign="top">I see you''ve shot between stones, though I''d rather you had one or the other totally in the frame. Still, your colors and mood you''ve built here are very effective in eliciting a sacred feeling. Very nice.</td>', 'I see you''ve shot between stones, though I''d rather you had one or the other totally in the frame. Still, your colors and mood you''ve built here are very effective in eliciting a sacred feeling. Very nice.', '2003-11-14 22:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(485948, 45939, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful clarity here! I like the composition and the inclusion of the other lights, though I do wish you''d have moved your camera a little to right to get the entirety of the church. COlors and lighting are marvelous!</td>', 'Wonderful clarity here! I like the composition and the inclusion of the other lights, though I do wish you''d have moved your camera a little to right to get the entirety of the church. COlors and lighting are marvelous!', '2003-11-14 22:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(485949, 46252, 6870, '<td valign="top">The tones and colors here are good at evoking a sacred mood. I''m not sure that mailboxes fit into the term ''sacred,'' but I''ll give you extra points for originality!</td>', 'The tones and colors here are good at evoking a sacred mood. I''m not sure that mailboxes fit into the term ''sacred,'' but I''ll give you extra points for originality!', '2003-11-14 22:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(485950, 46144, 1379, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and textures in this photo, but the angle of the spire lends an unstable quality, as if it''s falling.  Maybe that''s what you intended?</td>', 'I love the colors and textures in this photo, but the angle of the spire lends an unstable quality, as if it''s falling.  Maybe that''s what you intended?', '2003-11-14 22:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(485952, 46014, 6870, '<td valign="top">That tree is an exciting component of this image. I''m not sure what the other things are: grave stones? a city? This can be construed to having a sacred mood, and it is very well balanced.</td>', 'That tree is an exciting component of this image. I''m not sure what the other things are: grave stones? a city? This can be construed to having a sacred mood, and it is very well balanced.', '2003-11-14 22:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(485953, 45665, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting capture, and the tones are so effective in eliciting a sacred feeling. Subtle, lovely, powerful image! 9</td>', 'Nice lighting capture, and the tones are so effective in eliciting a sacred feeling. Subtle, lovely, powerful image! 9', '2003-11-14 22:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(485955, 45918, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and lovely clarity here. I don''t think you need the title to be so didactically ''sacred.'' The photo stands on its own. The mood is clearly sacred. Could use some cropping on the bottom; I can''t see the negative space doing much down there. Very well seen and composed.</td>', 'Nice tones and lovely clarity here. I don''t think you need the title to be so didactically ''sacred.'' The photo stands on its own. The mood is clearly sacred. Could use some cropping on the bottom; I can''t see the negative space doing much down there. Very well seen and composed.', '2003-11-14 22:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(485956, 45441, 1379, '<td valign="top">We visited this place in Reykjavik last spring.  It''s stunning, and you captured a glorious image of it.  Nice idea to use b/w.</td>', 'We visited this place in Reykjavik last spring.  It''s stunning, and you captured a glorious image of it.  Nice idea to use b/w.', '2003-11-14 22:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(485957, 46090, 1379, '<td valign="top">Is this in Albuquerque???  This reminds me of the old (very old) Catholic church down by Tiguex park.  <br/> <br/>What an awesome photo...  That sky looks incredible in this b/w format.  Your use of symmetry is really powerful.  I can''t wait until the challenge ends so I can see where this was taken!</td>', 'Is this in Albuquerque???  This reminds me of the old (very old) Catholic church down by Tiguex park.   What an awesome photo...  That sky looks incredible in this b/w format.  Your use of symmetry is really powerful.  I can''t wait until the challenge ends so I can see where this was taken!', '2003-11-14 22:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(485991, 45700, 9411, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this image, the more amazing it is. Very painterly. 10</td>', 'The more I look at this image, the more amazing it is. Very painterly. 10', '2003-11-15 00:11:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(485992, 45441, 9411, '<td valign="top">I love the feel of this image, the perspective gives a feeling of motion. Very well done. 10</td>', 'I love the feel of this image, the perspective gives a feeling of motion. Very well done. 10', '2003-11-15 00:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(485993, 46221, 9411, '<td valign="top">Exquisite, peaceful shot. Very nice composition. 9</td>', 'Exquisite, peaceful shot. Very nice composition. 9', '2003-11-15 00:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(485994, 45665, 9411, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Great mood and use of light. The composition is outstanding. 10</td>', 'Very nice. Great mood and use of light. The composition is outstanding. 10', '2003-11-15 00:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(485996, 46183, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, the serinity, the peace the DOF, the light is all wonderful.  The only thing I would have doen differently is a slightly tighter crop on the top so the deer was highlighted more.  An 8</td>', 'I love this shot, the serinity, the peace the DOF, the light is all wonderful.  The only thing I would have doen differently is a slightly tighter crop on the top so the deer was highlighted more.  An 8', '2003-11-15 00:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(485998, 46100, 12131, '<td valign="top">Impressive, I love how it looms out of no where.  The style is so Gothic and reminds me of King Arthur, though that''s probably because I''ve been looking at pictures of the Abbey at Glastonbury...Beautiful.</td>', 'Impressive, I love how it looms out of no where.  The style is so Gothic and reminds me of King Arthur, though that''s probably because I''ve been looking at pictures of the Abbey at Glastonbury...Beautiful.', '2003-11-15 00:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(485999, 46230, 12131, '<td valign="top">So, um, how do they get in, it''s very obviously a building.  I can''t tell if the church is there or if this is one picture transposed on another.  Otherwise, it''s cool imagery.</td>', 'So, um, how do they get in, it''s very obviously a building.  I can''t tell if the church is there or if this is one picture transposed on another.  Otherwise, it''s cool imagery.', '2003-11-15 00:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(486000, 46221, 12131, '<td valign="top">Mmm, that is gorgeous.  I love that rock because it brings to mind the word "asunder" and that just sounds so...powerful.  This speaks of a phenominal power and I love that.</td>', 'Mmm, that is gorgeous.  I love that rock because it brings to mind the word "asunder" and that just sounds so...powerful.  This speaks of a phenominal power and I love that.', '2003-11-15 00:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(486001, 45700, 12131, '<td valign="top">Is that an angel reaching down from the sky to someone on earth. This speaks of spiritual battle or divine grace, I''m not sure which but I love it.</td>', 'Is that an angel reaching down from the sky to someone on earth. This speaks of spiritual battle or divine grace, I''m not sure which but I love it.', '2003-11-15 00:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(486032, 45661, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I would like to see the cross with more space on the left of it, and maybe a duotone to the overal image. I''m not sure the purple is helping you here.</td>', 'Nice shot. I would like to see the cross with more space on the left of it, and maybe a duotone to the overal image. I''m not sure the purple is helping you here.', '2003-11-15 01:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(486034, 45918, 4493, '<td valign="top">This is a wildly done shot on DPC. I like the sue of black and white. I think you have oversharpened your image, as you have halo''s around the drops. The drop off center adds to the interest.</td>', 'This is a wildly done shot on DPC. I like the sue of black and white. I think you have oversharpened your image, as you have halo''s around the drops. The drop off center adds to the interest.', '2003-11-15 01:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(486037, 45945, 4493, '<td valign="top">Not really sure what all this means. I''m sure it has a sacred value to you. The overall shot is nice. Your white balance is good. I think that the straight on camera angle doesn''t make for a very imaginitive shot.</td>', 'Not really sure what all this means. I''m sure it has a sacred value to you. The overall shot is nice. Your white balance is good. I think that the straight on camera angle doesn''t make for a very imaginitive shot.', '2003-11-15 02:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(486038, 45973, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset. Not sure why the ships are included. Walk around and try to find an angle that has a background that helps accentuate your sunset.</td>', 'Nice sunset. Not sure why the ships are included. Walk around and try to find an angle that has a background that helps accentuate your sunset.', '2003-11-15 02:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(486041, 46149, 7151, '<td valign="top">Aesthetically, something just doesn''t quite click for me.  Not sure if it''s lighting, perspective - maybe contrast or tone?  Just feels a little flat.  But a sort of bold idea for the challenge, though to be picky, there''s nothing particularly sacred about this place, just some of the references.  But it''s unique.</td>', 'Aesthetically, something just doesn''t quite click for me.  Not sure if it''s lighting, perspective - maybe contrast or tone?  Just feels a little flat.  But a sort of bold idea for the challenge, though to be picky, there''s nothing particularly sacred about this place, just some of the references.  But it''s unique.', '2003-11-15 02:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(486043, 45379, 7151, '<td valign="top">Ya know, since I lead worship, at heart my first response is to want to favor this shot.  But a couple of things bother me about it, primarily revolving around the fact that 1) it looks very staged (if not, sorry, but that''s how it comes across), and 2) it looks more like performance than worship (the smoke and lighting in particular).  Though, the lighting is very striking and well captured.  Nice effort, but emotionally it just doesn''t deliver for me.</td>', 'Ya know, since I lead worship, at heart my first response is to want to favor this shot.  But a couple of things bother me about it, primarily revolving around the fact that 1) it looks very staged (if not, sorry, but that''s how it comes across), and 2) it looks more like performance than worship (the smoke and lighting in particular).  Though, the lighting is very striking and well captured.  Nice effort, but emotionally it just doesn''t deliver for me.', '2003-11-15 02:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(486044, 46298, 7151, '<td valign="top">Is it me, or are all the headstones crooked?  A good, if common, subject for the challenge.  But the colors and lighting are a bit flat, and the composition is not terribly interesting.  Maybe b&amp;w or duotone might have done something to help the emotion.  Overall, an OK shot.</td>', 'Is it me, or are all the headstones crooked?  A good, if common, subject for the challenge.  But the colors and lighting are a bit flat, and the composition is not terribly interesting.  Maybe b&w or duotone might have done something to help the emotion.  Overall, an OK shot.', '2003-11-15 02:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(486045, 46184, 7151, '<td valign="top">This one had me confused.  At first I assumed it was the Mormon temple in Salt Lake City, UT (USA).  VERY similar architecutre, and we just happened to be visiting there this past Monday.  But going through some of the pictures I took, it appears I was mistaken.  I''d appreciate it if you''d let me know where this is.  :)<br/> <br/>Back to your photo...  Nice, interesting perspective.  I assume it''s rotated 180%, and this reflection is off something on the ground.  The lines give an interesting effect.  I generally like it OK, though it doesn''t really wow me.  Nice, different entry.</td>', 'This one had me confused.  At first I assumed it was the Mormon temple in Salt Lake City, UT (USA).  VERY similar architecutre, and we just happened to be visiting there this past Monday.  But going through some of the pictures I took, it appears I was mistaken.  I''d appreciate it if you''d let me know where this is.  :) Back to your photo...  Nice, interesting perspective.  I assume it''s rotated 180%, and this reflection is off something on the ground.  The lines give an interesting effect.  I generally like it OK, though it doesn''t really wow me.  Nice, different entry.', '2003-11-15 02:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(486048, 46036, 7151, '<td valign="top">Oh, so synical.  A more creative perspective would have had more impact, and better light would have helped.</td>', 'Oh, so synical.  A more creative perspective would have had more impact, and better light would have helped.', '2003-11-15 02:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(486049, 46335, 7151, '<td valign="top">Poignant, nice tone and lighting.  I think that I would have liked a little more context though - pulled back just a couple of feet maybe.  One of the better monument/graveside shots in the challenge.</td>', 'Poignant, nice tone and lighting.  I think that I would have liked a little more context though - pulled back just a couple of feet maybe.  One of the better monument/graveside shots in the challenge.', '2003-11-15 02:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(486050, 45441, 7151, '<td valign="top">Scandinavian or Icelandic?  Nice perspective and framing, great contrast of light and shadow.</td>', 'Scandinavian or Icelandic?  Nice perspective and framing, great contrast of light and shadow.', '2003-11-15 02:57:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(486069, 45379, 2553, '<td valign="top">An interesting photo, I really like the composition, and the way the lighting is done. (Did you intend for it to be red, white, and blue?!- That''s the first thing that struck me!) Love the negative space aspect of the photo.</td>', 'An interesting photo, I really like the composition, and the way the lighting is done. (Did you intend for it to be red, white, and blue?!- That''s the first thing that struck me!) Love the negative space aspect of the photo.', '2003-11-15 05:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(486070, 46164, 2553, '<td valign="top">Love the warm, intimate feeling of the shot that comes across through the lighting, and feel that it conveys the feeling of a sacred place.  I also love wonderful architecture, so this shot definitely appeals to me from that angle as well.  Also like the "soft focus" feel of the shot.</td>', 'Love the warm, intimate feeling of the shot that comes across through the lighting, and feel that it conveys the feeling of a sacred place.  I also love wonderful architecture, so this shot definitely appeals to me from that angle as well.  Also like the "soft focus" feel of the shot.', '2003-11-15 05:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(486071, 45970, 2553, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  The way it fades to black at the top and the bottom is visually appealling to me, and the colors are quite nice.  This makes me think of something exotic like the Australian Outback!</td>', 'Lovely shot.  The way it fades to black at the top and the bottom is visually appealling to me, and the colors are quite nice.  This makes me think of something exotic like the Australian Outback!', '2003-11-15 05:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(486072, 46336, 2553, '<td valign="top">Definitely a sacred place to me.  I would love to have seen this same shot at night, with lights at the entry way to show off the beautiful arches, and inside the church to show off the wonderful stained glass windows.</td>', 'Definitely a sacred place to me.  I would love to have seen this same shot at night, with lights at the entry way to show off the beautiful arches, and inside the church to show off the wonderful stained glass windows.', '2003-11-15 05:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(486073, 46291, 2553, '<td valign="top">What a terrific shot!  It makes the most of the unusual architecture with a minimum of detail.  The lignting for this was just perfect - the negative space aspect of the shot works well to accentuate the subject.  The choice of black and white was perfect for this.</td>', 'What a terrific shot!  It makes the most of the unusual architecture with a minimum of detail.  The lignting for this was just perfect - the negative space aspect of the shot works well to accentuate the subject.  The choice of black and white was perfect for this.', '2003-11-15 05:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(486074, 46090, 2553, '<td valign="top">Great architectural shot!  Love the black and white; this almost looks like a drawing or painting as opposed to a photograph.  This shot is very visually appealing, and moves the eyes fluidly throughout the photo.  The lights and darks are all balanced well with a wonderfully dynamic composition.  The longer I look at it, the more I like it.  I sure hope people take the time to really look at this, it is terrific.</td>', 'Great architectural shot!  Love the black and white; this almost looks like a drawing or painting as opposed to a photograph.  This shot is very visually appealing, and moves the eyes fluidly throughout the photo.  The lights and darks are all balanced well with a wonderfully dynamic composition.  The longer I look at it, the more I like it.  I sure hope people take the time to really look at this, it is terrific.', '2003-11-15 05:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(486075, 46014, 2553, '<td valign="top">I had to sit and look at this shot for the longest time.  I like your composition - there is a nice range of tones that makes is very appealing.  And I like the lonely little tree.  I just cannot get over that huge city sitting there, it just looks so odd.  It absolutely looks like it is in the middle of nowhere!  I''m interested to find out where this shot was taken.</td>', 'I had to sit and look at this shot for the longest time.  I like your composition - there is a nice range of tones that makes is very appealing.  And I like the lonely little tree.  I just cannot get over that huge city sitting there, it just looks so odd.  It absolutely looks like it is in the middle of nowhere!  I''m interested to find out where this shot was taken.', '2003-11-15 05:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(486076, 46221, 2553, '<td valign="top">A wonderful shot that does convey the feeling of a peaceful, sacred place.  Love the colors, and really like the way the composition is set up with the rock and the water having such clarity, and the trees in the background having a very soft feel.  Works beautifully together.  Just me, but I would prefer to see the small bush in the foreground cropped out; I find it distracting, and feel that it takes away from an otherwise perfect shot.</td>', 'A wonderful shot that does convey the feeling of a peaceful, sacred place.  Love the colors, and really like the way the composition is set up with the rock and the water having such clarity, and the trees in the background having a very soft feel.  Works beautifully together.  Just me, but I would prefer to see the small bush in the foreground cropped out; I find it distracting, and feel that it takes away from an otherwise perfect shot.', '2003-11-15 05:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(486077, 46100, 2553, '<td valign="top">I just love fine architecture!  Beautiful lighting, I love how this shot highlights the building without all the overwhelming details.</td>', 'I just love fine architecture!  Beautiful lighting, I love how this shot highlights the building without all the overwhelming details.', '2003-11-15 05:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(486078, 45441, 2553, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective on this, and the choice of black and white, but it seems somewhat dark, and I would like to be able to make out a little more of the detail of the rest of the building.  There seems to be a wonderful arch door there, as well as some interesting lines on the other side of the building.  Overall, a very nice shot though.</td>', 'I love the perspective on this, and the choice of black and white, but it seems somewhat dark, and I would like to be able to make out a little more of the detail of the rest of the building.  There seems to be a wonderful arch door there, as well as some interesting lines on the other side of the building.  Overall, a very nice shot though.', '2003-11-15 05:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(486079, 46340, 2553, '<td valign="top">At first glance, I thought I was looking through the arches of a building!  Very interesting composition on this that conveys a very quiet, solemn feeling.  I''m not sure if this is black and white, or if it just comes across that way due to the way and time of day that it was shot, but the coloring is perfect for the shot.</td>', 'At first glance, I thought I was looking through the arches of a building!  Very interesting composition on this that conveys a very quiet, solemn feeling.  I''m not sure if this is black and white, or if it just comes across that way due to the way and time of day that it was shot, but the coloring is perfect for the shot.', '2003-11-15 05:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(486080, 46263, 2553, '<td valign="top">The light on the trees is beautiful, and I like the way the composition shows them all curving inwardly from the bottom to the top.  The bottom portion of the photo is so dark though, that I really cannot make much out.  I see the little piece of light , but not  much else.  I would like to have been able to make out more interesting details.</td>', 'The light on the trees is beautiful, and I like the way the composition shows them all curving inwardly from the bottom to the top.  The bottom portion of the photo is so dark though, that I really cannot make much out.  I see the little piece of light , but not  much else.  I would like to have been able to make out more interesting details.', '2003-11-15 06:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(486081, 46343, 2553, '<td valign="top">The lower portion of the shot has a soft, relaxed feel, while the top portion seems very "busy".  I find my eyes jumping around, searching for something to rest on, but am continuously distracted by all the things going on in the upper area of the photo.</td>', 'The lower portion of the shot has a soft, relaxed feel, while the top portion seems very "busy".  I find my eyes jumping around, searching for something to rest on, but am continuously distracted by all the things going on in the upper area of the photo.', '2003-11-15 06:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(486083, 46331, 2553, '<td valign="top">I am not crazy about most photos of statues or statuettes, but I find this somewhat appealing.  The color is beautiful, and your lighting is great. I kind of like the repetitive shadows behind the figure, though in some ways, they distract from the main subject since they are so strong.</td>', 'I am not crazy about most photos of statues or statuettes, but I find this somewhat appealing.  The color is beautiful, and your lighting is great. I kind of like the repetitive shadows behind the figure, though in some ways, they distract from the main subject since they are so strong.', '2003-11-15 06:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(486084, 45864, 2553, '<td valign="top">A lovely and interesting architectural shot, your composition is perfect for the lines and angles, and I just love the colors.  The only "nitpick" I have is that I would like to have seen a little more lighting on the dentil molding to give the shot a little more depth.</td>', 'A lovely and interesting architectural shot, your composition is perfect for the lines and angles, and I just love the colors.  The only "nitpick" I have is that I would like to have seen a little more lighting on the dentil molding to give the shot a little more depth.', '2003-11-15 06:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(486085, 46249, 2553, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot with gorgeous color.  Your composition, using the foreground trees to "frame" the church, works well for this shot.</td>', 'Beautiful shot with gorgeous color.  Your composition, using the foreground trees to "frame" the church, works well for this shot.', '2003-11-15 06:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(486087, 46319, 2553, '<td valign="top">How very sad this feels.  Black and white is perfect for this, and I like the perspective of your shot.</td>', 'How very sad this feels.  Black and white is perfect for this, and I like the perspective of your shot.', '2003-11-15 06:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(486090, 46303, 2553, '<td valign="top">I can almost hear the quiet!  This is quite beautiful.  Love all the clouds and mists, and your choice of composition is very engaging.  You must live in a wonderful place.</td>', 'I can almost hear the quiet!  This is quite beautiful.  Love all the clouds and mists, and your choice of composition is very engaging.  You must live in a wonderful place.', '2003-11-15 06:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(486117, 46238, 9550, '<td valign="top">This Photo has very good lighting. I like the shadows very much as well. And your meaning of the photo fits very well.</td>', 'This Photo has very good lighting. I like the shadows very much as well. And your meaning of the photo fits very well.', '2003-11-15 08:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(486155, 45746, 9411, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely composed image. I think the use of a polarizing filter would have helped eliminate the glare which distracts from the overall quality. 5</td>', 'This is a nicely composed image. I think the use of a polarizing filter would have helped eliminate the glare which distracts from the overall quality. 5', '2003-11-15 10:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(486156, 45999, 9411, '<td valign="top">This is one of those images that the viewer must sit with and try and decide if the intent was to have a very soft focus or it was inadvertent. I can''t decide even having viewed it a number of times.  The light is a good element this could be a really good image with a little more work, I feel.  5</td>', 'This is one of those images that the viewer must sit with and try and decide if the intent was to have a very soft focus or it was inadvertent. I can''t decide even having viewed it a number of times.  The light is a good element this could be a really good image with a little more work, I feel.  5', '2003-11-15 10:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(486157, 46261, 9411, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like the balance of sky/water. 6</td>', 'Very nice, I like the balance of sky/water. 6', '2003-11-15 10:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(486163, 45665, 12223, '<td valign="top">This is my highest rated photo of this challenge. I like the architecture, the lighting and the angle of this scene.  Not only does this picture give me a sense of sacred, it also captures "Holiness".  A compelling piece.</td>', 'This is my highest rated photo of this challenge. I like the architecture, the lighting and the angle of this scene.  Not only does this picture give me a sense of sacred, it also captures "Holiness".  A compelling piece.', '2003-11-15 11:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(486173, 46231, 8130, '<td valign="top">I do like this image.  Too bad about the noise, I took the liberty of running it through neat image and think you would have liked the results.  Small technical demerit, but a 6 anyhow.</td>', 'I do like this image.  Too bad about the noise, I took the liberty of running it through neat image and think you would have liked the results.  Small technical demerit, but a 6 anyhow.', '2003-11-15 12:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(486183, 45665, 5313, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I REALLY like this!</td>', 'Wow!  I REALLY like this!', '2003-11-15 13:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(486189, 46219, 12131, '<td valign="top">Impressive church, I like the architecture.  It''s nice seeing it straight down the ilse but I think it might be even more interesting off center.  I liked the to see the spaces behind the columns for instance.</td>', 'Impressive church, I like the architecture.  It''s nice seeing it straight down the ilse but I think it might be even more interesting off center.  I liked the to see the spaces behind the columns for instance.', '2003-11-15 13:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(486190, 46149, 12131, '<td valign="top">You know, that''s a nice added touch, the "I like Pope" in the background.  I can see this as sacred for the idea of being in between worlds and you can ascend or descend depending on your life.  It''s good imagery, but that message is a little obscured by the overall appearance.  Still, good use of the challenge.</td>', 'You know, that''s a nice added touch, the "I like Pope" in the background.  I can see this as sacred for the idea of being in between worlds and you can ascend or descend depending on your life.  It''s good imagery, but that message is a little obscured by the overall appearance.  Still, good use of the challenge.', '2003-11-15 13:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(486191, 46304, 12131, '<td valign="top">I like this but where did you find so many crosses in one place?  I mean, what church is advertising itself so much?  Or is it that several competeing churches?</td>', 'I like this but where did you find so many crosses in one place?  I mean, what church is advertising itself so much?  Or is it that several competeing churches?', '2003-11-15 13:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(486192, 46236, 10686, '<td valign="top">Too Blue and too dark</td>', 'Too Blue and too dark', '2003-11-15 13:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(486194, 46252, 12131, '<td valign="top">You know what scares me about this, I recognize those mailboxes.  They look like they are in a college mailroom.  We even have those color and style keys.  But then, I haven''t seen the mail rooms of other colleges and this could just be a natural occurence of similar mailboxes.  I like the message you give here.  It''s always great when you have the key to connect you with family, friends or even just the world.  I wouldn''t have considered it sacred but then, you get many of the same emotions here that you get in the church and elsewhere.  Nice choice.</td>', 'You know what scares me about this, I recognize those mailboxes.  They look like they are in a college mailroom.  We even have those color and style keys.  But then, I haven''t seen the mail rooms of other colleges and this could just be a natural occurence of similar mailboxes.  I like the message you give here.  It''s always great when you have the key to connect you with family, friends or even just the world.  I wouldn''t have considered it sacred but then, you get many of the same emotions here that you get in the church and elsewhere.  Nice choice.', '2003-11-15 13:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(486197, 46087, 12131, '<td valign="top">Mm, an old church with a dead looking tree in front of it.  Ancient times.  Good look here.  And I love that the surroundings don''t contrast with it but add to the antiquity.</td>', 'Mm, an old church with a dead looking tree in front of it.  Ancient times.  Good look here.  And I love that the surroundings don''t contrast with it but add to the antiquity.', '2003-11-15 13:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(486199, 45455, 10686, '<td valign="top">Interesting juxtaposition, but other than that, the background is out of focus and the red truck is very distracting. The reflection in the window is too dark. It''s also leaning about 5 degrees off of level, makes me feel like I''m falling over.</td>', 'Interesting juxtaposition, but other than that, the background is out of focus and the red truck is very distracting. The reflection in the window is too dark. It''s also leaning about 5 degrees off of level, makes me feel like I''m falling over.', '2003-11-15 13:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(486201, 46144, 10686, '<td valign="top">I know it was intentional, but I''m not sure the off-level works here. Great colors and a beautiful piece of architecture</td>', 'I know it was intentional, but I''m not sure the off-level works here. Great colors and a beautiful piece of architecture', '2003-11-15 13:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(486204, 46287, 10686, '<td valign="top">The grass on the hill is way too bright, hurts my eyes.</td>', 'The grass on the hill is way too bright, hurts my eyes.', '2003-11-15 13:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(486206, 46203, 12131, '<td valign="top">Although it looks like any other chair and the design is somewhat unfriendly, the angle is great because it gives it a magestic feel.  Just possibly, tone down the candles a bit, the one that just peeks over the arm of the chair is a trifle distracting.</td>', 'Although it looks like any other chair and the design is somewhat unfriendly, the angle is great because it gives it a magestic feel.  Just possibly, tone down the candles a bit, the one that just peeks over the arm of the chair is a trifle distracting.', '2003-11-15 13:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(486208, 46288, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I think there is too much greenery at the top and not enough foreground</td>', 'Nice shot, I think there is too much greenery at the top and not enough foreground', '2003-11-15 13:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(486213, 46291, 10686, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot. Wonderful use of symmetric composition to emphasize the static architecture of the building. The B&amp;W is well done too, removing the color further enhances the arching form of the building and the dramatic lighting without the distraction of color.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot. Wonderful use of symmetric composition to emphasize the static architecture of the building. The B&W is well done too, removing the color further enhances the arching form of the building and the dramatic lighting without the distraction of color.', '2003-11-15 13:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(486215, 46202, 10686, '<td valign="top">The foreground elements just need to be more discernible.</td>', 'The foreground elements just need to be more discernible.', '2003-11-15 13:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(486217, 46090, 10686, '<td valign="top">The B&amp;W and the symmetric composition are wonderful here. I am also enjoying the repetition of the cross shape while they contrast their styles</td>', 'The B&W and the symmetric composition are wonderful here. I am also enjoying the repetition of the cross shape while they contrast their styles', '2003-11-15 13:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(486219, 45875, 10686, '<td valign="top">Sky seems too grainy, but a wonderful view.</td>', 'Sky seems too grainy, but a wonderful view.', '2003-11-15 13:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(486220, 45999, 10686, '<td valign="top">Contrast seems muddy and there is a need for some fill light on the foreground</td>', 'Contrast seems muddy and there is a need for some fill light on the foreground', '2003-11-15 13:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(486221, 46014, 10686, '<td valign="top">Dunno what this place is or what the title refers to, but I like this</td>', 'Dunno what this place is or what the title refers to, but I like this', '2003-11-15 13:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(486223, 46199, 10686, '<td valign="top">This has some serious image quality problems</td>', 'This has some serious image quality problems', '2003-11-15 13:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(486227, 46283, 10686, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, but the corner of roof peeking in over the hedge needs to be gone.</td>', 'Interesting subject, but the corner of roof peeking in over the hedge needs to be gone.', '2003-11-15 13:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(486229, 46036, 10686, '<td valign="top">Seems off level, not enought to be intentional, but enough to be distracting. I do like the building.</td>', 'Seems off level, not enought to be intentional, but enough to be distracting. I do like the building.', '2003-11-15 13:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(486231, 46335, 10686, '<td valign="top">The text communicates the message, not the visual elements. I''m not sure that this is any more effective than typing the same words on a piece of paper. I do like the leaves in the foreground</td>', 'The text communicates the message, not the visual elements. I''m not sure that this is any more effective than typing the same words on a piece of paper. I do like the leaves in the foreground', '2003-11-15 13:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(486232, 46035, 10686, '<td valign="top">Very nice, though it might be better if it were in color or maybe a warmer brown tone.</td>', 'Very nice, though it might be better if it were in color or maybe a warmer brown tone.', '2003-11-15 13:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(486233, 45939, 10686, '<td valign="top">Good shot. I might conside cropping the left side just enought to get rid of that one light closest to the camera.</td>', 'Good shot. I might conside cropping the left side just enought to get rid of that one light closest to the camera.', '2003-11-15 13:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(486320, 46252, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good image overall; I would suggest you crop the first left column of mailboxes, while the perspective is good, the OOF degree is distracting, and the perspective distortion is high (it leanes left, whereas the others are straight).  The colors are nice as is the idea, though I think this might have fit better in the infinity challenge or even the book titles.</td>', 'Good image overall; I would suggest you crop the first left column of mailboxes, while the perspective is good, the OOF degree is distracting, and the perspective distortion is high (it leanes left, whereas the others are straight).  The colors are nice as is the idea, though I think this might have fit better in the infinity challenge or even the book titles.', '2003-11-15 15:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(486408, 45391, 7504, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, yes I agree!  Lovely.</td>', 'Ahhh, yes I agree!  Lovely.', '2003-11-15 17:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(486409, 45665, 7504, '<td valign="top">I love the low-key of this, it''s very moody and beautiful.  Nice work!</td>', 'I love the low-key of this, it''s very moody and beautiful.  Nice work!', '2003-11-15 17:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(486411, 46130, 7504, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus on this.  It''s lovely.</td>', 'I like the soft focus on this.  It''s lovely.', '2003-11-15 17:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(486416, 46153, 7504, '<td valign="top">Ah, lovely Logan.  My favorite temple.  Beautiful shot!</td>', 'Ah, lovely Logan.  My favorite temple.  Beautiful shot!', '2003-11-15 18:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(486419, 46215, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great job!<br/>Nice horizon profile, good dark clouds and nice capture of those sunrays.</td>', 'Great job!Nice horizon profile, good dark clouds and nice capture of those sunrays.', '2003-11-15 18:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(486421, 45700, 3032, '<td valign="top">Arrrrrrrrrrrghhhhhhhh, judgement day is here, apocalypse now, the aliens have landed!<br/>Wow, wonderful! It looks like an outerspace gascloud, but the bottom clouds brings things back to the right perspective. Again, wonderful capture.<br/></td>', 'Arrrrrrrrrrrghhhhhhhh, judgement day is here, apocalypse now, the aliens have landed!Wow, wonderful! It looks like an outerspace gascloud, but the bottom clouds brings things back to the right perspective. Again, wonderful capture.', '2003-11-15 18:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(486422, 45665, 3032, '<td valign="top">Love it how the line of better lighted arches lead the eye across the frame,<br/>Very nice exposure and toning, the focus remains on the lighter cross section whereas the darker parts fill in the details so that you know what you are looking at. Lower right and upper left corners are slightly darker, works well. <br/>Nice subtle framing.<br/> <br/>Great job!</td>', 'Love it how the line of better lighted arches lead the eye across the frame,Very nice exposure and toning, the focus remains on the lighter cross section whereas the darker parts fill in the details so that you know what you are looking at. Lower right and upper left corners are slightly darker, works well. Nice subtle framing. Great job!', '2003-11-15 18:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(486423, 46331, 3032, '<td valign="top">Wonderfull how the face stand out. Seems like a bit of soft focus, works really well. <br/>The only distraction is the background. Perhaps using a wider aperture might help, try to blur the background.</td>', 'Wonderfull how the face stand out. Seems like a bit of soft focus, works really well. The only distraction is the background. Perhaps using a wider aperture might help, try to blur the background.', '2003-11-15 18:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(486425, 46303, 3032, '<td valign="top">Love the misty blue tone transitions of those background hills. The fall colors in the foreground add some flavour. Shame about that powerline that runs across the frame.</td>', 'Love the misty blue tone transitions of those background hills. The fall colors in the foreground add some flavour. Shame about that powerline that runs across the frame.', '2003-11-15 18:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(486426, 45912, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting shot, when I first glanced at it it appeared to be two challises or ornate glasses.  But then I saw the candle, the bible, the stair case and pillar.  It''s  well done shot, good composition, the lighting is well done with the window and the contrast is also good.  A slightly tighter crop on the top and bottom would have probably gotten you a 9 from me, as is, an 8</td>', 'This is a very interesting shot, when I first glanced at it it appeared to be two challises or ornate glasses.  But then I saw the candle, the bible, the stair case and pillar.  It''s  well done shot, good composition, the lighting is well done with the window and the contrast is also good.  A slightly tighter crop on the top and bottom would have probably gotten you a 9 from me, as is, an 8', '2003-11-15 18:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(486428, 46221, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot, the calm, serene feeling, a true place to be alone except for that tiny little house in the back!  :) The DOF on this shot is wonderful, the mist rolling in and the reflection of the rock in the water is like a mirror.  The bush in the lower right corner is a bit of a distraction to me and for some reason I think the colors could pop just a tad more.  An 8</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot, the calm, serene feeling, a true place to be alone except for that tiny little house in the back!  :) The DOF on this shot is wonderful, the mist rolling in and the reflection of the rock in the water is like a mirror.  The bush in the lower right corner is a bit of a distraction to me and for some reason I think the colors could pop just a tad more.  An 8', '2003-11-15 18:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(486429, 46237, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is certainly a sacred place to my husband, LOL!  A lovely shot overall, the way the green curves around the shot and the water framing it works very well.  The colors could pop just a tad more and the cropping could be a little tighter on the bottom to me.  An 8</td>', 'This is certainly a sacred place to my husband, LOL!  A lovely shot overall, the way the green curves around the shot and the water framing it works very well.  The colors could pop just a tad more and the cropping could be a little tighter on the bottom to me.  An 8', '2003-11-15 18:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(486430, 46014, 3032, '<td valign="top">What is this? Salt Lake City, Denver?<br/>I like the toning and the composition with the tree, the hills and the city.<br/>It almost makes me wonder if this is real. Give you the benefit of the doubt. 8</td>', 'What is this? Salt Lake City, Denver?I like the toning and the composition with the tree, the hills and the city.It almost makes me wonder if this is real. Give you the benefit of the doubt. 8', '2003-11-15 18:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(486431, 46329, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love this host, the off center, the DOF, the lighting is as close to perfect as it could be, the contrast is also close to perfect and the border is not intrusive and doesn''t take away from the shot.  Started at an 8, moving to a 9</td>', 'I love this host, the off center, the DOF, the lighting is as close to perfect as it could be, the contrast is also close to perfect and the border is not intrusive and doesn''t take away from the shot.  Started at an 8, moving to a 9', '2003-11-15 18:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(486432, 46101, 12448, '<td valign="top">How pretty, the blues, the greens, the whites, the clarity of the windows is amazing.  The only thing I would have done differently or could have made this a 9 or 10 is if the shot was straighter, the spire leans in the shot and it''s a bit distracting and the cropping so the building runs all the way across the bottom of the picture.  An 8</td>', 'How pretty, the blues, the greens, the whites, the clarity of the windows is amazing.  The only thing I would have done differently or could have made this a 9 or 10 is if the shot was straighter, the spire leans in the shot and it''s a bit distracting and the cropping so the building runs all the way across the bottom of the picture.  An 8', '2003-11-15 18:32:27.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(486433, 46237, 3032, '<td valign="top">The strong points of this image are the leading lines of the path and the creeks at the left and right side. Nice color and tone balance. Like it.</td>', 'The strong points of this image are the leading lines of the path and the creeks at the left and right side. Nice color and tone balance. Like it.', '2003-11-15 18:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(486435, 45661, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, the way the rosary weaves through the picture is very nice and the DOF is also very well done, the clarity in the front to the blur in the back.  The only thing that bugs me is the coloring.  The purplish/pink hue hurts this shot to me, I''m thinking more gold or yellow tones for some reason.  An 8</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, the way the rosary weaves through the picture is very nice and the DOF is also very well done, the clarity in the front to the blur in the back.  The only thing that bugs me is the coloring.  The purplish/pink hue hurts this shot to me, I''m thinking more gold or yellow tones for some reason.  An 8', '2003-11-15 18:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(486437, 46202, 2553, '<td valign="top">I like the warm glow, the nice reflections, and the backlight.  At first glance, I thought that I would like to see some of the bottom cropped off, but after coming back to it, I like the feeling of depth that the large dark area at the bottom gives it.  I would rather see both sides cropped in so that your subject fills more of the frame, and doesn''t look so lonely there.  I also don''t care for the white border, it does not seem to complement the shot - (I don''t usually lower my vote for borders).</td>', 'I like the warm glow, the nice reflections, and the backlight.  At first glance, I thought that I would like to see some of the bottom cropped off, but after coming back to it, I like the feeling of depth that the large dark area at the bottom gives it.  I would rather see both sides cropped in so that your subject fills more of the frame, and doesn''t look so lonely there.  I also don''t care for the white border, it does not seem to complement the shot - (I don''t usually lower my vote for borders).', '2003-11-15 18:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(486438, 45391, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very nice, quiet, serene and certainly sacred to many a stressed mother.  I''m not sure I''m thrilled with the crop on this one and the heavy black border on the top and bottom is very distracting.  An 8</td>', 'Very nice, quiet, serene and certainly sacred to many a stressed mother.  I''m not sure I''m thrilled with the crop on this one and the heavy black border on the top and bottom is very distracting.  An 8', '2003-11-15 18:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(486440, 45939, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful church, almost reminds me of Notre Dame!  The lighting is very well done and the clarity of the shot is amazing.  The only thing that could have made this a perfect 10 or raised it to a 9 is a slightly tighter crop, less leaves on the bottom and the trees on the right are a bit distracting.  An 8</td>', 'This is a beautiful church, almost reminds me of Notre Dame!  The lighting is very well done and the clarity of the shot is amazing.  The only thing that could have made this a perfect 10 or raised it to a 9 is a slightly tighter crop, less leaves on the bottom and the trees on the right are a bit distracting.  An 8', '2003-11-15 18:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(486441, 46078, 2553, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I just have to say it:  what I wouldn''t give to see that amazing building without all the distractions in front of it!!  The architecture looks just breathtaking.  As it is...well, I like the composition, and the lighting, and especially the way you''ve captured the very foggy scene so well.  The muted colors work well for the shot.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I just have to say it:  what I wouldn''t give to see that amazing building without all the distractions in front of it!!  The architecture looks just breathtaking.  As it is...well, I like the composition, and the lighting, and especially the way you''ve captured the very foggy scene so well.  The muted colors work well for the shot.', '2003-11-15 18:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(486442, 46249, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot overall but the lack of clarity on any one point is a bit distracting to me.  And the mist in the back, I would have loved to see this on a clear day but sadly Mother Nature doesn''t always work with us, does she?  I love the colors and the way the trees on the top end up framing the tower on the building.  The border is a bit heavy and dark for this shot but not too distracting.  I started this at a 5 but am moving it to a 7</td>', 'This is a lovely shot overall but the lack of clarity on any one point is a bit distracting to me.  And the mist in the back, I would have loved to see this on a clear day but sadly Mother Nature doesn''t always work with us, does she?  I love the colors and the way the trees on the top end up framing the tower on the building.  The border is a bit heavy and dark for this shot but not too distracting.  I started this at a 5 but am moving it to a 7', '2003-11-15 18:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(486444, 45823, 2553, '<td valign="top">I really think that I would love this, except for the distorted perspective.  It has a very "Alice in Wonderland" feel to it that kind of takes away from the feeling of "sacred place". I like the composition, and the way the chapel is in shadow against the backdrop of the sunny sky and trees.  This looks like an adorable little place.</td>', 'I really think that I would love this, except for the distorted perspective.  It has a very "Alice in Wonderland" feel to it that kind of takes away from the feeling of "sacred place". I like the composition, and the way the chapel is in shadow against the backdrop of the sunny sky and trees.  This looks like an adorable little place.', '2003-11-15 18:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(486445, 46234, 12448, '<td valign="top">I almost missed the shadow on the right there, how did you do that????  Very interesting!  The light on the left is a bit harsh and the cropping makes the roofs look like they are leaning, a bit disorienting.  A 5</td>', 'I almost missed the shadow on the right there, how did you do that????  Very interesting!  The light on the left is a bit harsh and the cropping makes the roofs look like they are leaning, a bit disorienting.  A 5', '2003-11-15 18:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(486447, 45830, 12448, '<td valign="top">If they could only talk, heh?  This is a nice shot overall, I like the way the rocks draw you in from the top and take you through the shot and I like the person sitting there in quiet reflection, thinking of the past and showing respect.  The dark corner in the bottom right is a bit distracting, a slightly tighter crop perhaps?  And the shadows from behind are a good play on the light.  I started at a 7 but am moving to an 8</td>', 'If they could only talk, heh?  This is a nice shot overall, I like the way the rocks draw you in from the top and take you through the shot and I like the person sitting there in quiet reflection, thinking of the past and showing respect.  The dark corner in the bottom right is a bit distracting, a slightly tighter crop perhaps?  And the shadows from behind are a good play on the light.  I started at a 7 but am moving to an 8', '2003-11-15 18:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(486448, 46285, 12448, '<td valign="top">Ah, my favorite place, too bad it''s not dark brown and you could have used it for the literalism challenge, LOL!  A nice shot and yes, chocolate is sacred to many, myself included.  The DOF isn''t bad in this shot but the sight itself really isn''t in focus either, seems just a bit off.  A 6</td>', 'Ah, my favorite place, too bad it''s not dark brown and you could have used it for the literalism challenge, LOL!  A nice shot and yes, chocolate is sacred to many, myself included.  The DOF isn''t bad in this shot but the sight itself really isn''t in focus either, seems just a bit off.  A 6', '2003-11-15 18:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(486450, 46265, 10686, '<td valign="top">........</td>', '........', '2003-11-15 18:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(486451, 45379, 12448, '<td valign="top">Smoke, light and lots of mirrors, reminds me of some of the gospel fests I have attended.  The concept is good, the behind the musician shot, I barely saw the guitar in the man''s hands and the different lights on the women is also good.  The lack of any real clarity in any part of the shot throws me just a bit and the way his shadows fall is also off to me, can''t quite say why.  A 5</td>', 'Smoke, light and lots of mirrors, reminds me of some of the gospel fests I have attended.  The concept is good, the behind the musician shot, I barely saw the guitar in the man''s hands and the different lights on the women is also good.  The lack of any real clarity in any part of the shot throws me just a bit and the way his shadows fall is also off to me, can''t quite say why.  A 5', '2003-11-15 18:54:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(486455, 46332, 12448, '<td valign="top">What a pretty dome!  The colors are wonderful and the design is great.  You even get the line effect on the dome part as you should in a shot like this.  The cropping leaves me wanting though, the cutting off of the top and the building on the left are really distracting.  A 6 to start but am raising it to a 7</td>', 'What a pretty dome!  The colors are wonderful and the design is great.  You even get the line effect on the dome part as you should in a shot like this.  The cropping leaves me wanting though, the cutting off of the top and the building on the left are really distracting.  A 6 to start but am raising it to a 7', '2003-11-15 18:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(486456, 45970, 7778, '<td valign="top">What a poignant, apt and well-considered title for this rich and yet so minimal capture. Without this harmonizing addition (title), the image would place itself only a distance away from cliché. With it, the viewer is encouraged to consider him or herself. <br/> <br/>Colour range and contrast are superb. The crop is a little tight (vertically, for what could be a panorama) and a little high for my sense of a perfected composition. The horizon, also, reveals a very slight counterclockwise tilt. Having noted that, this image remains one of two of my favourites in this challenge. I say "Grace".</td>', 'What a poignant, apt and well-considered title for this rich and yet so minimal capture. Without this harmonizing addition (title), the image would place itself only a distance away from cliché. With it, the viewer is encouraged to consider him or herself.  Colour range and contrast are superb. The crop is a little tight (vertically, for what could be a panorama) and a little high for my sense of a perfected composition. The horizon, also, reveals a very slight counterclockwise tilt. Having noted that, this image remains one of two of my favourites in this challenge. I say "Grace".', '2003-11-15 18:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(486457, 46269, 12448, '<td valign="top">I like the concept on this shot, the darkened statue on the left and the mosaic cross on the right.  The light is also well done, the shadow to the light but the cropping is too tight on the right, the one stone got cut off and left me wanting to see it completed.  Also the dark shadow all the way on the left is also a bit distracting.  A 7</td>', 'I like the concept on this shot, the darkened statue on the left and the mosaic cross on the right.  The light is also well done, the shadow to the light but the cropping is too tight on the right, the one stone got cut off and left me wanting to see it completed.  Also the dark shadow all the way on the left is also a bit distracting.  A 7', '2003-11-15 18:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(486458, 46215, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is so pretty, I have seen this effect so many times, the rays of light coming through the clouds and I never get tired of seeing it.  This is a wonderful concept and the overall capture and crop is good.  But the lighting is off a bit, seems there should be much more contrast in this shot and the white areas could pop more.  I like the landscape on the bottom, are those houses?  Really makes you realize just how small we really are at times.  A 7</td>', 'This is so pretty, I have seen this effect so many times, the rays of light coming through the clouds and I never get tired of seeing it.  This is a wonderful concept and the overall capture and crop is good.  But the lighting is off a bit, seems there should be much more contrast in this shot and the white areas could pop more.  I like the landscape on the bottom, are those houses?  Really makes you realize just how small we really are at times.  A 7', '2003-11-15 19:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(486460, 46054, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot but the post processing is a bit too much for my taste.  I''m not sure i like this coloration of this shot and would like to see it in either it''s original color or even a black and white.  A  6 to start but am raising to a 7</td>', 'This is a lovely shot but the post processing is a bit too much for my taste.  I''m not sure i like this coloration of this shot and would like to see it in either it''s original color or even a black and white.  A  6 to start but am raising to a 7', '2003-11-15 19:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(486465, 46202, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is so pretty, I love the quiet feel of the shot.  The lighting on the building is very nice and the bench in the front is a nice touch, it helps break up the bottom of the shot without distracting from it.  I started this at a 7 but am raising to an 8, could be higher but the crops on the sides could be a tad tighter and the white border is a bit distracting.</td>', 'This is so pretty, I love the quiet feel of the shot.  The lighting on the building is very nice and the bench in the front is a nice touch, it helps break up the bottom of the shot without distracting from it.  I started this at a 7 but am raising to an 8, could be higher but the crops on the sides could be a tad tighter and the white border is a bit distracting.', '2003-11-15 19:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(486466, 46288, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot, the motion of the water almost makes me have to go to the bathroom, LOL!  I like the overall composition of the shot and the crop is also well done.  The top seems a bit bright but not too much and a bit more clarity in the rest of the shot would have scored you a 9 or 10, as is, an 8</td>', 'This is a lovely shot, the motion of the water almost makes me have to go to the bathroom, LOL!  I like the overall composition of the shot and the crop is also well done.  The top seems a bit bright but not too much and a bit more clarity in the rest of the shot would have scored you a 9 or 10, as is, an 8', '2003-11-15 19:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(486468, 45237, 12448, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, the dark interior to the bright snow outside.  If the crop was a little tighter on the top, getting rid of the distracting crack in the upper right corner.  An 8</td>', 'I really like this shot, the dark interior to the bright snow outside.  If the crop was a little tighter on the top, getting rid of the distracting crack in the upper right corner.  An 8', '2003-11-15 19:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(486470, 46092, 12448, '<td valign="top">A nice quiet ocean view, very relaxing for some.  I like the composition of this shot, the way the beach runs acroos the lower middle of the shot and the clouds coming at an angle is very good.  A bit brighter and more clarity would have gotten this an 8 or above, as is a 7</td>', 'A nice quiet ocean view, very relaxing for some.  I like the composition of this shot, the way the beach runs acroos the lower middle of the shot and the clouds coming at an angle is very good.  A bit brighter and more clarity would have gotten this an 8 or above, as is a 7', '2003-11-15 19:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(486473, 46263, 12448, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, the way the trees draw your eye up from the edges to meet at the top.  The path bringing you in and taking you to the back of the shot.  The only thing that could be better for me  would be a bit more light on the bottom part, seems just a tad darl,  I like the soft border, works very well.  Started at a 7, raising it to an 8</td>', 'I really like this shot, the way the trees draw your eye up from the edges to meet at the top.  The path bringing you in and taking you to the back of the shot.  The only thing that could be better for me  would be a bit more light on the bottom part, seems just a tad darl,  I like the soft border, works very well.  Started at a 7, raising it to an 8', '2003-11-15 19:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(486474, 46164, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is so pretty, the gold tones and the light coming in the top window is just wonderful.  The different way the pews run helps take you through the whole shot and keep you looking.  The only thing I would have done differently was possibly straighten out the crop on the top or loosen it just a tad so the upper right corner didn''t get cut off like it did.  Also the corp on the left could be just a tad tighter.  Started at a 7 but am going to a 9</td>', 'This is so pretty, the gold tones and the light coming in the top window is just wonderful.  The different way the pews run helps take you through the whole shot and keep you looking.  The only thing I would have done differently was possibly straighten out the crop on the top or loosen it just a tad so the upper right corner didn''t get cut off like it did.  Also the corp on the left could be just a tad tighter.  Started at a 7 but am going to a 9', '2003-11-15 19:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(486475, 46017, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very well compositioned shot, the way the arch meets at the top and draws you around.  But the angel is so small and hard to see , the arch overpowers her.  Also, the angle makes her look like she is looking down the front of her dress, I know that sounds horrible but it does, either that or she''s pregnant because of the roundness and the way her hands are placed.  The contrast is a bit lacking and the color of the door could pop just a bit more.  A 7</td>', 'Very well compositioned shot, the way the arch meets at the top and draws you around.  But the angel is so small and hard to see , the arch overpowers her.  Also, the angle makes her look like she is looking down the front of her dress, I know that sounds horrible but it does, either that or she''s pregnant because of the roundness and the way her hands are placed.  The contrast is a bit lacking and the color of the door could pop just a bit more.  A 7', '2003-11-15 19:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(486476, 46149, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yes it is, isn''t it?  This is a good shot of what is important to one part of our society and an eyesore to another.  An outlet for their creative energy and a plce to call their own while society turns a blind eye and does''t offer solutions to these problems.  I like the shot overall but it seems a tad oversharp and the light is a bit blown out on the right side.  A 7</td>', 'Yes it is, isn''t it?  This is a good shot of what is important to one part of our society and an eyesore to another.  An outlet for their creative energy and a plce to call their own while society turns a blind eye and does''t offer solutions to these problems.  I like the shot overall but it seems a tad oversharp and the light is a bit blown out on the right side.  A 7', '2003-11-15 19:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(486477, 46283, 12448, '<td valign="top">This shot is close to perfect on second looks. only two things are keeping me from giving it a 9 or 10, the roof on the upper right and the wall on the left, a slightly different stance so you could have cropped differently perhaps?  The light is close to perfect, maybe just a tad brighter but the colors and the clarity is fantastice.  Had a 7 but am going to an 8</td>', 'This shot is close to perfect on second looks. only two things are keeping me from giving it a 9 or 10, the roof on the upper right and the wall on the left, a slightly different stance so you could have cropped differently perhaps?  The light is close to perfect, maybe just a tad brighter but the colors and the clarity is fantastice.  Had a 7 but am going to an 8', '2003-11-15 19:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(486480, 45864, 12448, '<td valign="top">This shot is well cropped and set up very well.  The lighting and contrast leaves me a bit wanting though.  The shadows on below the lower ledge and the upper lerft ledge is really noticable and hurts this shot a bit to me.  Perhaps if you had gone black and white or duotone to play on those shadows?  A 7, up from a 6</td>', 'This shot is well cropped and set up very well.  The lighting and contrast leaves me a bit wanting though.  The shadows on below the lower ledge and the upper lerft ledge is really noticable and hurts this shot a bit to me.  Perhaps if you had gone black and white or duotone to play on those shadows?  A 7, up from a 6', '2003-11-15 19:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(486481, 46336, 12448, '<td valign="top">That is so pretty, it looks like an entry way to a lake or pond, how nice!  The flowers on the right are a bit distracting and if you could have shown just a bit more of the lake in the background.  Started at a 6, am going to a 7</td>', 'That is so pretty, it looks like an entry way to a lake or pond, how nice!  The flowers on the right are a bit distracting and if you could have shown just a bit more of the lake in the background.  Started at a 6, am going to a 7', '2003-11-15 19:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(486482, 45945, 12448, '<td valign="top">The star effect is amazing, I love it when candles do that!  The set up on this shot is well thought out and you can tell you took some time to work this out.  Having the knife come in on one side and the feather out on the other is another touch of a well thought shot and very well done.  The disc in the center looks a bit off, like it''s tilting or not quite set right and while I normally like a good star effect, there are just a few too many here for me.  Started at a 67, am raising to an 8</td>', 'The star effect is amazing, I love it when candles do that!  The set up on this shot is well thought out and you can tell you took some time to work this out.  Having the knife come in on one side and the feather out on the other is another touch of a well thought shot and very well done.  The disc in the center looks a bit off, like it''s tilting or not quite set right and while I normally like a good star effect, there are just a few too many here for me.  Started at a 67, am raising to an 8', '2003-11-15 19:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(486483, 45268, 6405, '<td valign="top">The best photo of the challenge,10 !</td>', 'The best photo of the challenge,10 !', '2003-11-15 19:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(486484, 45970, 12448, '<td valign="top">How pretty, the trees, the sunset, the quiet, peaceful feeling.  Ah, can I come pull up a chair?  This is a wonderfully composition and the corpping is verll well done, there seems to be some lines in the upper right corner on my screen, not sure where they are from but it''s not too distracting.  At first glance this shot looks a bit dark so it scored a 7 but after coming back and really looking it goes up to a 9, a tad brighter on the right and you would have scored a 10 :)</td>', 'How pretty, the trees, the sunset, the quiet, peaceful feeling.  Ah, can I come pull up a chair?  This is a wonderfully composition and the corpping is verll well done, there seems to be some lines in the upper right corner on my screen, not sure where they are from but it''s not too distracting.  At first glance this shot looks a bit dark so it scored a 7 but after coming back and really looking it goes up to a 9, a tad brighter on the right and you would have scored a 10 :)', '2003-11-15 19:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(486485, 46187, 12448, '<td valign="top">Your title doesn''t really fit the picture on this one to me but I won''t hold that against you :)  I like this shot, the rushing water, the feeling of motion, the snow on the brand makes a chill run down my spine.  The slightly straighter crop would have worked better for ma nd mayber seein more of where the water is goind in the lower left, a better sense of motion and flow through the shot?  Started at a 7, going to a 9</td>', 'Your title doesn''t really fit the picture on this one to me but I won''t hold that against you :)  I like this shot, the rushing water, the feeling of motion, the snow on the brand makes a chill run down my spine.  The slightly straighter crop would have worked better for ma nd mayber seein more of where the water is goind in the lower left, a better sense of motion and flow through the shot?  Started at a 7, going to a 9', '2003-11-15 19:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(486486, 45993, 12448, '<td valign="top">You have green trees!  I"m JEALOUS!!!! :)  Just kidding, must be wonderful to see sunshine and green leaves in November! :)  I like the idea behind this shot, almost like a hiding place in the trees, looking out on the rest of the world but the contrast between the two is just a bit much, the trees on the outside are almost too bright!  I started at a 7 but am moving this to an 8</td>', 'You have green trees!  I"m JEALOUS!!!! :)  Just kidding, must be wonderful to see sunshine and green leaves in November! :)  I like the idea behind this shot, almost like a hiding place in the trees, looking out on the rest of the world but the contrast between the two is just a bit much, the trees on the outside are almost too bright!  I started at a 7 but am moving this to an 8', '2003-11-15 19:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(486487, 46316, 12448, '<td valign="top">A very nice winding path to take you through the shot, a bench to relax on when you are tired from your journey, a peaceful park to relax in.  Ah yes, my cup of tea to be sure!  I would have cropped just a bit more off the bottom, and a little looser on the left and bumped up the brightness and contrast just a touch.  A 7</td>', 'A very nice winding path to take you through the shot, a bench to relax on when you are tired from your journey, a peaceful park to relax in.  Ah yes, my cup of tea to be sure!  I would have cropped just a bit more off the bottom, and a little looser on the left and bumped up the brightness and contrast just a touch.  A 7', '2003-11-15 19:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(486489, 46201, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea and the framing is well done with the leaves and tree but the size and lack of clarity in any part of the shot really hurts this.  DOF doesn''t work i in this becaus no one part of the shot is in focus.  The coloring is close to perfect and the cropping is very well done.  A 5</td>', 'This is a good idea and the framing is well done with the leaves and tree but the size and lack of clarity in any part of the shot really hurts this.  DOF doesn''t work i in this becaus no one part of the shot is in focus.  The coloring is close to perfect and the cropping is very well done.  A 5', '2003-11-15 19:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(486491, 45665, 7778, '<td valign="top">Dynamic perspective, fine crop (taking into account the respective weights in the image), great rendering and display of this fugue of variable light!<br/> <br/>A profound joy and a model of a photograph!</td>', 'Dynamic perspective, fine crop (taking into account the respective weights in the image), great rendering and display of this fugue of variable light! A profound joy and a model of a photograph!', '2003-11-15 20:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(486495, 46298, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful concept for the challenge and as you can see by the other entries, not the only one with this idea.  I have loved them all because I know how important it can be to remember your past and respect them.  As for this shot, a straighter crop and not so much background would really increase the drama in this shot, the bright sunshine actually hurts a bit on this, a little more subdued lighting would have worked better to give the concept the proper respect.  A 6</td>', 'This is a wonderful concept for the challenge and as you can see by the other entries, not the only one with this idea.  I have loved them all because I know how important it can be to remember your past and respect them.  As for this shot, a straighter crop and not so much background would really increase the drama in this shot, the bright sunshine actually hurts a bit on this, a little more subdued lighting would have worked better to give the concept the proper respect.  A 6', '2003-11-15 20:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(486496, 46153, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely building and the lighting is very dramatic overall on the building.  The trees sadly take so much away from the overall effect of the shot, maybe from a different side or angle?  A 6</td>', 'This is a lovely building and the lighting is very dramatic overall on the building.  The trees sadly take so much away from the overall effect of the shot, maybe from a different side or angle?  A 6', '2003-11-15 20:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(486498, 46261, 12448, '<td valign="top">How pretty!  The fall colors behind the building and the reflections in the glass and off the lake in the front.  I can feel the slight crispness in the air.  This is well shot, the cropping on the top and bottom is perfect, allowing the one tree to be completely seen is a very nice touch.  The cropping on the left is a bit loose, just slightly tighter to cut out the patch of green next to the building, having the slope of the roof take you out of the shot like the wall on the right does.  I started this at a 6 but am going to raise it to an 8</td>', 'How pretty!  The fall colors behind the building and the reflections in the glass and off the lake in the front.  I can feel the slight crispness in the air.  This is well shot, the cropping on the top and bottom is perfect, allowing the one tree to be completely seen is a very nice touch.  The cropping on the left is a bit loose, just slightly tighter to cut out the patch of green next to the building, having the slope of the roof take you out of the shot like the wall on the right does.  I started this at a 6 but am going to raise it to an 8', '2003-11-15 20:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(486534, 46303, 12392, '<td valign="top">Love it...great shot</td>', 'Love it...great shot', '2003-11-15 22:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
