(486974, 46260, 8159, '<td valign="top">I find the grain in the sky distracting in this particular image. A little NeatImage might help clean this up and make it look more "pure".</td>', 'I find the grain in the sky distracting in this particular image. A little NeatImage might help clean this up and make it look more "pure".', '2003-11-16 13:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(486976, 46337, 8159, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The seagull modifier is what really makes this shot in my opinion. There is some banding in the glow around the sun, perhaps from a little too much JPEG compression?</td>', 'Nice composition. The seagull modifier is what really makes this shot in my opinion. There is some banding in the glow around the sun, perhaps from a little too much JPEG compression?', '2003-11-16 13:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(486977, 46181, 8159, '<td valign="top">This looks like an amazing temple. I wish the palm fronts (?) weren''t so dominant in the foreground to allow more of the temple''s detail to show.</td>', 'This looks like an amazing temple. I wish the palm fronts (?) weren''t so dominant in the foreground to allow more of the temple''s detail to show.', '2003-11-16 13:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(486979, 46184, 8159, '<td valign="top">I love the "painted" effect of this image! And the grid lines add a very interesting "modern" effect to the image that contrasts with the classical church architecture. Well done! My only comment is that it looks like a tiny bit of counter-clockwise rotation might have helped align the grid, but probably at the expense of tilting the church too me.</td>', 'I love the "painted" effect of this image! And the grid lines add a very interesting "modern" effect to the image that contrasts with the classical church architecture. Well done! My only comment is that it looks like a tiny bit of counter-clockwise rotation might have helped align the grid, but probably at the expense of tilting the church too me.', '2003-11-16 14:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(486982, 46340, 8159, '<td valign="top">I like the layering in this photo a lot.</td>', 'I like the layering in this photo a lot.', '2003-11-16 14:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(486984, 46252, 1031, '<td valign="top">I hope you end up with one of those yellow cards from the Post Office; "Too Much Mail to fit in Box"</td>', 'I hope you end up with one of those yellow cards from the Post Office; "Too Much Mail to fit in Box"', '2003-11-16 14:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(486986, 45939, 1031, '<td valign="top">A great example of how allowing more editing would help -- I''d apply a perspective correction to straighten out the building on the far right (and the lampposts on the left, but they don''t bother me as much). Everything else looks greta.</td>', 'A great example of how allowing more editing would help -- I''d apply a perspective correction to straighten out the building on the far right (and the lampposts on the left, but they don''t bother me as much). Everything else looks greta.', '2003-11-16 14:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(486995, 46285, 1031, '<td valign="top">That''s one church I might attend regularly; perhaps we can work out an exchange program with my local congregation:<br/><a href="//dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=40970(" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">My Version)</a></td>', 'That''s one church I might attend regularly; perhaps we can work out an exchange program with my local congregation:My Version)', '2003-11-16 14:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(487002, 45830, 1031, '<td valign="top">In an unfortunate coincidence, I just heard a news report about massive vandalism of rare cave formations in Redwood and Kings Canyon National Parks.<br/> <br/>Good job handling a tricky lighting situation.</td>', 'In an unfortunate coincidence, I just heard a news report about massive vandalism of rare cave formations in Redwood and Kings Canyon National Parks. Good job handling a tricky lighting situation.', '2003-11-16 14:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(487004, 46291, 1031, '<td valign="top">Something about the lighting andsharpness make it look almost like an architectural model than a real building.</td>', 'Something about the lighting andsharpness make it look almost like an architectural model than a real building.', '2003-11-16 14:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(487006, 46287, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks a little overexposed in the highlight areas.</td>', 'Looks a little overexposed in the highlight areas.', '2003-11-16 14:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(487012, 45874, 1031, '<td valign="top">Are you referring to the latest disturbing reports regarding binge drinking?</td>', 'Are you referring to the latest disturbing reports regarding binge drinking?', '2003-11-16 14:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(487017, 46261, 1031, '<td valign="top">I know a similar-looking place ... tricky to get it with no people in it!</td>', 'I know a similar-looking place ... tricky to get it with no people in it!', '2003-11-16 14:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(487019, 46230, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I actually like what they did here, but it''s certainly interesting.</td>', 'I''m not sure I actually like what they did here, but it''s certainly interesting.', '2003-11-16 14:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(487034, 46341, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice photo of Orion as well.</td>', 'Nice photo of Orion as well.', '2003-11-16 15:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(487040, 45441, 1031, '<td valign="top">Except for that one arched window on the lower-left, I''d just as readily believe this was a prison building.</td>', 'Except for that one arched window on the lower-left, I''d just as readily believe this was a prison building.', '2003-11-16 15:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(487091, 46078, 7758, '<td valign="top">Excellent work, I love the mood of this shot. Not much to complain about that''s for sure. I love the symmetry too..... I like the way the foggy building in the background mirrors the shape of the two lamps either side of the statue.<br/>Good Luck, Todd.</td>', 'Excellent work, I love the mood of this shot. Not much to complain about that''s for sure. I love the symmetry too..... I like the way the foggy building in the background mirrors the shape of the two lamps either side of the statue.Good Luck, Todd.', '2003-11-16 17:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(487092, 46184, 7758, '<td valign="top">Excellent work. You have make the ''ordinary'' look very interesting. This is something that is often lacking in my own work, so I applaude it in the work of others. Good Luck, Todd. 9.</td>', 'Excellent work. You have make the ''ordinary'' look very interesting. This is something that is often lacking in my own work, so I applaude it in the work of others. Good Luck, Todd. 9.', '2003-11-16 17:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(487184, 45970, 1031, '<td valign="top">Beautiful tones similar to a couple I''ve shot recently, but your''s has much less noise. Excellent sharpening to maintain all the twigs without haloing.</td>', 'Beautiful tones similar to a couple I''ve shot recently, but your''s has much less noise. Excellent sharpening to maintain all the twigs without haloing.', '2003-11-16 19:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(487185, 45874, 10047, '<td valign="top">I worshipped there many times in college, but the photo doesn''t do anything for me. Maybe less white and more details would help.</td>', 'I worshipped there many times in college, but the photo doesn''t do anything for me. Maybe less white and more details would help.', '2003-11-16 19:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(487187, 46115, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''d have tried to pick different visitors -- I think the guy with the drink and the cigarette detract from the mood you''re trying to create. Unless this is a commentary on our transitory and cavalier attitudes ....<br/>Added note: the slight motion blur on his hands fooled me into seeing the objects as different than they are, lending a completely different feel and context to the photo. I''m leaving the original comment as an example of how easy it is to misinterpret what we see, especially if we are looking quickly and superficially.</td>', 'I''d have tried to pick different visitors -- I think the guy with the drink and the cigarette detract from the mood you''re trying to create. Unless this is a commentary on our transitory and cavalier attitudes ....Added note: the slight motion blur on his hands fooled me into seeing the objects as different than they are, lending a completely different feel and context to the photo. I''m leaving the original comment as an example of how easy it is to misinterpret what we see, especially if we are looking quickly and superficially.', '2003-11-16 19:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(487188, 45455, 10047, '<td valign="top">I got the chuch part, but I''m not sure about the state. The photo seems level with the front steps, but the door is at an angle and a little distracting.</td>', 'I got the chuch part, but I''m not sure about the state. The photo seems level with the front steps, but the door is at an angle and a little distracting.', '2003-11-16 19:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(487189, 46221, 10047, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Love the feeling of calm, and the reflection. I can see why this serene place would be sacred to you.</td>', 'Great photo. Love the feeling of calm, and the reflection. I can see why this serene place would be sacred to you.', '2003-11-16 20:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(487192, 45700, 10047, '<td valign="top">Great colors and texture! Hope I can take pictures like this someday.</td>', 'Great colors and texture! Hope I can take pictures like this someday.', '2003-11-16 20:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(487196, 46335, 10047, '<td valign="top">Really well done. A great poem, and the lighting and leaves make it sort of moody.</td>', 'Really well done. A great poem, and the lighting and leaves make it sort of moody.', '2003-11-16 20:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(487204, 46331, 12160, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. I like the lighting, the color and framing. If I could vote I''d give this a 9.</td>', 'Very nice photo. I like the lighting, the color and framing. If I could vote I''d give this a 9.', '2003-11-16 20:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(487206, 45665, 12160, '<td valign="top">One of the best entries in the challenge. 9 if I could vote.</td>', 'One of the best entries in the challenge. 9 if I could vote.', '2003-11-16 20:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(487207, 46153, 12160, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful shot. If I could vote it would be a 9.</td>', 'Very beautiful shot. If I could vote it would be a 9.', '2003-11-16 20:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(487220, 45268, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty shot, the runners on the side bringing you into the shot and taking you to the alter, the almost mirror image in the cropping and the mystical haze on the front window.  The colors are very vibrant and bold, maybe just a bit too bold?  It seems it should be just a bit more subdued? and the cark line across the carpet in the lower part is  abit distracting.  Started with a 7  am going to an 8</td>', 'This is a very pretty shot, the runners on the side bringing you into the shot and taking you to the alter, the almost mirror image in the cropping and the mystical haze on the front window.  The colors are very vibrant and bold, maybe just a bit too bold?  It seems it should be just a bit more subdued? and the cark line across the carpet in the lower part is  abit distracting.  Started with a 7  am going to an 8', '2003-11-16 20:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(487224, 46303, 12448, '<td valign="top">it''s beautiful, reminds me of my home in Montana.  THe colors in the front are very nice and a good contrast to the blue of the mountains of the back.  A slightly tighter cropping across the top and on the left would have made this shot work better for me, too much space there and the mountains just dropped off on that side instead of taking me out of the shot.  A 7</td>', 'it''s beautiful, reminds me of my home in Montana.  THe colors in the front are very nice and a good contrast to the blue of the mountains of the back.  A slightly tighter cropping across the top and on the left would have made this shot work better for me, too much space there and the mountains just dropped off on that side instead of taking me out of the shot.  A 7', '2003-11-16 20:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(487236, 46337, 12448, '<td valign="top">A wonderful shot, very quiet and serene.  I like the colors at first glance, the golden hue of the sky, the reflection on the water, the line of cloud in the sky all works so well, the bird certainly was a lucky break, I had started this at  a 7 because it was so simple, too simple but coming back, I see and I think I understand the simplicity.  Going to a 10 :)</td>', 'A wonderful shot, very quiet and serene.  I like the colors at first glance, the golden hue of the sky, the reflection on the water, the line of cloud in the sky all works so well, the bird certainly was a lucky break, I had started this at  a 7 because it was so simple, too simple but coming back, I see and I think I understand the simplicity.  Going to a 10 :)', '2003-11-16 21:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(487244, 46341, 12448, '<td valign="top">A very nice idea and I really like the lit cross on the left but the tower with the three lights on the right is very distracting.  Maybe a different angle and/or different crop?  Also there is a bit of noise in this shot and it too is distracting.  A 5</td>', 'A very nice idea and I really like the lit cross on the left but the tower with the three lights on the right is very distracting.  Maybe a different angle and/or different crop?  Also there is a bit of noise in this shot and it too is distracting.  A 5', '2003-11-16 21:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(487252, 46319, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot, the black and white works very well for this, the angle is also well done, the way the headstones lead down through the shot is very well done.    The overall shot seems a bit dull though, maybe just a touch more contrack to make it pop a little more?  Just a touch.  I started this at a 6 but am going to an 8</td>', 'This is a lovely shot, the black and white works very well for this, the angle is also well done, the way the headstones lead down through the shot is very well done.    The overall shot seems a bit dull though, maybe just a touch more contrack to make it pop a little more?  Just a touch.  I started this at a 6 but am going to an 8', '2003-11-16 21:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(487254, 46340, 9906, '<td valign="top">I'' really impressed at the layers of detail that you have in this shot.  The longer that you look, the more that yous ee in the distance.  The focus is imbressive also.  At first I thought that the DOF was a little shallow, but then realized that it was the fog giving that impression.  Very nice shot and one of my two faves in this challenge!<br/>TC</td>', 'I'' really impressed at the layers of detail that you have in this shot.  The longer that you look, the more that yous ee in the distance.  The focus is imbressive also.  At first I thought that the DOF was a little shallow, but then realized that it was the fog giving that impression.  Very nice shot and one of my two faves in this challenge!TC', '2003-11-16 21:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(487257, 46230, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool scene!  Where is this?  Western USA???  If it is, it''s going towards the top of places I need to see!  The focus is a touch off but you get bonus for being lucky enough to be near a place like this!  I gotta get the heck outa Michigan for a while!<br/>TC</td>', 'This is a very cool scene!  Where is this?  Western USA???  If it is, it''s going towards the top of places I need to see!  The focus is a touch off but you get bonus for being lucky enough to be near a place like this!  I gotta get the heck outa Michigan for a while!TC', '2003-11-16 21:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(487262, 46272, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful concept on the challenge and the shot is very well done.  The officer looking out on the monument.  The cropping is well done but the border on this shot really hurts it, too heavyfor the overall shot.   The lighting is also a bit off, so sharp in the front and so dull in the back, almost too hazy.  I started this with a 6 but am ending with a 7</td>', 'This is a wonderful concept on the challenge and the shot is very well done.  The officer looking out on the monument.  The cropping is well done but the border on this shot really hurts it, too heavyfor the overall shot.   The lighting is also a bit off, so sharp in the front and so dull in the back, almost too hazy.  I started this with a 6 but am ending with a 7', '2003-11-16 21:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(487264, 45874, 9906, '<td valign="top">I can appreciate the humor involved with this shot (or the seriousness) because I deal with college students all the time.  Almost my entire staff is college students.  However I really can''t say that I can appreciate the ''digital art'' approach to this shot.  If it was done in a more traditional way would I like it?  I can''t say that as the subject material typically isn''t one I wanna put on my wall...<br/>TC</td>', 'I can appreciate the humor involved with this shot (or the seriousness) because I deal with college students all the time.  Almost my entire staff is college students.  However I really can''t say that I can appreciate the ''digital art'' approach to this shot.  If it was done in a more traditional way would I like it?  I can''t say that as the subject material typically isn''t one I wanna put on my wall...TC', '2003-11-16 21:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(487268, 46078, 2170, '<td valign="top">i think this would be stronger as a true black and white, perhaps with higher contrast.  as it is, i do like the symmetry of it quite a bit.</td>', 'i think this would be stronger as a true black and white, perhaps with higher contrast.  as it is, i do like the symmetry of it quite a bit.', '2003-11-16 21:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(487269, 45441, 2170, '<td valign="top">lovely!  i could never pronounce it, but it''s a fantastic shot.  i love the way the light follows the curve of the building.</td>', 'lovely!  i could never pronounce it, but it''s a fantastic shot.  i love the way the light follows the curve of the building.', '2003-11-16 21:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(487270, 45918, 9906, '<td valign="top">While this shot does have some wow factor, the tightness of the crop and lack of detail really detract from it''s appeal!  Also, I think I would like to see it in color.  I do like the tiny drops on the spider webs!<br/>TC</td>', 'While this shot does have some wow factor, the tightness of the crop and lack of detail really detract from it''s appeal!  Also, I think I would like to see it in color.  I do like the tiny drops on the spider webs!TC', '2003-11-16 21:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(487272, 46286, 9906, '<td valign="top">I can understand what you are trying to do with this shot but it''s a bit to ''clinical'' for my taste.  If you played around a little more with angles of lighting and more imaginative posing it would make it much more interesting to look at!</td>', 'I can understand what you are trying to do with this shot but it''s a bit to ''clinical'' for my taste.  If you played around a little more with angles of lighting and more imaginative posing it would make it much more interesting to look at!', '2003-11-16 21:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(487275, 45830, 9906, '<td valign="top">The highlights in this shot are rather blown out and the shadows are to dark making it hard to see any real detail.  Taken during a different time of day with more cooperative light would probably have helped here.<br/>TC</td>', 'The highlights in this shot are rather blown out and the shadows are to dark making it hard to see any real detail.  Taken during a different time of day with more cooperative light would probably have helped here.TC', '2003-11-16 21:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(487277, 45823, 9906, '<td valign="top">I think that the fish-eye lens really takes away from what would be a nice little scene here!<br/>TC</td>', 'I think that the fish-eye lens really takes away from what would be a nice little scene here!TC', '2003-11-16 21:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(487278, 46281, 9906, '<td valign="top">The angle of lighting and the camera angle combined with the darkness of the subject make it hard to pick out the actual shape of this object!  If taken from a higher angle with the light from the side I believe this would be much more interesting!<br/>TC</td>', 'The angle of lighting and the camera angle combined with the darkness of the subject make it hard to pick out the actual shape of this object!  If taken from a higher angle with the light from the side I believe this would be much more interesting!TC', '2003-11-16 21:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(487279, 46287, 9906, '<td valign="top">I really wish that this shot was taken during a different time of day (when the lighting wasn''t so harsh) because it looks like a beautiful scene!  The only thing I would change would be the lighting...<br/>TC</td>', 'I really wish that this shot was taken during a different time of day (when the lighting wasn''t so harsh) because it looks like a beautiful scene!  The only thing I would change would be the lighting...TC', '2003-11-16 21:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(487282, 46100, 9906, '<td valign="top">IMHO this shot is simply too dark.  I would love to see more of the detail of what appears to be a very impressive building!<br/>TC</td>', 'IMHO this shot is simply too dark.  I would love to see more of the detail of what appears to be a very impressive building!TC', '2003-11-16 21:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(487284, 46304, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good composition and use of DOF.  The grain or noise complements this shot; to me that''s unusual.  One technical issue: the right most cross should not have been cut off in this composition.</td>', 'Good composition and use of DOF.  The grain or noise complements this shot; to me that''s unusual.  One technical issue: the right most cross should not have been cut off in this composition.', '2003-11-16 21:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(487286, 46278, 9906, '<td valign="top">This looks like a very nice, cute little church house!  How did you light this up?  Car headlights?  The colors seem to be very dull and uneven making me think that the lighting is inadequate...  If you could reshoot this during the day I would love to see it!<br/>TC</td>', 'This looks like a very nice, cute little church house!  How did you light this up?  Car headlights?  The colors seem to be very dull and uneven making me think that the lighting is inadequate...  If you could reshoot this during the day I would love to see it!TC', '2003-11-16 21:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(487289, 46203, 9906, '<td valign="top">I really wish the backgound was lit better to bring out all the lovely details!<br/>TC</td>', 'I really wish the backgound was lit better to bring out all the lovely details!TC', '2003-11-16 21:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(487290, 45237, 14089, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of positive and negative space.</td>', 'Beautiful use of positive and negative space.', '2003-11-16 21:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(487292, 45379, 12253, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot,  What is it?  My guess would have been an ordinary stage performance to me with the guitar and the red led showing in the background.  (Actually, the first time I saw it I did think that it was a staged "worship". but when I saw the guitar, I was confused.)</td>', 'An interesting shot,  What is it?  My guess would have been an ordinary stage performance to me with the guitar and the red led showing in the background.  (Actually, the first time I saw it I did think that it was a staged "worship". but when I saw the guitar, I was confused.)', '2003-11-16 21:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(487293, 46230, 12253, '<td valign="top">Well exposed and excellent vibrant  colors.  Interesting scene!</td>', 'Well exposed and excellent vibrant  colors.  Interesting scene!', '2003-11-16 21:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(487294, 45970, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice shot; it would have been cool if you could have taken it with the water "aglow" as it sometimes is just around that time (maybe earlier.)</td>', 'Nice shot; it would have been cool if you could have taken it with the water "aglow" as it sometimes is just around that time (maybe earlier.)', '2003-11-16 21:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(487295, 45918, 14089, '<td valign="top">Upside down this photo looks much like a doorway to another land. Nice job with the implied lines and I really enjoy the shapes that are projected on the edge of the large water drop.</td>', 'Upside down this photo looks much like a doorway to another land. Nice job with the implied lines and I really enjoy the shapes that are projected on the edge of the large water drop.', '2003-11-16 21:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(487305, 46203, 12448, '<td valign="top">In the thumbnail I though this might be an electric chair, EEK!  LOL!  But now I see it can be just as scary for some!  A nice shot, well thought out and good lighting.  the clarity is amazing but it could have been cropped just a tad tighter on the top to me.  I started at a5 with first glance but am raising to an 8</td>', 'In the thumbnail I though this might be an electric chair, EEK!  LOL!  But now I see it can be just as scary for some!  A nice shot, well thought out and good lighting.  the clarity is amazing but it could have been cropped just a tad tighter on the top to me.  I started at a5 with first glance but am raising to an 8', '2003-11-16 22:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(487306, 45823, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot but I don''t like the bowed look of the the front.  It''s a bit off to me and the light on the right is a bit too bright.  A 5</td>', 'Very nice shot but I don''t like the bowed look of the the front.  It''s a bit off to me and the light on the right is a bit too bright.  A 5', '2003-11-16 22:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(487308, 46343, 12448, '<td valign="top">I left a comment on this but for some reason it didn''t take!  I like the steam on the faucet, very nice but the soft focus is just a tad too soft for my taste.  Also the angle of the tub top is a bit disorienting to me.  I started at a 6 but am going to a 7</td>', 'I left a comment on this but for some reason it didn''t take!  I like the steam on the faucet, very nice but the soft focus is just a tad too soft for my taste.  Also the angle of the tub top is a bit disorienting to me.  I started at a 6 but am going to a 7', '2003-11-16 22:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(487321, 46144, 9146, '<td valign="top">nice clarity...foucs white ballence, exposure. But why the severe leaning angle. it dosn''t lend anything to the photograph. Also the top of this tower is very interesting If you had more zoom capability to catch detail and another vantage point I think you might have a high scorer.</td>', 'nice clarity...foucs white ballence, exposure. But why the severe leaning angle. it dosn''t lend anything to the photograph. Also the top of this tower is very interesting If you had more zoom capability to catch detail and another vantage point I think you might have a high scorer.', '2003-11-16 22:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(487327, 46028, 9146, '<td valign="top">Exposure is way too dark and white ballence is too blue. you have a lot of obvious lens distortion (keystoning)<br/> <br/>Most likly the lens distortion is the falt of the cam and I don''t know a DPC legal fix for this If anyone offers please pass it on. Most cams have an ajustable white ballance. start palying with yours so you have a beter idea what it can do. Also read your manuel and find the Exposure compensation and ISO. this needed to be bosted up. the danger with boosting upexposure comp is hand and camera shake if your in the position of tring to boost exposure make sure you find something to brace on the hood of your car parked in front or in the car braced on the window would have worked  if you boost ISO you get grain too much reads as noise. flash on most point and shoots wount light up the secen and will  bump doun your exposure comp.<br/> <br/>Because of the keystoning I think this is not a good subject for your camera.<br/> <br/>Good Luck</td>', 'Exposure is way too dark and white ballence is too blue. you have a lot of obvious lens distortion (keystoning) Most likly the lens distortion is the falt of the cam and I don''t know a DPC legal fix for this If anyone offers please pass it on. Most cams have an ajustable white ballance. start palying with yours so you have a beter idea what it can do. Also read your manuel and find the Exposure compensation and ISO. this needed to be bosted up. the danger with boosting upexposure comp is hand and camera shake if your in the position of tring to boost exposure make sure you find something to brace on the hood of your car parked in front or in the car braced on the window would have worked  if you boost ISO you get grain too much reads as noise. flash on most point and shoots wount light up the secen and will  bump doun your exposure comp. Because of the keystoning I think this is not a good subject for your camera. Good Luck', '2003-11-16 22:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(487332, 45441, 7485, '<td valign="top">I sort of remember trying this same angle years ago, but not getting nearly as good results! You have inspired me, I''ll have to try this again next time I''m back in Reykjavík.</td>', 'I sort of remember trying this same angle years ago, but not getting nearly as good results! You have inspired me, I''ll have to try this again next time I''m back in Reykjavík.', '2003-11-16 22:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(487334, 45970, 13728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I like the outline of the trees and their placement in the frame.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I like the outline of the trees and their placement in the frame.', '2003-11-16 22:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(487336, 46221, 13728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photo.  Great reflection.  It almost looks as if the house is about to be swallowed up by the rock.</td>', 'Wonderful photo.  Great reflection.  It almost looks as if the house is about to be swallowed up by the rock.', '2003-11-16 22:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(487337, 46132, 7485, '<td valign="top">Those two bushes (?) at the bottom are just too weird, uncanny resemblance to spiky hairdoos!</td>', 'Those two bushes (?) at the bottom are just too weird, uncanny resemblance to spiky hairdoos!', '2003-11-16 22:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(487338, 46184, 13728, '<td valign="top">I like the way the reflection "draws" the lines of th church.  very nice sot</td>', 'I like the way the reflection "draws" the lines of th church.  very nice sot', '2003-11-16 22:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(487343, 46202, 13728, '<td valign="top">Nice picture I like the bench in the from, but am a little distracted by the blackness in the left side of the picture. Perhaps  a little different crop would have helped.  But then again the picture wouldn''t have balanced out as well.</td>', 'Nice picture I like the bench in the from, but am a little distracted by the blackness in the left side of the picture. Perhaps  a little different crop would have helped.  But then again the picture wouldn''t have balanced out as well.', '2003-11-16 22:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(487345, 45237, 7485, '<td valign="top">I think a tighter crop at top and bottom, to focus more on the trees, would make this a great photo</td>', 'I think a tighter crop at top and bottom, to focus more on the trees, would make this a great photo', '2003-11-16 22:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(487346, 46014, 13728, '<td valign="top">Great perspective .  It does look "out of this worldly"</td>', 'Great perspective .  It does look "out of this worldly"', '2003-11-16 22:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(487349, 45379, 13728, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting effect.  Special effects or definitly not a non-smoking crowd!!</td>', 'Very nice lighting effect.  Special effects or definitly not a non-smoking crowd!!', '2003-11-16 22:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(487352, 46199, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice idea and the lighting and colors are very nice.  But there is nothing that is really grabbing my attention in this shot, the half stones in the front are more distracting than a lead in.  Perhaps if you had at least one of them in the shot completely?  A 5</td>', 'This is a very nice idea and the lighting and colors are very nice.  But there is nothing that is really grabbing my attention in this shot, the half stones in the front are more distracting than a lead in.  Perhaps if you had at least one of them in the shot completely?  A 5', '2003-11-16 23:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(487356, 46278, 12448, '<td valign="top">What a nice little church!  I love the simplicity of it on a whole.  The lighting is very dramatic, the shadows are really well defined.  It''s a bit to bright on the right, almost blown out a bit and the crop seems just off a tad to me, maybe a little tighter on the bottom?  A 6</td>', 'What a nice little church!  I love the simplicity of it on a whole.  The lighting is very dramatic, the shadows are really well defined.  It''s a bit to bright on the right, almost blown out a bit and the crop seems just off a tad to me, maybe a little tighter on the bottom?  A 6', '2003-11-16 23:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(487357, 45875, 13728, '<td valign="top">wow, I want to live there!! Lucky you. Looks cold tho.  Nice reflection, but overall the picture looks a bit over shared or erhaps bitmapped</td>', 'wow, I want to live there!! Lucky you. Looks cold tho.  Nice reflection, but overall the picture looks a bit over shared or erhaps bitmapped', '2003-11-16 23:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(487358, 46121, 12448, '<td valign="top">I like the church, very nice but if that white spot towards the upper right corner is supposed to be the moon, it didn''t really work well for this shot, the stop sign is also a bit distracting.  If it was cropped tighter and the front sign wasn''t in the shot (a different angle possibly?) this wouldhave score an 8 or 9 on technical alone, as is a 6</td>', 'I like the church, very nice but if that white spot towards the upper right corner is supposed to be the moon, it didn''t really work well for this shot, the stop sign is also a bit distracting.  If it was cropped tighter and the front sign wasn''t in the shot (a different angle possibly?) this wouldhave score an 8 or 9 on technical alone, as is a 6', '2003-11-16 23:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(487363, 45875, 12448, '<td valign="top">How pretty!  I love this shot, can''t wait to see where it is!  The reflection of the mountains in the water and the light just coming up over the top of the mountains or setting (hard to tell for me).  The coloring is a bit too purplish for me, not sure if you played with it or not.  Also the clarity could be upped just a tad.  Started at a 6 but am going to an 8</td>', 'How pretty!  I love this shot, can''t wait to see where it is!  The reflection of the mountains in the water and the light just coming up over the top of the mountains or setting (hard to tell for me).  The coloring is a bit too purplish for me, not sure if you played with it or not.  Also the clarity could be upped just a tad.  Started at a 6 but am going to an 8', '2003-11-16 23:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(487366, 46230, 13728, '<td valign="top">Is this sedona, one of my faviorite places.  Love those red rocks</td>', 'Is this sedona, one of my faviorite places.  Love those red rocks', '2003-11-16 23:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(487370, 45918, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot overall!  I love the beads of dew on the spider web and the large droplet.  Almost makes me wonder if it''s natural or if you had a spray bottle handy, LOL!  I''m not sure about the black and white in this shot though I am starting to love balck and white more and more this is just a bit too dark for my taste, I would like to see this one in color.  Started at a 6 but am going to an 8</td>', 'Very cool shot overall!  I love the beads of dew on the spider web and the large droplet.  Almost makes me wonder if it''s natural or if you had a spray bottle handy, LOL!  I''m not sure about the black and white in this shot though I am starting to love balck and white more and more this is just a bit too dark for my taste, I would like to see this one in color.  Started at a 6 but am going to an 8', '2003-11-16 23:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(487371, 46153, 6870, '<td valign="top">Good time of night to photograph this! I like the point of view here; it makes it look grand and important. Lighting gives it a sacred feel. Nice work! 9</td>', 'Good time of night to photograph this! I like the point of view here; it makes it look grand and important. Lighting gives it a sacred feel. Nice work! 9', '2003-11-16 23:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(487374, 45268, 6870, '<td valign="top">Marvelous clarity! Nice tones and mood. 9</td>', 'Marvelous clarity! Nice tones and mood. 9', '2003-11-16 23:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(487375, 45746, 12448, '<td valign="top">Okay, it didn''t take my comment the first time, glitch in the matrix, LOL!<br/>I like this shot overall, the clarity, the sharpness, the colors, the lights, the shadows, but the contrast is just a tad too high for me, if it was down just a notch and the cropping was a little tighter on the left.  Started at a 6 but am going to an 8</td>', 'Okay, it didn''t take my comment the first time, glitch in the matrix, LOL!I like this shot overall, the clarity, the sharpness, the colors, the lights, the shadows, but the contrast is just a tad too high for me, if it was down just a notch and the cropping was a little tighter on the left.  Started at a 6 but am going to an 8', '2003-11-16 23:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(487377, 46164, 6870, '<td valign="top">Pwetty! I love the effect. You manage to retain the nice deep tones in the church, too! 9</td>', 'Pwetty! I love the effect. You manage to retain the nice deep tones in the church, too! 9', '2003-11-16 23:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(487378, 46343, 13728, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  I would have cropped it in a little closer, and it would have been good if you could have actually shown the steam coming up</td>', 'Nice idea.  I would have cropped it in a little closer, and it would have been good if you could have actually shown the steam coming up', '2003-11-16 23:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(487379, 46090, 12448, '<td valign="top">This looks almost like another shot in this challenge, only a different eve under the roof and a different statue on the lower roof, LOL!<br/> <br/>I like this one very much, the contrast is a bit soft to me and the shadows on the bottom room are a bit distracting to me.  I like the shadows created but the heavy black border is a bit too much, if it was a little lighter.  The cropping is very well done.  Started at a 6 but am going to an 8</td>', 'This looks almost like another shot in this challenge, only a different eve under the roof and a different statue on the lower roof, LOL! I like this one very much, the contrast is a bit soft to me and the shadows on the bottom room are a bit distracting to me.  I like the shadows created but the heavy black border is a bit too much, if it was a little lighter.  The cropping is very well done.  Started at a 6 but am going to an 8', '2003-11-16 23:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(487381, 46014, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not sure what you mean by the title but this shot is a bit, not sure what it is but something about it nags me.  I''ll try to figure this out before the end of the challenge, LOL!  I like the expansive nature of the shot and the tree on the left looks very desolate.  The city (?) on the right is what I think is getting to me.  It''s so sharp and clear, as is the foreground.  AHA!  it''s the DOF that is bugging me.  It seems to me that the city should be a bit more blurred or the front should be.  *WHEW*  Glad I figured that out.  I started at a 6 on this but am going to a 7</td>', 'Not sure what you mean by the title but this shot is a bit, not sure what it is but something about it nags me.  I''ll try to figure this out before the end of the challenge, LOL!  I like the expansive nature of the shot and the tree on the left looks very desolate.  The city (?) on the right is what I think is getting to me.  It''s so sharp and clear, as is the foreground.  AHA!  it''s the DOF that is bugging me.  It seems to me that the city should be a bit more blurred or the front should be.  *WHEW*  Glad I figured that out.  I started at a 6 on this but am going to a 7', '2003-11-16 23:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(487382, 46115, 12448, '<td valign="top">I''m not too far from this site (being from Montana originally 600 miles is a short distance for me) and have yet to make it there.<br/> <br/>This is very sacred ground to our nation on a whole and a wonderful idea for thsi challenge.  As for the shot itself, including the people and their emotions is a very good idea but I think I would have liked it more if it showed more of the memorial itself.  The clarity is there as is the lighting,  I started with a 6 am going to a 7</td>', 'I''m not too far from this site (being from Montana originally 600 miles is a short distance for me) and have yet to make it there. This is very sacred ground to our nation on a whole and a wonderful idea for thsi challenge.  As for the shot itself, including the people and their emotions is a very good idea but I think I would have liked it more if it showed more of the memorial itself.  The clarity is there as is the lighting,  I started with a 6 am going to a 7', '2003-11-16 23:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(487383, 46299, 12448, '<td valign="top">How nice of that bird to pose for you! ;)  This is a very pretty shot and the use of negative space is well done on this one because you have the bird in the shot.  The clouds on the tips of the mountains is also a good capture bu the color is a bit wanting, it just seems it could pop just a bit more.  Also the white border is a bit too big for this shot, Started at a 5 am going to an 7</td>', 'How nice of that bird to pose for you! ;)  This is a very pretty shot and the use of negative space is well done on this one because you have the bird in the shot.  The clouds on the tips of the mountains is also a good capture bu the color is a bit wanting, it just seems it could pop just a bit more.  Also the white border is a bit too big for this shot, Started at a 5 am going to an 7', '2003-11-16 23:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(487385, 46114, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot and getting the vases or urns on either side of the bell is a good idea but the roof in the back on the left curves off and the right is straight, a bit distracting to me.  It also seems just a bit bright, maybe a bit less contrast?  Started at a 5, am going to a 7</td>', 'This is a nice shot and getting the vases or urns on either side of the bell is a good idea but the roof in the back on the left curves off and the right is straight, a bit distracting to me.  It also seems just a bit bright, maybe a bit less contrast?  Started at a 5, am going to a 7', '2003-11-16 23:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(487386, 46335, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very nice, good capture.  It seems a bit dull overall though, maybe a touch more contrast?  The cropping is well done and the leaves, I don''t know if you placed them but they are a nice touch.  Started at a 6, going to an 8</td>', 'Very nice, good capture.  It seems a bit dull overall though, maybe a touch more contrast?  The cropping is well done and the leaves, I don''t know if you placed them but they are a nice touch.  Started at a 6, going to an 8', '2003-11-16 23:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(487387, 46304, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful idea with the different crosses, I like the DOF on this shot, bringing your attention to the front cross.  The cutting off of the top of the back cross hurts a bit and the strip of blue on the right is distracting to me.  The border does work well.  I started at a 6 on this, am going to a 7</td>', 'This is a wonderful idea with the different crosses, I like the DOF on this shot, bringing your attention to the front cross.  The cutting off of the top of the back cross hurts a bit and the strip of blue on the right is distracting to me.  The border does work well.  I started at a 6 on this, am going to a 7', '2003-11-16 23:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(487391, 46230, 12448, '<td valign="top">I can see why this had to be validated, LOL!  That building certainly looks like it was placed in there by Photo shop, very nice clarity.<br/> <br/>The angle of the shot threw me off at first and while the clarity and sharpness is there, it''s almost too sharp, you know, too perfect and for me that''s a bit of a minus.  A different angle might have helped, more from the front of the structure possibly.  I started at a 6, am going to an 8</td>', 'I can see why this had to be validated, LOL!  That building certainly looks like it was placed in there by Photo shop, very nice clarity. The angle of the shot threw me off at first and while the clarity and sharpness is there, it''s almost too sharp, you know, too perfect and for me that''s a bit of a minus.  A different angle might have helped, more from the front of the structure possibly.  I started at a 6, am going to an 8', '2003-11-16 23:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(487392, 46331, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super choice of background, and your lighting is simply divine! 9</td>', 'Super choice of background, and your lighting is simply divine! 9', '2003-11-16 23:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(487394, 46238, 12448, '<td valign="top">How true!  This is why I didn''t enter the sacred challenge, it''s not just about the church.  The idea behind this shot is very well thought out and I love the title.  But the darkness on the one side is a bit too much for me.  I like the shadow it throws but not the complete darkness on the left and across the top. I started with a 6 but am raising it to a 7</td>', 'How true!  This is why I didn''t enter the sacred challenge, it''s not just about the church.  The idea behind this shot is very well thought out and I love the title.  But the darkness on the one side is a bit too much for me.  I like the shadow it throws but not the complete darkness on the left and across the top. I started with a 6 but am raising it to a 7', '2003-11-16 23:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(487396, 46035, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! Good tonal range and nice fill of the frame. There is a very slight clarity problem for me, though. You might want to add just a little darkness to your neutrals, or play with curves just a little. Nice work. 8</td>', 'Nicely done! Good tonal range and nice fill of the frame. There is a very slight clarity problem for me, though. You might want to add just a little darkness to your neutrals, or play with curves just a little. Nice work. 8', '2003-11-16 23:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(487397, 46285, 6668, '<td valign="top">Don''t care for this border with this shot.</td>', 'Don''t care for this border with this shot.', '2003-11-16 23:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(487398, 46217, 12448, '<td valign="top">A very nice idea, the colors are a bit dull and there is too much darkness across the bottom for my taste.  A tighter crop and just a little more adjustment on the brightness and contrast would have really made this shot pop.  A 5</td>', 'A very nice idea, the colors are a bit dull and there is too much darkness across the bottom for my taste.  A tighter crop and just a little more adjustment on the brightness and contrast would have really made this shot pop.  A 5', '2003-11-16 23:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(487399, 46090, 6668, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting, composition and framing, stunning picture, love the black and white as well. Nice work. 10</td>', 'Beautiful lighting, composition and framing, stunning picture, love the black and white as well. Nice work. 10', '2003-11-16 23:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(487400, 46115, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice journalistic image. Nice transitional moment for this family.</td>', 'Nice journalistic image. Nice transitional moment for this family.', '2003-11-16 23:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(487401, 46343, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the steamy nature of this shot, the angle and the composition. Nicely done!</td>', 'I like the steamy nature of this shot, the angle and the composition. Nicely done!', '2003-11-16 23:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(487403, 46340, 12448, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this shot, just not sure about the final product.  The shot seems a bit dull to me and maybe that is what you were going for, a more subdued shot but the color makes me want to see just a bit more contrast.  Also the crop could be just a tad tighter on the top for me.  I do like the border also.  Started at a 5, am moving to a 7</td>', 'I like the idea behind this shot, just not sure about the final product.  The shot seems a bit dull to me and maybe that is what you were going for, a more subdued shot but the color makes me want to see just a bit more contrast.  Also the crop could be just a tad tighter on the top for me.  I do like the border also.  Started at a 5, am moving to a 7', '2003-11-16 23:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(487405, 46238, 6668, '<td valign="top">Like the title and the idea behind the shot, I''m not sure if I care for the table where the church is sitting but still an overall nice shot. 7</td>', 'Like the title and the idea behind the shot, I''m not sure if I care for the table where the church is sitting but still an overall nice shot. 7', '2003-11-16 23:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(487406, 46301, 12448, '<td valign="top">There was something about this shot that bothered me, I mean it has clarity and light but the shadows on the domes is distracting to me and the tree on the right and left are also distracting to me.  I''m thinking a tight crop on that very interesting looking window would look cool or maybe to see it in the daylight without all the shadows.  A 5 to start, a 7 to finish</td>', 'There was something about this shot that bothered me, I mean it has clarity and light but the shadows on the domes is distracting to me and the tree on the right and left are also distracting to me.  I''m thinking a tight crop on that very interesting looking window would look cool or maybe to see it in the daylight without all the shadows.  A 5 to start, a 7 to finish', '2003-11-16 23:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(487407, 46168, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea and the off center works because of the plant on the right.  I think I would have liked to seen a little more open crop on the top to finish out the arch above the statue and just a tad more sharpness on the statue.  Maybe a little higher angle too so you could see more of her face?  Started at a 5, finishing with a 7</td>', 'Very nice idea and the off center works because of the plant on the right.  I think I would have liked to seen a little more open crop on the top to finish out the arch above the statue and just a tad more sharpness on the statue.  Maybe a little higher angle too so you could see more of her face?  Started at a 5, finishing with a 7', '2003-11-16 23:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(487410, 46272, 6668, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, though I feel it would be better without the thick border. 8</td>', 'I really like this shot, though I feel it would be better without the thick border. 8', '2003-11-16 23:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(487411, 46000, 12448, '<td valign="top">I commented on this one already but it never took!  EEK!<br/> <br/>I like the idea and the shot but the crop could have been tighter on the top, leaving the lettering out.  The lines look good taking you across the shot and the angle is also well done, looking down on you as he protects you.  The contrast and brightness could be brought up just a touch to really make the shot pop.  Started at a 5, going to a 6</td>', 'I commented on this one already but it never took!  EEK! I like the idea and the shot but the crop could have been tighter on the top, leaving the lettering out.  The lines look good taking you across the shot and the angle is also well done, looking down on you as he protects you.  The contrast and brightness could be brought up just a touch to really make the shot pop.  Started at a 5, going to a 6', '2003-11-16 23:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(487413, 45441, 12448, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What a building!  I like the line of the roof, the way it curves around and takes you up into the shot and the bright light on the one wall is a nice contrast.  But the contrast in the overall shot is a bit wanting.  I would have liked to seen this in color as well.  A 5 to start, a 7 to finish</td>', 'Wow!  What a building!  I like the line of the roof, the way it curves around and takes you up into the shot and the bright light on the one wall is a nice contrast.  But the contrast in the overall shot is a bit wanting.  I would have liked to seen this in color as well.  A 5 to start, a 7 to finish', '2003-11-16 23:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(487414, 45999, 12448, '<td valign="top">The light peeking over the top is a bit more of a distraction than an addition to this shot, can''t quite place my finger on it.  The shot could be sharpened and less grain and noise.  A 5, changed my mind about the light upon looking again but the lack of focus still bothers me a bit.<br/> <br/>Another look and I''m going to a 7 on this for my final vote :)</td>', 'The light peeking over the top is a bit more of a distraction than an addition to this shot, can''t quite place my finger on it.  The shot could be sharpened and less grain and noise.  A 5, changed my mind about the light upon looking again but the lack of focus still bothers me a bit. Another look and I''m going to a 7 on this for my final vote :)', '2003-11-16 23:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(487415, 45973, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful overall shot and the colors are nice but don''t really pop to me and the black triangle in the lower right corner is a bit distracting to , maybe a slightly tighter crop?  Started with a 5, ending with a 7</td>', 'This is a wonderful overall shot and the colors are nice but don''t really pop to me and the black triangle in the lower right corner is a bit distracting to , maybe a slightly tighter crop?  Started with a 5, ending with a 7', '2003-11-16 23:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(487417, 46111, 12448, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this but all the paper in the background is really distracting as is the line that runs down the left side, I''m guessing this was in a window?  The sharpness could also be touched up a notch.  A 5</td>', 'I like the idea behind this but all the paper in the background is really distracting as is the line that runs down the left side, I''m guessing this was in a window?  The sharpness could also be touched up a notch.  A 5', '2003-11-16 23:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(487418, 46287, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely overall shot but the colors seem a bit dull ovearll at the same time.  A bit more contrast and little less brightness would really make this shot jump out at me.  I like the crop and the overall feel, started at a 5, moving to a 7</td>', 'This is a lovely overall shot but the colors seem a bit dull ovearll at the same time.  A bit more contrast and little less brightness would really make this shot jump out at me.  I like the crop and the overall feel, started at a 5, moving to a 7', '2003-11-16 23:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(487419, 46291, 6668, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgous, perfect lighting, composition, black and white is stunning.  Nice work, hope to see this one at the top.  I give it a 10.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgous, perfect lighting, composition, black and white is stunning.  Nice work, hope to see this one at the top.  I give it a 10.', '2003-11-16 23:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
