(487816, 45441, 472, '<td valign="top">I love that building.  This is the picture I took of it when I was there last March.  This is a clickable link.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.pbase.com/image/14751214" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.pbase.com/image/14751214/small.jpg'', strrpos(''//www.pbase.com/image/14751214/small.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.pbase.com/image/14751214/small.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I love that building.  This is the picture I took of it when I was there last March.  This is a clickable link. ', '2003-11-17 09:07:02.000000', NULL, 0),
