(488332, 46014, 11769, '<td valign="top">Interesting story. I had no idea that was behind the photo. That definitely makes it a sacred place. I had an impression of fall and that lonely tree with the city in the distance made me think of the battle between nature and humanity. Almost as if nature is in its (fall) and mankind is overwhelming it. The story makes it even more poignant</td>', 'Interesting story. I had no idea that was behind the photo. That definitely makes it a sacred place. I had an impression of fall and that lonely tree with the city in the distance made me think of the battle between nature and humanity. Almost as if nature is in its (fall) and mankind is overwhelming it. The story makes it even more poignant', '2003-11-17 18:06:10.000000', NULL, 0),
