(488809, 45945, 12561, '<td valign="top">Merry Meet JoannaDiva.<br/> <br/>congratulations on submitting this image. While we are still living at the tail end of misunderstood Sun God worship (son of god)It is refreshing to see someone acknowledge appreciation of elemental nature.<br/> <br/>I find worshipping humans offensive, but that isn''t what the challenge is all about; it''s about photography! I hope your Pentacle was off centre only because that was your true north!<br/> <br/>Blessed Be.<br/>Witch.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Merry Meet JoannaDiva. congratulations on submitting this image. While we are still living at the tail end of misunderstood Sun God worship (son of god)It is refreshing to see someone acknowledge appreciation of elemental nature. I find worshipping humans offensive, but that isn''t what the challenge is all about; it''s about photography! I hope your Pentacle was off centre only because that was your true north! Blessed Be.Witch. ', '2003-11-18 12:16:36.000000', NULL, 0),
